c from all ports.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> Regulating the subnets inbound/ingress traffic by opening just the ports required by your applications will add an additional layer of security to your VPC and protect against malicious activity such as such as Denial of Service (DoS) attacks or Distributed Denial of Service (DDoS) attacks. Manage your AWS NACL inbound rules to implement the principle of least privilege and reduce the possibility of unauthorized access at the subnet level.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Update your AWS NACL inbound rules configuration in order to allow traffic from specific source port or source port range only.<\/p>","oracle.db.metric.sqlserviceresponsetime.desc":"SQL Service Response Time","plugin.app.sap_abap.metric.spool.service.queue":"Spool Service Queue","al.db.az.rgs":"Resource Group Stats","plugin.app.sap_abap.widget.processchain.chain_id":"Chain ID","smtp.mail.rejected":"Mail has been rejected by the recipient.","threshold.availability.azureservicebustopics":"Performance Thresholds for Azure Service Bus Topic","cl.public.page.form.warn.msg":"Anyone on the internet with the link or code can view this map","apm.section.rum.child.traditional.title":"Traditional Web Application","avg.of365.lync.ft.sessions":"Avg File Transfer Sessions","plugin.app.sap_abap.report.min.wp.upd.stopped":"Min U1 Work Processes Stopped","rbl.domain.and.ipaddress":"Hostnames & IP Addresses","aws.expression.value":"Expression Value","agent.communication.time.not.available":"Agent Communication Time Not Available","oracle.insight.avg.user.io.wait.time":"Average User IO Wait Time","practice.oci.bucket.public.access":"OCI Storage Bucket - Public Access Not Blocked","az.title.networkinterface.avgpacketsizesent":"Avg Packet Size Sent","al.db.ssh.logins":"SSH Login Attempts","lightsail.lb.cookie.duration.sec":"Cookie Duration Seconds","client.gs.ha.synthetic.rbm":"Synthetic Transaction Monitoring","aws.bedrock.agent.resource.role.arn":"Resour