=\"noopener\">Privacy Policy<\/a>","redshift.queries.failed.ctas":"CTAS Queries Failed","vmware.rp.threshold.indiv.rp.overall.memory":"Memory Overall Usage of Child Resource Pool \"{{n0}}\"  {{n1}}GB","alibabacloud_polardbx.logdisksizeofdn":"Log Disk Size of DN","multiple.azure.resource.automation":"Azure Automation Accounts","practice.oci.nlb.empty.or.single.backend.set.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether NLB Backend sets have more than one healthy Backend.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>A Backend set with zero or one Backend provides no redundancy. Any failure of the single Backend results in complete loss of service availability.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Add at least two Backends to each NLB Backend set to ensure high availability.<\/p>","azure.bgp.tab":"BGP","huaweicloud_dcs.instantaneous_input_kbps":"Instantaneous Input Bandwidth","server.cdiscovery.discover.users":"Discover Users","apm.apm-insight.details.tour.3.backbtn.bottom":"<div><h5>Back button<\/h5><div>Go back to view the list of all your monitored applications.<\/div><\/div>","dashboard.responseTime.report.chart.name":"Response Time Detailed Report","kube.etcd.prop.app":"Proposals Applied","practice.oci.adb.adb.mtls.not.required.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether mutual TLS (mTLS) authentication is required for database connections.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>mTLS requires both client and server to authenticate with certificates, providing strong mutual authentication and protection against impersonation attacks.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Enable mTLS requirement for all connections to the Autonomous Database.<\/p>","avg.server.user.phy.mem.usage":"User-wise Avg Physical Memory Utilization","azure.ssl.port":"SSL Port","realbrowser.errorcode.5419":"Unable to locate Element \"{{n0}}\" in step - {{n3}} \"{{n1}}\" from the page \"{{n2}}\" for assert element check","azure.public.ips":"Public IPs","realbrowser.errorcode.5415":