nfo.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks if Amazon WAF Classic rules for Global and Regional types has at least one condition.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>A WAF Global or Regional rule can contain multiple conditions. Condition can be of different types like Geo match, IP address matching, etc. The rule's conditions allow for traffic inspection and take a defined action (allow, block, or count). If none of the conditions are present, the traffic passes without inspection. A WAF rule with no conditions, but with a name or tag suggesting allow, block, or count, could lead to the wrong assumption that one of those actions is occurring.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Consider configuring rules to have at least one condition.<\/p>","azure.contentstorage.policy":"Content Storage Policy","oci.edge.policy.max.name.length.per.argument":"Max Name Length Per Argument","edit.gcp.apphub":"Edit GCP App Hub","apminsight.component.mapview":"Map View","avg.offline.rg":"Avg Offline Resource Groups","kube.replicasets.details":"ReplicaSet Details","biztalkserver.threshold.% send message failures.exceeds":"Send Message Failures Exceeds","oci.listener.path.route":"Path Route Set","committed.nvidia.h100.gpus.per":"Committed Nvidia H100 GPUs per Project Region","docker.anonymous.mem.stats":"Anonymous Memory Statistics","mysqlndb.metric.overallindexmemorytotalaverage.desc":"Average Of Total Index Memory In All Data Nodes","alert.oracle.asm.cnt":"ASM disk count of \"{{n0}}\" {{n1}}.","of365.skype.call.duration":"Skype for Business Call Duration","fsx.vol.delete.cloned.volumes":"Delete Cloned Volumes","fsx.vol.name":"Volume Name","nsx.edit.hostname":"NSX-T Manager Hostname or IP Address","global.nutanix.cluster":"Nutanix Cluster","global.gcp.monitoring":"GCP Monitoring","invalid.block.domain":"Invalid Domain Name","podman.container.monitor.edit":"Edit Podman Container","alibabacloudnatgateway.sessionandconnectionmetrics":"Session and Connection Metrics","gcp.quota.bigqu