ation.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks if service account keys are older than 90 days.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Regular rotation of service account keys limits the window of opportunity for attackers if a key is compromised. Long-lived keys present a security risk, especially if they have been downloaded or shared.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Implement a key rotation policy for service account keys and rotate them at least every 90 days. Consider using alternative authentication methods, like workload identity federation, when possible.<\/p>","cl.nw.trap.processor.autoacknowledgeinterval.one.day":"1 Day","practice.azure.vm.backupVm.name":"VMs not backed up","plugin.app.sap_abap.updaterequest.vbrcl":"VB RCL","iis.pool.gctime":"Garbage Collection Time (%)","sdn.arista.device.cve.count.min":"Min CVE Count","aci.bgp.operational.state":"Operational State","apminsight.helpcard.nodejs.step3Note":"<b>Note: <\/b><a href='https://www.site24x7.com/help/apm/nodejs-agent/Install-Node.js-Agent.html#alternative-methods'>Click here<\/a> to explore the alternative methods (common to all JavaScript types).","practice.azure.aks.enable.image.integrity.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether image integrity is enabled on the AKS cluster.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Enabling image integrity ensures that container images are verified for authenticity before being deployed, ensuring only trusted and signed images are deployed.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Consider enabling image integrity for the AKS cluster.<\/p>","plugin.app.glassfish.edit.port.tooltip":"Specify the port number","alibabacloud_fc.monitor.edit":"Edit Function Compute Monitor","practice.azure.storage.acc.cmk.encryption":"Azure Storage Account - CMK encryption","saas.application.dynamic_crm.url.info":"Please provide your customized Microsoft Dynamics CRM URL here.","global.nodeType":"Node Type","cf.clv.dedicatedhostname":"Dedicated Host Name","apmin