y AWS KMS service, eliminating the need to build and maintain a secure key management infrastructure. Your data is transparently encrypted while being written and transparently decrypted while being read from your database, therefore the encryption process does not require any additional action from you or your application. It's strongly recommended to encrypt your Neptune database instances in order to protect your data and metadata from unauthorized access, and thereby enforce compliance requirements for data-at-rest encryption within your organization.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Enable Encryption for your AWS Neptune database instances.<\/p>","admin-msp.customer-management.customers.tour.1.tabitem.global.user.account.right":"<div><h5>Customize your settings<\/h5><div>View account settings or information related to the organization and customize logos and custom domain to suit your preferences<\/div><\/div>","aws.asg.queued.writes":"Queued Writes","of365.chart.shp.inactivedrivedeploy":"Inactive Drive Deployment","info.transaction.trace.sql.stacktrace.threshold":"Captures stacktraces of SQLs, when the SQL query exceeds this threshold time value.","tools.wpa.txt":"Webpage Speed (Browser)","avg.memory.heap":"Avg Heap Memory","al.fwd.upsell.how.step1.desc":"Bring your own bucket - auth via existing cloud monitor credentials.","app.ibm_i.report.min.maximumjobsinsystem":"Min Maximum Jobs in System","add.apm.key.transaction":"Add APM Business Transaction","oci.opensearch.software.version":"Software Version","settings.account.type":"Account Type","rum.waterfalls.resources.size.exceeds":"Resource size > 100kB","interconnects.per.project":"Interconnects per Project","huaweicloud_obs.capacity_intelligent_tiering_frequent":"Intelligent Tiering - Frequent Access Capacity","azure.metric.DPMProtectedItemCount.disp":"DPM Protected Items Count","huaweicloud_sfs_turbo.used_capacity":"Used Capacity","huaweicloud_elb.l4_con_usage":"L4 Connection Usage","client.ec.memcac