.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Restrict outbound traffic to only required destinations and ports. Implement egress filtering to control what traffic can leave your VPC networks and limit the potential for data exfiltration.<\/p>","az.title.redis.serverload6":"server Load 6","az.title.redis.serverload7":"server Load 7","az.title.redis.serverload8":"server Load 8","az.title.redis.serverload9":"server Load 9","aws.org.title":"AWS Organizations","sdn.celona.org.site.count.max":"Max Site Count","onpremise.linux.instruction":"Copy, paste and execute the below command snippets in your terminal to install Site24x7 On-Premise Poller.","monitor.threshold.availability.profile":"Threshold and Availability Profile","dns.priority.field":"Priority","global.hosting.provider":"Hosting Provider","hyperv.storage.device.name":"Name","oracle.rac.currecblockstime.desc":"Current Received Blocks Time","sdn.common.avg.memory.usage":"Avg Memory Usage","client.marketing.ses.service.bullet1":"There are no Simple Email Services configured in the AWS account.","dm.azstack.chart.alert_overview":"Alert Overview","esx.datastore.used":"Used (GB)","mongodbatlas.node.enable.monitoring.content":"Add this MongoDB Atlas Node for full-fledged monitoring","cl.nf.intfDetails.conversation":"Conversation","threshold.availability.azureaifoundryagent":"Azure AI Foundry Agent Capacity Threshold Profile","huaweicloud_dds.mongo034_bytes_in":"Network Input Throughput","cl.nw.storage.netapp.interface.type":"Interface Type","oracle.db.chart.size":"SGA Size Pie Chart","vmware.vdi.vd.blast.estimated.rtt.ms":"Estimated Round Trip Time (ms)","dc.errorcode.5313":"Ping request timed out.","global.alert.process.handle.exceeds":"Handle count of process \"{{n0}}\" exceeds {{n1}}.","alibabacloud_ehpc.runningjobrequiredmembyproject":"Running Job Required Memory by Project","pricing.po.confirm.purchase":"Thank you for your request. Our sales team will contact you shortly regarding purchasing the required add-ons. For 