bles.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store can help you improve the security posture of your organization. It is recommended to use the Parameter Store to store secrets and credentials instead of directly passing them into your container instances or hard coding them into your code.<\/p>","plugin.app.websphere.jdbc.faults":"Faults","ecs.extra.hosts":"Extra hosts","alibabacloud_mongodb.shardingopdelete":"Sharding Opdelete","alibabacloud_mongodb.opupdatenode":"Opupdatenode","aws.fsx.total.svm":"Total Storage Virtual Machine","apm.comparison.table.header.mobileapm":"Mobile APM","azure.users.select":"Select users you want to add to Site24x7 from Azure.You can also specify roles for the user to provide particular privileges.","saas.application.activecampaign.web.credential.info":"The credential profile helps to ensure enhanced security. Save your ActiveCampaign Sign-In credentials as a profile and then use them for your monitors. For configuration instructions, please refer to the <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/help/admin/configuration-profiles/credential-profile.html\">help documentation<\/a>.","rum.resource.title.avgrt.country":"Response Time by Country","oci.mdb.db.volume.utilization":"Disk Space Utilization","sdn.arubaedgeconnect.topn.sla.fail.count":"IP SLA Probes by Operation Fail Count","restapimetric.monitor.list.metric.count":"Metric Count","alibabacloud_polardb.cluster_com_insert_select":"Cluster COM Insert Select","cl.nw.storage.netapp.pre.failed":"Pre Failed","aws.health.ongoing.events":"Ongoing Events","cl.nw.meraki.help.assist.prerequisites.heading":"Prerequisites","al.ri.mail.subject":"AppLog Reindex Notification","filestore.capacity.type":"GCP Filestore Capacity Planning","cl.server.plugin.groupby.select":"Select any option","azure.metric.sql.statement.execution":"SQL Query Statement Executions","poller.group.chart.title.top.moncount":"Top On-Premise Pollers by Monitors Associated","aws.appsync.unsubscribe.server.