esc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the API Management Service is configured to use the HTTP/2 version.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Using the latest HTTP version ensures better performance by reducing the impact of latency. Older HTTP versions may lack these benefits.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Consider enabling HTTP/2 for the API Management Service.<\/p>","gcp.metric.bytecost.desc":"Byte Cost","process.net.pkt.rt.mp":"Process Network Packet Retransmitted Count (Linux)","standard.bpsv2.family.vcpus":"Standard Bpsv2 Family vCPUs","cl.nw.meraki.vision.monsummary":"Meraki Camera Monitor Summary","saas.application.hubspotcrm.web.credential":"Hubspot CRM Sign-In Credentials","ec2.cwagent.nvidia.memory.used":"Nvidia GPU Memory Used","aws.route53.hostedzone.monitortype.multiple":"Route 53 Hosted Zones","app.ibm_i.report.min.total.jobs":"Min Total Jobs","practice.sns.http.subscription.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks for SNS topics with HTTP endpoint as subscribers.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Amazon Simple Notification Service (SNS) is an asynchronous message delivery service the works on the publisher-subscriber paradigm. When you publish a message to the topic, Amazon SNS sends a POST request delivering the contents of the message to all subscribed endpoints.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>When you subscribe an endpoint, choose HTTPS over HTTP.<\/p>","network.range.startip":"Start IP","azure.adm.step1.content":"Select the subscriptions and resource groups for which you want to perform a health check.","oci.app.total.concurrency.count":"Count (k)","al.logevent.connection.failures":"Connection Failures","problem.stats.not.available":"Stats not available","thirdparty.sdponpremise.prerequisite.txt2":"You must also have a Site24x7 On-Premise Poller installed on the same network from where it can reach ServiceDesk Plus {{n0}}.","client.aws.actions.instance":"Are you sure you want to \"{{n0}}\" the instance?