de.advanced.label":"Advanced Script","global.subscription.amount":"Subscription Amount","avg.huaweicloud_rds_mysql.usage":"Avg","cl.nw.trap.processor.failurecomponent":"Failure Component","alibabacloud_polardbx.cdcdumpereps":"CDC Dumper EPS","wpa.issues.tab.template.30":"A cross-origin resource sharing (CORS) request was blocked because of invalid or missing response headers of the request or the associated preflight request. To fix this issue, ensure the response to the CORS request and/or the associated preflight request are not missing headers and use valid header values. Note that if an opaque response is sufficient, the request's mode can be set to no-cors to fetch the resource with CORS disabled; that way CORS headers are not required but the response content is inaccessible (opaque).","msp.apply.license.cap.advanced":"Define an upper usage limit to restrict advanced monitor usage in the customer account. Once you touch the usage limit, you can't add any more advanced monitors, unless you increase the limit manually. Other customers can still utilize any unused monitors.","wpa.issues.tab.template.31":"A cross-origin resource sharing (CORS) request was blocked because the response to the associated preflight request failed, had an unsuccessful HTTP status code, and/or was a redirect.  To fix this issue, ensure all CORS preflight OPTIONS requests are answered with a successful HTTP status code (2xx) and do not redirect.","wpa.issues.tab.template.32":"A cross-origin resource sharing (CORS) request was blocked because the preflight response did not contain the required Access-Control-Allow-Origin header. The preflight request is sent to determine whether the actual request is safe to send. The absence of this header indicates that the server does not allow the requested origin to access the resource.","rdspi.os.tasks.blocked":"Blocked Tasks","wpa.issues.tab.template.33":"A cross-origin resource sharing (CORS) request was blocked because the response to the preflight request contained headers that are not allowed by the CORS policy. Preflight requests are made by the browser to determine if the actual CORS request is safe to send. If the response to this preflight request includes headers that are not allowed, the browser will block the actual CORS request.","alibabacloud_rds.cluster_innodblogfsync":"Cluster InnoDB Log Fsync","wpa.issues.tab.template.34":"A cross-origin resource sharing (CORS) request was blocked because the response did not include the Access-Control-Allow-Origin header. This header is required for the server to indicate whether the requested resource can be shared with the specified origin.","wpa.issues.tab.template.35":"A cross-origin resource sharing (CORS) request was blocked because it was configured to include credentials and the Access-Control-Allow-Origin response header of the request or the associated preflight request was set to a wildcard *. CORS requests may only include credentials for resources where the Access-Control-Allow-Origin header is not a wildcard. To fix this issue, ensure that either the request is configured to not include credentials, or change the Access-Control-Allow-Origin header of the resource to not be a wildcard. Note that if an opaque response is sufficient, the request's mode can be set to no-cors to fetch the resource with CORS disabled; that way CORS headers are not required but credentials are not sent and the response content is inaccessible (opaque).","zia.task.empty":"No Tasks Found","alibabacloud_sas.vpcpublicipinternetinrate":"VPC Public IP Internet In Rate","alibabacloud_apsaradb_tair.standardotherops":"Standard Other Operations","rule.autodiscover.rp":"Auto Discover Resource Pools","cl.nw.wanrtt.help.assist.intro.two":"Site24x7's WAN monitoring tool can monitor the availability of the destination device and detect delays in round-trip time quickly and efficiently.","oci.postgres.node.endpoint.fqdn":"Endpoint FQDN","global.file.dir":"File and Directory","gcp.clou