bled":"OCI BaseDB System - Diagnostic Collection Disabled","oci.nosql.is.auto.reclaimable":"Auto Reclaimable","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.cpusystem":"Cpusystem","vmware.vdi.server.name.help":"Specify the name of VDI View Connection Server used for identification.","rum.add.allowed.network.urls":"Allowed Network Urls","rum.ttfd":"TTFD","apm.autoscale.disable.msg":"This will disable the Auto Scalling Mode. Are You Sure?","slo.resp.value.number.error":"Response Time should be a number","azure.metric.availabilityresultscount.desc":"Availability Tests","oci.natgw.drops.no.ports":"Drops To NAT Gateway (No Ports)","help.assistant.rmq.content.1":"RabbitMQ is an open-source message broker that supports multiple protocols. Integrating your RabbitMQ with Site24x7 provides real-time insights into your RabbitMQ environment and helps to identify performance bottlenecks for maintaining the reliability, performance, and security of your messaging infrastructure.","cl.nw.ucs.fabric_interconnect.encap.dot1q.ports":"Fabric Interconnect Encap Dot1Q Ports","oci.vault.update.replication.status.chart":"Update Replication Status chart","thirdparty.zanalytics.how.often":"Choose a time frequency for syncing data from Site24x7 with Zoho Analytics.","threshold.3xxerror.rate.exceeds":"3xx Error rate threshold","iis.reports.req.notfound":"Report for Missing Requests","cl.nw.ucs.fault.monitor":"Fault Monitor","vcloud.tenant.memory.usage.percent":"Memory Utilization (%)","azure.metric.c2dmethodsresponseSize.disp":"Response size of direct method invocations","shrpt.oss.serverobjects":"Server Objects","help.assistant.rmq.content.2":"By integrating your RabbitMQ with Site24x7 you can:","help.assistant.rmq.content.3":"<ul><li>Obtain comprehensive monitoring of your RabbitMQ environments.<\/li><li>Gain insights about your monitor brokers, nodes, and queues.<\/li><li>Achieve critical visibility into the data flow of all your queues and identify performance trends.<\/li><li>Monitor every queue in your