ption":"In order to analyze your application logs and identify the exact root cause of the issues, you can make configuration changes by adding logs_enabled, log_type_name, and log_file_path to the plugin configuration file.A log_type_name defines the format in which an application writes logs. Site24x7 supports more than 30 different log types. Additionally, you can also create <a href=\"{{site24x7.globals.help_file_url}}/help/log-management/add-log-type.html#custom-format\" target=\"_blank\">custom log types<\/a>.","redshift.usage.limit.consumed.percentage":"Usage Limit Consumed Percentage","az.title.powerbi.querypooljobqueuelength":"Querypooljobqueuelength","aws.disovery.marketing.whatnew.content.1":"Automate serverless workflows with the Site24x7-AWS Lambda functions URL integration","aws.disovery.marketing.whatnew.content.2":"Monitor Amazon AppStream 2.0 resources","usage.summary.tab.cloud.accounts":"Cloud Accounts","sdn.ubiquitiUnifi.ap.edit.title":"Edit UniFi Access Point","aws.disovery.marketing.whatnew.content.3":"CloudWatch Agent Integration with Amazon EC2 Servers","azure.management.access":"Azure Management Access","openstack.service.zone":"Availability Zone","aws.appstream.feebackurl":"FeedBack URL","kube.kproxy.sync.rul.avg":"Average Sync Proxy Rules Latency","huaweicloud_gaussdb.gaussdb_mysql008_qps":"Queries Per Second","virtual.interface.virtual.gateway.id":"Virtual Gateway ID","sdn.pano.sdwan":"Panorama SDWAN","cl.nw.migration.log.download.failed":"Download Failed","sdn.celona.org.id":"Customer ID","gcp.metric.sqldatacachehitcount.desc":"SQL Data Cache Hit Count","oci.nw.policy.edit":"Edit OCI Network Firewall Policy","alibabacloud_ecs.sysommemmoninfocache":"System Memory Monitor Info Cache","wincls.nwrecon.umqld.report":"Urgent Message Queue Length Delta Report","vpc.subnet.tab":"Subnets","alert.oracle.listener.cprt":"Oracle Listener CPU usage of \"{{n0}}\" {{n1}}%.","al.db.auth0.limit_sul":"Blocked Account","plugin.cfg.memcached.host.info":"Enter