tch in the Type.","aws.cloudwatch.log.first.event.time":"First Event Time","sdn.ubiquitiUnifi.ap.add.title":"Add UniFi Access Point","global.share.this":"Share This","azure.metric.QueryDuration.desc":"DAX Query duration in last interval","country.taiwan":"Taiwan","practice.gcp.fstore.use.cmk.encryption.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether Filestore's customer-managed encryption keys (CMEKs) are configured<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Google Cloud automatically encrypts data stored with Google-managed keys. For additional control, consider using CMEKs through Google Cloud Key Management Service (KMS) for secure key management, rotation, and revocation. Please note that CMEKs are not available for GKE's Basic tier.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Use CMEKs instead of Google-managed encryption keys for greater control and security compliance.<\/p>","slo.monitored.desc":"SLO Monitored","huaweicloud_kafka.current_partitions_usage":"Partition Usage","kube.kproxy.livchk.sts":"Livez Status Check","global.old.view":"Old View","cl.nw.ucs.fabric.interconnect.memAvailable":"Mem Available","vault.key.count":"Key Count","cl.nw.ucs.fabric_extender.server.portsencapnegotiate":"Fabric Extender Server Portsencapnegotiate","winbackup.last.backup.failed.notify":"Notify when Backup Fails","oracle.db.metric.waitclass.cluster.timewaited.desc":"Cluster Time Waited","rum.pageviews.projected":"Projected Pageviews","azure.res.health.config":"Resource Health Alert Configuration","al.lc.alert.lut":"Last Uploaded Time : {{n0}}","global.login.now":"Login Now","backup.data.avg":"Average Backup To S3 - DataFreshness","plugin.group.services":"Services","country.seychelles":"Seychelles","azure.guidance.disabled.running.desc":"We are almost done collecting the best of recommendations for you! Just a few more minutes left.","alibabacloud_oss.total_send_bandwidth":"Total Send Bandwidth","al.query.language.help":"Query Language Help","ecs.updated.at":"Updated At","cl.n