tency","kube.node.condition.lasttransition.time":"Last Transition Time","practice.oci.nsg.unrestricted.outbound.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether Network Security Groups allow unrestricted outbound traffic.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>Unrestricted outbound rules can allow malware or compromised instances to exfiltrate data or communicate with command-and-control servers.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Restrict outbound NSG rules to known destinations and required protocols.<\/p>","cl.nw.voip.reports.topn.rtt.label":"Top N VoIP Monitors by Round-Trip Time","practice.azure.disk.publicly.shareable.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks if public access is enabled from all networks for the managed disk.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>If public access from all networks is enabled, the shared access signature URL can be generated for the managed disk. The generated URL has an expiration time assigned to it at the time of creation. URL makes the managed disk publicly shareable, which can be accessed by any user, leading to unwanted access and data breaches.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Verify if the disk should be publicly shareable, else disable public access to maintain data security and prevent unwanted access.<\/p>","smartdisk.chart.title.firmwareversion":"Disk Firmware Version","tp.client.edit.environment":"Edit Environment","iis.alert.apps.reqfailed.exceeds":"Failed Requests of \"{{n0}}\"  {{n1}}.","cl.nw.voip.help.assist.prereq.1":"The source and the destination devices should be a switch, firewall, or router, and they should both be Cisco devices.","cl.nw.voip.help.assist.prereq.2":"Cisco Internetwork Operating System (IOS) version should be 12.4 or later.","aws.nat.gateway.active.connection":"Active Connection Count","cl.nw.voip.help.assist.prereq.3":"Enable Internet Protocol Service Level Agreement (IPSLA) in the destination device.","prometheus.integration.sample":"To know more details, refer our 