ows_security\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Windows<\/a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/site24x7/plugins/tree/master/linux_security_updates\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Linux<\/a> security plugins (depending on the type of server) in your Site24x7 server agent.<\/p><p><strong>What does it do?<\/strong><\/p><p>These plugins enable proactive security threat monitoring and ensure real-time protection, making them essential for monitoring your systems.<\/p><p>Learn more about these plugins <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/en/kb/articles/new-plugin-added-in-server-agent\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">here<\/a>.<\/p><p><strong>What does this mean for you?<\/strong><\/p><p><span>These essential plugins will be automatically added to your new servers, enabling immediate monitoring. For your existing servers, they will be added in phases.<\/span><\/p><p><span>Note that if your servers already have other plugins installed, these plugins won't be added to avoid licensing changes.<\/span><\/p><p><span>The rollout is scheduled to start in 15 days. To disable this addition for new servers or future deployments, navigate to <\/span><strong>Admin<\/strong><span> &gt; <\/span><strong>Plugin Monitor<\/strong><span> &gt; <\/span><strong>Settings <\/strong><span>&gt; <\/span><strong>Auto discover and add plugins on your server<\/strong><span>, toggle to <\/span><strong>No<\/strong><span>, and they will not be rolled out for your servers.<\/span><\/p><p><span>If you face any issues or need further clarification, reach out to <\/span>support@site24x7.com.<\/p>","alert.mssql.database.statedescription":"Files State Description: \"{{n0}}\".","alibabacloud_gwlb.packetrx":"Packet RX","alibabacloud_rds.mysql_threads_running":"MySQL Threads Running","cl.nw.ucs.fabric_interconnect.transport.ether.ports":"Fabric Interconnect Transport Ether Ports","saas.application.xero.web.credential":"Xero Sign-In Credentials","aw