ed if the \u201Chref/src attribute\u201D is changed to a previously unknown domain name.","client.marketing.defacement.bullet2":"Detect changes to the visible text content and get notified instantly.","client.marketing.defacement.bullet3":"During monitor set up, it automatically detects any dynamic text and script content in the web page; and sets thresholds accordingly. Thresholds can be configured manually, if required.","aws.agentcore.codeinterpreter.start.errors.throttles":"Code Interpreter Start Errors and Throttles","client.marketing.defacement.bullet4":"Monitor upto 10 web pages of your website in a single monitor configuration.","alibabacloud_polardb_oracle.monitor.edit":"Edit PolarDB Oracle Monitor","cl.nw.ucs.fabric.extender.switchPortsoperStateerrordisabled":"Switch Ports Oper State Error Disabled","alibabacloud_apsaradb_hbase.memtotal":"Total Memory","analytics.appln.arn":"Application ARN","user.role.alertmail":"All the users will be able to receive alert emails from the associated monitors.","edit.mongodbatlas.cluster.monitor":"Edit MongoDB Atlas Cluster Monitor","plugin.help.vbscript":"Write custom plugins using VB Script.","cl.metrics.no.data.alert.8011":"Data collection has not happened due to {{n0}}","alibabacloud_rds.pglocalthroughput":"PostgreSQL Local Throughput","alibabacloud_rds.sqlservernetworkread":"SQL Server Network Read","of365.avg.shp.allocdrivesize":"Avg Allocated Drive Size","global.resources":"Resources","sdn.citrixSdwan.site.disk.usage":"Disk Usage","oci.autodb.backup.retention.period":"Automatic backup retention period","iis.app.avg.cacoutputhits":"Avg Cache Output Hits","azure.allocated.ip.addresses":"Allocated Ip Addresses","aws.vpc.ruledetails":"Rules","pdf.cost.month":"Total cost per month","multiple.azure.resource.route.server":"Azure Route Servers","oci.postgres.node.read_throughput.avg":"Average Node Read Kilobytes","client.marketing.cognito.userpool.noresource":"Oops, looks like there are no monitored Cognito User Pools. This