"practice.azure.ml.workspace.cmk.encryption.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the workspace is encrypted with customer-managed keys (CMKs).<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Using CMKs for encryption provides enhanced control over encryption keys and ensures compliance with security and regulatory requirements. It allows you to manage and control the keys used to encrypt sensitive data.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Consider creating a new workspace and encrypting with CMK if full control over the encryption keys, encryption, and decryption process is needed.<\/p>","kinesis.data.put.records.throtlle.records.avg":"Average PutRecords Throtlled Records","kube.vm.monitor.edit":"Edit Kubernetes VM","cl.nw.storage.netapp.shelf.name":"Shelf Name","azure.bulk.vmextension":"Bulk Server Agent Extension Installation","alibabacloud_polardb.pgplsthroughputwrite":"PostgreSQL PLS Throughput Write","aws.valkey.specialized.utility.cmds":"Specialized/Utility Commands","ses.encoding":"Encoding","global.dynamic":"Dynamic","azure.vpncert.not.after":"Expires On","alibabacloud_mongodb.shardingcpusysnode":"Sharding CPU System Node","aws.ec.thread.pool.write.rejected":"Number of Rejected Tasks in the Write Thread Pool","mysql.metric.handler.read.rnd.next.desc":"Handler Read Rnd Next","vmware.vdi.hv.min.active.conn":"Min. Acive Connections","mssql.threshold.lazywrite.exceeds":"Lazy Writes","plugin.app.glassfish.report.heading.total.requests":"Average Total Requests","smtp.connect.failed":"Unable to connect to the \"{{n0}}\".","cl.wlc.ap.delete.scheduled.message":"Access point(s) deletion has been scheduled and will be processed shortly.","apm.section.rum.title":"Real User Monitoring (RUM)","threshold.availability.sgvolume":"Performance Thresholds for Storage Gateway Volumes","reports.outstanding.msg":"Average Outstanding Message","huaweicloud_dds.tab.wiredtiger":"WiredTiger","oci.network.firewall.is.failed":"Is Failed","mysql.errorcode.10003":"Agent servic