"netmon.ga.event.pt1":"We're excited to announce the general availability of our Network Monitoring product today. With this announcement, we deliver unmatched visibility into the full tech stack of monitoring resources right from applications to infrastructure and end users.","netmon.ga.event.pt2":"By default, all our pricing packs will include monitoring of five network interfaces, and you'll need to purchase add-ons to continue monitoring. For those using Network Monitoring from beta onwards, to facilitate the purchase process, you can continue monitoring network interfaces until <b>15th March 2017.<\/b><br><br>For more details on pricing, and add-on options,  please see our <a href=\"/site24x7-pricing.html?server\">Infrastructure pricing plan.<\/a>","sdn.extreme.lldpStateActive.displayname":"LLDP State Active","az.title.registry.runduration":"Run Duration","min.huaweicloud_dcaas_history.usage":"Min","oci.certificate.validity.not.before":"Validity Not Before","rum.graph.components":"Components","oci.app.functions.tab":"Functions","global.netflow.monitor":"NetFlow Monitor","expand.grouped.events":"Expand Grouped Events","practice.gcp.compute.instance.group.auto.healing.disabled.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the instance group's auto-healing configuration is disabled.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Auto-healing helps maintain the health and availability of your managed instance groups by automatically repairing unhealthy VMs. When enabled, Google Cloud regularly checks the health of each instance and recreates instances that fail health checks, ensuring your applications remain available and resilient.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable auto-healing for your managed instance groups to increase application reliability and reduce manual intervention during instance failures.<\/p>","100045":"The provided saved search is not present in this account.","100046":"Please enter a valid logtype in the search query. <a href=''{{n0}}/help/log-management/query-language.html'' target='_blank'>Know more<\/a>.","100047":"AppLogs is not enabled in your account","100048":"You cannot add or edit the Log Profile as AppLogs is disabled in your account.","practice.azure.storage.acc.secure.transfer":"Azure Storage Account - Secure transfer","100049":"AppLogs disabled for this monitor","msp.reports.all.monitors.inventory":"Customer Inventory Report","azure.smb.nonbrowsable":"SMB Non Browsable","apminsight.trace.list.per.page":"List per page","mssql.threshold.loggrowth.exceeds":"Log Growth","nsx.firewall.reject.with.resp.count":"Reject With Response Count","monitored.projects.metrics.scope":"Monitored Projects per Metrics Scope","oci.certificate.notify":"Notify for Certificate status changes","events.ai.debug.consent.desc.eu.dc.4":"We also have the necessary guardrails in place to ensure your data is handled securely and used only for its intended purpose.","azure.filterby.group":"By Resource Group","mobile.push.notification":"Mobile push notification","events.ai.debug.consent.desc.eu.dc.2":"With your consent, the data relevant to your support request is shared with OpenAI which processes data in the United States (USA) and it is used solely for the specific support or debugging task you initiated.","report.mail.huaweicloud_cdn.desc":"Huawei Cloud CDN Monitor","events.ai.debug.consent.desc.eu.dc.3":"It is never used to train or improve any AI model, by Site24x7, or OpenAI. All sensitive data is masked before it is shared with AI. Any field known to carry sensitive information ? email addresses, phone numbers, passwords, API keys, device keys, tokens, and other personal identifiers ? is replaced with *********, and the actual value is never transmitted.","events.ai.debug.consent.desc.eu.dc.1":"We've started leveraging AI to help resolve your support requests faster.","practice.oci.vault.key.not.rotated.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether Vault Keys have been rotated within the recommended period- 90 days.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>Even with rotation enabled, verifying that rotation has actually occurred is critical. A Key that has not been rotated for an extended period increases compromise risk.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Rotate Vault Keys immediately if they have not been rotated within the required period.<\/p>","apminsight.app.alert.metrics.not.captured":"No metrics captured for the application.","al.db.zm.unique.host":"Unique Host ID","dbinsight.blocks.tab.name":"Blocks and Locks","azure.metric.allocatedthroughput.desc":"Pool Allocated Throughput","azurevpngateway.capacity.type":"Azure VPN Gateway Capacity Planning","sdn.ubiquitiUnifi.site.title":"UniFi Site","eks.container.name":"Container Name","connection.minimum.response":"Minimum Response Time (ms)","sdn.arubacentral.sdwan.list.page.info":"Aruba Central Orchestrator Status","docker.terminate.containers.after.info":"Determines how long (in days) the terminated containers have to be retained in the Site24x7 web console before permanent deletion","gpu.monitor.metric.rmap_cor.desc":"Remapped Rows (Correctable)","plugin.mysql.com.insert":"Commit Insert","global.weightage":"Weightage","multiple.gcp.interconnect.monitortype":"GCP Cloud Interconnects","cl.nw.poller.cantselect":"Unable to select any of these On-Premise Pollers.","realbrowser.transactiontime":"Transaction Time","amazon.elb.processedbyte.report":"Processedbytes","oracle.rac.blockslost.desc":"Blocks Lost","alibabacloud_apsaradb_clickhouse.clickhouse_inactive_data_part_count_ee":"Inactive Data Part Count (EE)","practice.azure.function.app.use.managed.identity.desc":"Function apps without managed identity assigned are displayed below.","mysql.instancedetails":"Instance Details","kube.server.deployment":"Server Deployment","multiple.gcp.quota.pubsub":"GCP PubSub Quotas","sdn.mist.ap.topn.rx.bytes":"Juniper Mist APs by Rx Bytes","predefined.report.43.name":"K8s Pod Performance","alibabacloud_polardbx.innodboslogfsy