check is considered a basic monitor. License consumed is one basic monitor for websites and 2 basic monitors for servers.<h6>Website (consumes 1 basic monitor)<\/h6><ul><li>Website (HTTP/HTTPS)<li>REST API, SOAP or WebSocket endpoint<li>DNS, NTP, FTP, or SMTP server<li>Ping check or any TCP/IP port<li>SSL/TLS certificate or domain expiry monitor<li>Real-time Blocklist monitor (10 hostnames)<li>Brand Reputation monitor (10 URLs)<\/ul><h6>Server (consumes 2 basic monitors)<\/h6><ul><li>Windows, Linux, FreeBSD, or OS X server<li>VMware(VMs/ESX/ESXi/Clusters) or Nutanix(Hosts/VMs/Clusters)<li>Docker Host<li>Kubernetes Node<\/ul><h6>Consumes 1 basic monitor<\/h6><ul><li>Microsoft IIS or Windows Server Backup monitor<li>Hadoop<li>Kubernetes<li>Cron monitor (25 Cron jobs)<li>Heartbeat monitor (25 URL endpoints)<li>100+ out-of-the-box Plugins<li>Containers (5 containers will consume 1 basic monitor)<\/ul><h6>Cloud<\/h6><ul><li>AWS EC2 instances, Azure VMs and GCP Compute will consume 2 basic monitors.<li>All other AWS resources, Azure resources and GCP monitors will consume 1 basic monitor<\/ul>","azure.metric.CleanerMemoryShrinkable.disp":"Memory: Cleaner Memory shrinkable","postgresql.replication.cport.desc":"Client Port","dynamodb.reports.max.read.throttle.events":"Maximum Read Throttle Events","alibabacloud_polardb.clusterpreparedstmtutilization":"Cluster Prepared Statement Utilization","proxmox.vm.configuration":"VM Configuration","cf.clv.internetbandwidth":"Internet Bandwidth","sdn.common.min.fib.routes":"Min FIB Routes","global.switcher.toolset":"Toolset","al.fwd.path.prefix.info":"Optional prefix prepended to forwarded log file paths.","lambda.button.txt":"Integrate Lambda Extension","azure.metric.connectedDeviceCount.disp":"Connected devices","esx.noofcpucores":"No of CPU Cores","digitalocean.authtype.provider_id":"Site24x7 OAuth Provider Id","dashboard.widget.maintenance.type":"Maintenance Type","global.tencentcloud_cls.monitortype":"Tencent Cloud - CLS","thirdpar