l class=\"padl20\"><li>Example for a domain verification key: \"<b>site24x7-domain-verification=1234abcd5678EFGH<\/b>\". This whole string must be pasted in the TXT Value field of your DNS Management page.<\/li><li>If your custom domain name is <b>status.zylker.com/ns/services<\/b>, then you must enter the domain verification key in the DNS TXT field for your root domain \"<b>zylker.com<\/b>\"<\/li><\/ul><br>The following indicators help you understand the domain ownership status:<br><br> <span class=\"icon-sttspage-up pull-left\"><\/span><span>: Successfully matched the DNS TXT records to confirm the domain ownership.<\/span><br><br><span class=\"icon-sttspage-down mrgbot50 pull-left\"><\/span><span>: Unable to match the DNS TXT records, hence the domain ownership check has failed. You can't access the status page via the custom domain anymore.<\/span><br><br>","oci.api.gateway.edit":"Edit API Gateway","client.marketing.oci.certificate.noresource":"Oops, looks like there are no monitored Certificates. This may be because of one or more of the following reasons:","ba.funnel.drilldown.no.sessions":"No sessions were recorded for this funnel in the selected time window.","apminsight.nodejs.bgtxnconfigure.helplink":"No background transactions present for the selected time window. Kindly choose another time window. <div class=\"line-ht0\">In case if you have not configured background transactions, <a href=\"{{help}}/apm/nodejs-agent/nodejs-custom-instrumentation.html#Transactions\" target =\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> refer here for instructions<\/a><\/div>","sdn.fmg.fortigate.max.npu.session.count":"Max NPU Session Count","azure.metric.outgoingmpnsbadchannel.disp":"MPNS Bad Channel Error","management.action.readd.info":"Select the monitor you want to re-add. The <b>Re-add<\/b> button will be enabled only if your Azure monitor is active. To activate, click the <b>hamburger<\/b> icon near Management Actions and select <b>Activate<\/b>.<\/br>Note: You can only select up to