t by","aws.rmq.queue.add":"Add RabbitMQ Queue","biztalkserver.threshold.dbconnfailures.exceeds":"Microsoft BizTalk Server DB Connection Failures Threshold","oracle.db.metric.librarycachehitratio.desc":"Library Cache Hit Ratio","reports.downtime.summary":"Monitor Downtime Summary","huaweicloud_apic.monitor.type":"Huawei Cloud APIC","global.unit.epoch":"Epoch (sec)","hyperv.vmstart.tooltip":"VM Start","proxmox.cluster.add":"Add Proxmox Cluster","vault.is.primary":"Is Primary","tools.linkchecker.file.size":"File Size","huaweicloud_sfs.unit":"Unit","view.by":"View by","practice.gcp.vpc.unrestricted.icmp.access.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks for firewall rules that allow unrestricted ICMP traffic from the internet.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Allowing unrestricted ICMP traffic can expose your network to reconnaissance techniques, potential denial-of-service attacks, and ICMP tunneling. While ICMP has legitimate uses for network diagnostics, unrestricted access from the internet is generally unnecessary and increases security risk.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Restrict ICMP traffic to specific trusted IP ranges or internal networks. If external ICMP access is required for specific purposes, implement strict filtering to allow only necessary ICMP types and codes.<\/p>","hadoop.number.live.nodes":"Number of Live Nodes","plugin.nginx.statusurlenable.note":"The NGINX status page will be enabled by adding the stub_status block to the NGINX configuration on your servers.","alibabacloud_ecs.sysomsystemhealthfreqwait":"System Health Frequency Wait","alibabacloud_oss.bucket_requester_qos_max_extranet_upload_bandwidth":"Bucket Requester Qos Max Extranet Upload Bandwidth","ncm.compliance.rule.title":"Compliance Rule","subscriptions.size.enabled.server.info":"<p><b>Server/Cloud Monitoring<\/b><\/p><p><b>Basic Monitors:<\/b><\/p><p><ul><li>Windows/Linux/OS X/FreeBSD Servers (agent based) per host.<\/li><li>Plugin Monitoring<\/li><li>Cron Monitorin