p.discovery.new.isp":"ISP Latency","oci.load.balancer.add":"Add OCI Load Balancer monitor","al.db.unx.shutdown":"Unexpected Shutdown","gcp.internal.backend.response.bytes.error":"{{n0}} : Internal Backend Response Bytes {{n1}}.","rum.help.ttid":"Average time taken by the application to display the initial visible content after a request is made.","sdn.citrixSdwan.sdwan.edit.title":"Edit Citrix SD-WAN","poller.latency.connections.info":"Latest Poll Data","oci.route.capacity.threshold":"Performance Thresholds for OCI API Route","mobile.rbm.device":"Device","r53.disable.healthcheck":"Disable health check","global.update.failed":"Update failed","vmware.alarms.severity.normal":"Number of Alarms in Normal State","client.marketing.s3endpoint.info1":"You can use our built-in API monitoring functionality to periodically run automated checks from geo-distributed locations to proactively monitor the health and performance of your critical S3 Object URLs.","global.server.dsize.threshold.operator":"Notify when Directory Size is","oci.drg.rd.statements":"Number of Statements","al.alerts.custom.function":"Custom Function","alibabacloud_clb.droptrafficrx":"Drop Traffic RX","cl.nw.san.node.monitor":"Node Monitor","hpe.morpheus.server.volume.is.active":"Is Volume Active","cl.nw.ucs.port.admin.state":"Port Admin State","oci.autodb.backup.kms.key.id":"Kms Key Id","al.field.switchlabel.only.field":"Field Only","thirdparty.haloitsm.description":"Integrate Site24x7 with HaloITSM to automatically create, update, and resolve tickets when monitor alerts are triggered.","ncm.advanced.configlet.info.prompt":"The prompt after which the command will be executed.","rum.responseEnd":"responseEnd","device.update.credential":"Update Device Credential(s)","apm.section.individual.child.ruby.description":"Rails, Sinatra, Sidekiq, and more","aws.workspace.associated.service":"Associated Services","sdn.topology.api.url":"API URL","alibabacloud_waf_v3.qpsratio-wafv3":"QPS ratio WAF v3","azure.invalid.clientid.error":"Provide valid Client/Application ID","oci.basedb.storage.allocated":"Storage Allocated","aws.agentcore.browser.session.count":"Session Count","mail.presales.activity.followup.content.2":"<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><p>Hi,<\/p><p>Your 30 day trial account will expire today.<\/p><p>If you do not upgrade now, your monitors will be moved to a suspended state.<\/p><p>Please log in to your account and upgrade now.<\/p><p><b>How to upgrade?<\/b><br>Log in to your Site24x7 account > Admin tab > Subscriptions > Upgrade your account.<\/p><p>If you have any concerns over pricing or if you would want an extension of your trial period, please let me know, I&#39;ll be glad to help.<\/p><p>For a detailed product demo <a href=\"https://{{n2}}/request-demo.html\">register here<\/a>.<\/p><p>{{n1}}<\/p>","alarms.category.other.config":"Alert Configuration","mail.presales.activity.followup.content.3":"<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><p>Hi,<\/p><p>I see your trial period has expired and noticed you haven&#39;t chosen a plan to upgrade.<\/p><p>Is there a specific reason for not upgrading your account? Do you think we could do things better and have you back on-board?<\/p><p>Your concern is our priority, do let me know.<\/p><p>{{n1}}<\/p>","cl.ncm.baseline.running.added":"Added lines","mail.presales.activity.followup.content.1":"<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><p>Hi,<\/p><p>How&#39;re you doing? I&#39;m {{n0}} from Site24x7 support, and I&#39;ll be your point of contact during your evaluation period.<\/p><p>Reach out to me if you have any questions or concerns.<\/p><p>In the meanwhile, here are some quick links to help you get started.<br><a href=\"{{n3}}/getting-started.html\">Getting started with Site24x7<\/a><br><br><a href=\"{{n3}}/getting-started/what-is-a-monitor.html\">What is a monitor?<\/a><\/p><p>Join our live product demo for free by <a href=\"https://{{n2}}/request-demo.html\">registering here<\/a>. We also have an interesting line-up of webinars on various topics for you, <a href=\"https://{{n2}}/webinars.html\">book your spot for free<\/a>.<\/p><p>Add a new <a href=\"{{n3}}/admin/adding-a-monitor/website-monitoring.html\">Website Monitor<\/a> | <a href=\"{{n3}}/admin/adding-a-monitor/windows-server-monitoring.html\">Server Monitor<\/a> | <a href=\"{{n3}}/getting-started/apm-insight.html\">APM Insight Monitor<\/a> | <a href=\"{{n3}}/admin/adding-a-monitor.html\">Others<\/a><\/p><p>{{n1}}<\/p>","practice.unused.virtual.private.gateways.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Checks configuration for Amazon Virtual Private Gateways (VGWs) and identifies unused VGWs that are not associated with the VPC side of the VPN connection.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> Every unused (detached) AWS Virtual Private Gateway should be removed from AWS account to facilitate better management and to prevent from reaching service limit.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Identify and remove any unused Virtual Private Gateways provisioned within your AWS account to avoid reaching service limit (by default, you are limited to 5 VGWs - attached or detached - per AWS region).<\/p>","vmware.vxrailmanager.hostname.ip.help":"Specify the host name or IP address of the server on which VxRail Manager is running.","mprobe.install.step3.1":"Edit the newly added Mobile Network Poller to give a friendly name.","network.rediscover.interfaces":"<a ng-click=\"rediscoverInterfaces()\">Rediscover<\/a> interfaces on the network device.","mprobe.install.step3.2":"You can now create Website monitor and use this Mobile Network Poller as a monitoring locations.","thirdparty.chatgpt.generate.error":"Provide a valid sample log line.","api.gateway.stage.form.add.monitor":"Add API Gateway Stage Monitor","rca.traceroute.error.reason.100":"Server successfully reached the destination IP","cl.public.page.form.manage.access":"Manage access","aws.drs.agent.version":"Agent Version","thridparty.event.bus.name":"Event Bus Name","alibabacloud_clb.instanceqps