fy vulnerabilities in container images, ensure security compliance, and safeguard your clusters from potential threats.<\/p>","forecast.check.for":"Forecast for","admin.tags.tags.tour.16.addicons16.right":"<div><h5>Tag your monitors<\/h5><div>Use Add Tags option to categorize your monitors based on various properties like database, data center etc. Tags can also be used to filter monitors in various views.<\/div><\/div>","alibabacloud_ecs.vm.cpuutilization":"VM CPU Utilization","azure.metric.plushttpsslverifyfailuresnocert.desc":"Verify failures - no certificate","threshold.availability.cognito.idp":"Performance Thresholds for Cognito Identity Provider","global.unauthorized.access":"Unauthorized Access","client.marketing.homepage.bullet1":"It identifies and tracks the response time, status, component size, rendering time, document complete time, load time, and individual component loading time of the website.","apminsight.configure.key.transaction":"Configure Business Transactions","client.marketing.homepage.bullet2":"Displays the entire breakdown of website components by requests and size, along with availability and response time from multiple monitoring locations, along with downtime details (if any).","client.marketing.homepage.bullet3":"Supports the monitoring of Static, Dynamic and Flash-based Website","client.gs.addmonitor.title":"Setup your Web & Internet Services monitoring","servermonitor.short.desc":"Install the Windows server monitoring agent on your server and start monitoring the usage of CPU, memory, disk and applications like Microsoft Exchange, IIS, SQL server and more.","practice.gcp.sql.disable.public.ips.desc":"Check for Cloud SQL Database Instances with Public IPs.","practice.gcp.function.deprecated.execution.runtime.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the functions are using an outdated execution runtime environment<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Cloud Run functions' second generation has major improvements compared to the first generation, including faster cold starts and execution times, a wider range of runtime environments, enhanced networking and integrations with Google Cloud services, and better monitoring and debugging tools. Upgrading to the second generation is highly recommended for better performance, better flexibility, and smoother development and operations processes. It combines the strengths of Google Cloud Run and Google Cloud Eventarc, offering features like concurrent processing, traffic distribution, and a longer processing duration.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Upgrade Cloud Run functions to the latest runtime version for improved security, improved performance, and access to new features. Older versions are no longer supported and may be less secure and efficient.<\/p>","oracle.db.metric.totalpgainuse.desc":"Total PGA in Use","max.application.latencyP75":"75 Percent of Requests Latency (Max)","global.cluster.monitor.add.monitor":"Add an Application Cluster Monitor","cl.server.upgrade.skip.limit.exceed":"Upgrade Skipped: Exceeded failed monitors threshold.","newclient.server.config.disable.appdiscovery.info":"Automatically discover all the child applications and monitor them in addition to your server. By default, option Yes will be selected.","aws.quota.enable.title":"Enable Service Quotas","cl.ncm.validate.template.name":"Please enter only alphanumeric values for the device template name (accepted symbols are space, period (.), dash (-) and underscore(_)).","add.contact.helptext.alert.period":"Define a time window so you can receive Voice/SMS status alerts during this period alone. You can't define this window for email or IM based notifications.","biztalkserver.spoolsize":"Spool Size","cl.nw.stswsensor.name":"Sensor Name","aws.valkey.save.in.progress":"Save In Progress","al.multiple.conditions.message":"Multiple Field Conditions","app.ibm_i.printerdetails.spooled.file.number":"Spooled File Number","vmware.vdi.mdp.label.errormachines":"Number o