ose the desired integration level to either push specific alerts from a monitor or all alerts from your Site24x7 account to your Microsoft Teams.<br><br>Select <b>Monitors<\/b> and choose the desired monitor to send out alerts from the selected monitor alone to your Microsoft Teams.<br><br>Select <b>All Monitors<\/b> to send out all Site24x7 alerts to your Microsoft Teams.","alibabacloud_ecs.cpuwait":"CPU Wait","al.help.steps.whitelist":"Please whitelist <b>{{agent_upload_domain}}<\/b> and <b>{{plus_domain}}<\/b> as our agents need to communicate with our servers to upload logs to Site24x7.","onboarding.networks.description":"Monitor network devices, Interfaces, Routers, Switches, Firewalls, VPN, VoIP, WAN accelerators and more.","saas.application.jiracom.web.credential.info":"The credential profile helps to ensure enhanced security. Save your Jira Sign-In credentials as a profile and then use them for your monitors. For configuration instructions, please refer to the <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/help/admin/configuration-profiles/credential-profile.html\">help documentation<\/a>.","dashboard.name.empty.error":"Provide name for Dashboard","al.title.log.lines":"Log Lines","practice.rds.high.utilization.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks the CloudWatch performance counters for Amazon RDS and identifies DB instances that appear to be highly utilized.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>A RDS instance is deemed to be overutilized if it meets the following criteria:<ul><li>The average daily CPU usage is more than 90% for at least 4 days in the last 7 days.<\/li><li>The amount of disk space consumed is more than 85% for at least 4 days in the last 7 days.<\/li><\/ul><\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Vertically scale up your master database or use read replicas to meet the demands of your application.<\/p>","err.login.cred":"An error occurred while attempting to connect to the Cisco ACI device. Please verify your credentials and try again.","alib