FKA_HEAP_OPTS=\"-Xmx1G -Xms1G\"<br>fi<\/div><\/copy><li>Below the aforementioned code block, paste the following lines:<\/li><copy class=\"mrgl30-imp\"><div>export KAFKA_JMX_OPTS=\"-Dcom.sun.management.jmxremote-Dcom.sun.management.jmxremote.authenticate=falseDcom.sun.management.jmxremote.ssl=false-Dcom.sun.management.jmxremote.port=9999\"<br>export JMX_PORT=9999<\/div><\/copy><li>Restart the Kafka Broker service after making the above changes.<\/li><\/ul>","mssql.widget.lock.avglatchwaittime":"Average Latch Wait Time (ms)","isp.traceroute.info":"Displays the latest available data. If it's unavailable, the last successfully polled data will be displayed","skype.sip.loc.500.resp":"SIP Local 504 Responses","cl.nw.san.aggregate.storage.utilization":"Aggregate Storage Utilization","capacity.healthcheck.notify":"Sync Monitor Group Status with Health Check Status","docker.container.volumebinding":"Volume Binding","saas.category.cms":"CMS","cl.nw.ucs.rack.server.adminState":"Admin State","gcp.errorcode.cloudarmor.termination":"GCP Cloud Armor is Terminated","gpu.report.processes":"GPU Processes Report","alibabacloud_polardb.conn_usage":"Connection Usage","alibabacloud_clb.instanceupstreamrt":"Instance Upstream Response Time","reports.from":"From","oracle.db.cdbperformance":"CDB Performance","plugin.app.sap_abap.report.avg.buf.export.import.hit.ratio":"Avg Export/Import - Hit Ratio","client.aws.s3folder.discover":"Discover Folders","js.path.description":"The directory's absolute path must use the host OS (Windows/Linux) format. It must end with a trailing '/' (for Linux) or '\\'(for Windows).","hyperv.virtual.totalruntime.exceeds":"Total Runtime","cl.nw.device.pollissue.reason.1":"The device hasn't been polled in the recent times.","alibabacloud_apsaramq_rocketmq.readymessagequeuetime":"Ready Message Queue Time","cl.nw.device.pollissue.reason.2":"Unable to fetch proper response time.","cl.nw.device.pollissue.reason.3":"Interfaces are not polling as expected.","of365.inciden