plement strict filtering and monitoring to detect and prevent abuse.<\/p>","alibabacloud_nat_gateway.nettx.pkgs":"Network TX Packages","cl.ncm.help.asstnt.box2.enable.ncm.one":"Navigate to <strong>Network > NCM > Settings<\/strong>.","thirdparty.chatgpt.generate.server.script.language":"Scripting Language","app.ibm_i.job_group.hide_additional_filters":"Hide Additional Filters","milestone.search":"Search Milestone","aws.dms.free.until":"Free instance expiration","standard.dadsv5.family.vcpus":"Standard DADSv5 Family vCPUs","huaweicloud_gaussdbv5.rds075_streaming_dr_xlog_replay_rate":"Replay Rate of Shard Logs in DR","plugin.app.jboss.jpa.sessions.closed":"Sessions Closed","subscriptions.size.enabled.netflow.info":"<p><b>Complete visibility into network traffic and bandwidth with performance monitoring at the device, interface, application, conversation, and QoS level. Supported technologies:<\/b><\/p><p><ul><li>NetFlow<\/li><li>sFlow<\/li><li>J-Flow<\/li><li>CFlow<\/li><li>IPFIX<\/li><li>NetStream<\/li><li>AppFlow <\/li><\/ul><\/p>","aws.batch.compute.resources.max.vcpus":"Resources Max Vcpus","mcp.tool.arguments":"MCP Tool Arguments","aws.secret.manager.points":"<ul><li>Track the secret rotation and secure your data.<\/li><li>Schedule IT Automation to automatically rotate your secrets.<\/li><\/ul>","ip.not.ping":"The Cisco ACI device was not reachable via ping request. Please verify the Hostname or IP address and try again.","azure.metric.plussslhandshakes.desc":"Successful SSL handshakes","aws.cognito.app.client.openid.scopes":"OpenID Connect scopes","alibabacloud_ecs.instancegpudecoderutilization":"Instance GPU Decoder Utilization","report.mail.huaweicloud_evs.desc":"Huawei Cloud Elastic Volume Service Monitor","aws.emr.form.edit.monitor":"Edit EMR Monitor","sdn.common.serial":"Serial","iis.monitor.info":"Microsoft IIS Monitor Info","system.metrics.lin.cpu.threshold":"Available from agent version 16.7.5","alibabacloud_apsaradb_hbase.containerslaunched":"Containers