<p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Dead letter policies provide a mechanism to handle messages that cannot be processed after repeated attempts. Without a dead letter policy, problem messages can block processing and cause delivery delays for other messages in the subscription.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Configure dead letter policies for your Pub/Sub subscriptions to ensure proper message handling and prevent unprocessable messages from causing service disruptions.<\/p>","oci.compute.rdma.rx.packets":"RDMA Rx Packets","databricks.job.monitor.add":"Add Databricks Job Monitor","escaltion.after.first.poll":"Notify on every error","edit.alibabacloud_rds_sqlserver.monitor":"Edit RDS SqlServer Monitor","mysql.metric.innodblogwrites.desc":"InnoDB Log Writes","mssql.restore.db":"Backup Restored DB","alibabacloud_oss.QosMaxTotalQps":"Qos Max Total QPS","cl.nw.interfaces.no":"No Interface has been","cl.nw.ucs.service_profile.edit.title":"Edit Service Profile","alibabacloud_alb.listenerhttpcode5xx":"Listener HTTP Code 5xx","report.apm.top.key.transactions.by.count":"Business Transactions by Count","azure.auth.mangement.info":"Login to your Microsoft Azure Account and grant access to Azure Service Management(using Azure Management APIs).","alibabacloud_analyticsdb_mysql.disk_used_percent":"Disk Used Percent","cl.core.color.perf.line4":", if the actual value is <=1000 and > 500","problem.analysis.time":"Event Correlation Window","cl.core.color.perf.line5":", if the actual value is > 1000","kube.monitor.job":"Job","cl.ncm.diff.baseline":"Compare with Baseline","ds.snapshot.details":"Snapshot Details","cl.nw.trap.processor.edit":"Edit Trap Processor","ntp.config.maxdrift.help.text":"Specify the allowable difference between the primary NTP server and each secondary NTP server.","custom.view.select.widget":"Please select atleast one chart","cl.core.color.perf.line3":", if the actual value is <= 500","cl.core.color.perf.line1":"<b>Example 1:<\/b> Conditional formatting based on <b>response time<\/b> of monitor<\/span>","practice.volume.without.recent.snapshot.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>No recent EBS snapshots were taken in the last 30 days.<\/p> <p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Snapshots record the point in time state of your EBS volume. In the event of a failure replicas of the original volume can be created using these snapshots.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Depending on how frequently you are making changes to your EBS volume, you can set up an automated scheduler to take regular snapshots to improve EBS data protection and recoverability.<\/p>","azure.metric.SocketOutboundTimeWait.disp":"Time Wait Socket Count for Outbound Requests","metrics.explorer.new.dashboard":"The Explorer widgets will be added to a new dashboard with the name provided here","azure.metric.memory_percent.disp":"Memory Percent","rum.application.SPA_App":"Single Page Application","client.marketing.datastore.bullet2":"Each VMware datastore is licensed as a basic monitor.","client.marketing.datastore.bullet1":"On-Premise Poller version 3.1.6 or above is required to monitor datastores.","oci.basedb.pdb.ocpus.allocated":"OCPU Allocated","msp.reports.allocate":"Allocated Details","practice.gcp.iam.essential.contacts.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks if essential contacts are configured for notifications about operations, security, and billing.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Essential contacts ensure that critical notifications reach the appropriate teams. Without proper configuration, important alerts about security issues, billing problems, or operational incidents may go unnoticed.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Configure essential contacts for your project to ensure that notifications are routed to the appropriate people or teams responsible for different aspects of your GCP resources.<\/p>","apminsight.jvm.cpu.usage":"JVM CPU Usage","aws.agentcore.harnessendpoint.memory.operations":"Memory Operations","device.interface.bandwidth.edit.title":"Edit Bandwidth Configuration","practice.oci.sgw.blocking.check.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the Service Gateway has traffic blocking enabled.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>A blocked Service Gateway prevents all traffic to OCI services through it. Verify this is intentional and not impacting workloads that depend on OCI service connectivity.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Review Service Gateway blocking status and ensure alignment with network policy.<\/p>","kublt.pleg.rel.dur.tot":"Total PLEG Relists Duration","sdn.common.managed.accounts":"Managed Accounts","sdn.cambium.wireless.alarms.open.displayname":"Alarms Open","huaweicloud_autoscaling.scaling_configuration_name":"Scaling Configuration Name","js.number.only.error":"Only digits from 0-9 are accepted","azure.loc.eastasia":"(Asia Pacific) East Asia","read.requests.region":"Read Requests per Minute per Project Region","iis.alert.apppoolclrm.heap1.exceeds":"Gen 1 Heap of \"{{n0}}\"  {{n1}} MB.","predefined.report.10.description":"Inventory and configuration overview of web monitors","metrics.type.histogram":"Histogram","apminsight.app.alert.trouble.ins.count.exceeds":"Trouble instance count of application {{n0}}","uptime.button.txt1":"Monitored by Site24x7","add.gcp.quota.vpc":"Add GCP VPC Access Quota","max.application.requests":"Application Requests (Max)","alibabacloud_ecs.PrivateDnsNameOptions":"Private Dns Name Options","ba.funnel.edit.journey":"Edit Journey","azure.discover.error":"Azure Resource Discovery Task is Running Already. Please try after sometime","client.discovered.resources.disabled.botton.text":"Adding Resources","alibabacloud_oss.TableBucketTotalRequestCount":"Table Bucket Total Request Count","aws.acm.sig.algo":"Signature Algorithm","oracle.db.metric.bytessentdblink.desc":"Bytes Sent Via SQL*Net To DBLink","of365.lync.avconference.history":"AV Conferences History","onboarding.publiccloud.description":"Monitor Amazo