AZs) are created for your data tier.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> Amazon Availability Zones are distinct locations that are engineered to be isolated from failures occurred in other zones. By launching EC2 instances in separate AZs (separate subnets), you can protect your databases from the single point of failure. Each data-tier subnet must reside entirely in one Availability Zone and cannot span multiple zones.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> To reach fault tolerance and high availability from the perspective of database deployment, make sure that at least two subnets in two different Availability Zones are created within your data tier.<\/p>","alibabacloud_mongodb.shardingdiskutilizationnode":"Sharding Disk Utilization Node","azure.configerror.resolved.details":"Resolved Issue Details","home.url.view.discover.subdomain.notes":"{{n0}} new subdomains have been discovered. <a ng-click=\"showSubDomain()\">View Domains<\/a>","gcp.lb.healthy.instances":"Healthy Instances","mysql.metric.binlogcachesize.desc":"Binlog Cache Size","tencentcloud_cdn.HitRate":"Hit Rate","alibabacloud_apsaradb_hbase.blocksuncached":"Blocks Uncached","azure.metric.datadiskusedburstiocreditspercentage.desc":"Data Disk Used Burst IO Credits Percentage","biztalkserver.soapmessagesreceivedpersec":"SOAP - Messages Received/Sec","report.mail.akamai_cloud_image.desc":"Report Mail Description","aws.phd.events.upcoming":"Events Upcoming","dashboard.widget.active.clients.access.points.info":"Select an individual access point to view its connected clients, or select a WLC to view clients connected to all access points it manages.","cron.norunping.alert":"Alert me if Job does not start on schedule","kube.nw.monitoring.info":"Enable Network Monitoring in the Cluster","rdspi.db.sql.tup.returned":"Tuples Returned","practice.gcp.vm.stopped.instances":"VM instances - Stopped instances","biztalkserver.highmessagepublishingrate":"High Message Publishing Rate","oci.opensearch.search.rate":"Searc