li>Gain visibility into your ECR repositories across accounts and regions.<\/li><li>Monitor image push and pull counts, storage usage, and repository size trends.<\/li><li>Get notified about anomalies or usage spikes to prevent unexpected storage costs.<\/li><li>Track the number of images and tags for security and compliance purposes.<\/li><li>Get notified when a Pull Through Cache rule for an applicable repository is disabled or moved from the active state. Timely alerts help you take necessary actions, such as re-enabling caching or performing manual pulls, to prevent image update delays or caching failures.<\/li><li>Receive alerts when a Replication rule applied to your repository is removed or disabled to stay aware when image replication to other regions or accounts stops, so you can take corrective actions to avoid data inconsistencies or deployment issues.<\/li><\/ul>","kube.vm.lmig.end":"End Time","iis.chart.title.nwchart":"Network Statistics","global.smtp.responsetime":"SMTP Response Time","jsp.tools.xml-to-yaml.url":"tools/xml-to-yaml.html","plugin.saphana":"SAP HANA","cpu.thread.count":"CPU Threads","azure.metric.dtu_consumption_percent.desc":"DTU Percentage. Applies to DTU-based elastic pools.","kube.pod.status.scheduled":"Pod Status Scheduled","rdspi.os.diskio.nvme.5n1.readiosps":"Read IOPS (nvme 5n1)","client.global.search.component.types.placeholder":"Search Component Types","of365.lync.av.conferences":"AV Conferences","server.cdiscovery.not.added":"To be Added","deep.discovery.new.other.domain.expiry":"Other Domain Name Expiry Domains","dashboard.forbidden":"Forbidden","iis.app.min.sesstateconn":"Min Session State Server connections","threshold.container.inactive.anon":"InActive Anon Memory exceeds for \"{{n0}}\" - \"{{n1}}\"","azure.aifoundryproject.metric.agentshostedmemoryusage.desc":"Hosted Agents Memory GiB Hours","s3.records.avg":"Average Delivery To S3 - Records","vmware.vdi.hv.rds.available.state":"Number of RDS Servers in Available State","r