Console<\/a>.<\/div><div>2. Select the project you want to monitor.<\/div><div>3. Go to <b>Security<\/b> > <b>API Tokens<\/b> > <b>Generate API Token<\/b>.<\/div><div>4. Provide a description (e.g., site24x7-monitoring) and select <b>Read<\/b> permission (sufficient for monitoring).<\/div><div>5. Click <b>Generate API Token<\/b> and copy the token securely. <i>IMPORTANT: It is shown only once and cannot be retrieved again.<\/i><\/div>","aws.discovery.no.services.to.add":"No Services To Add","practice.gcp.cloudrun.auto.runtime.security.updates.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the automatic runtime security updates are disabled for Cloud Run services.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Enabling automatic runtime security updates ensures that your Cloud Run services are always running the latest security patches, reducing the risk of vulnerabilities and improving overall security.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable automatic runtime security updates for your Cloud Run services to maintain security and compliance.<\/p>","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.serverlessgetrt":"Serverless Get RT","aws.dms.external.table.definition":"External Table Definition","rdspi.os.swap.out":"Swap Out","alibabacloud_polardb.opensearchindicesquerycachecachecount":"OpenSearch Indices Query Cache Count","inline.filter.select":"Select...","cl.nw.discovery.report.select.nw.credential":"Network Credential","rum.source.upload.jssource":"Upload JS Source","aws.vpc.private.links.subtitle2":"Integrate your AWS PrivateLinks with Site24x7 to leverage the following benefits:","vcloud.tenant.org.vdc.running.vm.exceeds":"Organization VDC Running VMs exceeds threshold","sdn.cradlepoint.ha.addbtn":"Add a CradlePoint NetCloud Monitor","aci.bgp.router.id":"Router ID","azure.discover.site24x7app.label":"Authenticate with the Site24x7 App","alibabacloud_mongodb.oplogtimeintervalnode":"Oplog Time Interval Node","language.german":"Deutsch","oci.secrets.title":"OCI Secrets","aws