ation: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/casestudies/iifl.html\"> case study.<\/a><div style=\"border: 1px solid #21BC63; padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; margin:15px auto 0px; cursor: pointer; background: #21BC63; color: #fff; text-align: center; width: 100px;\"><a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/app/client#/admin/inventory/add-monitor\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff; text-decoration: none;\">Add your first monitor now<\/a><\/div><br><b>Why wait? <\/b>Every moment without monitoring risks downtime, user dissatisfaction, and inefficiency. Let Site24x7 simplify your journey to complete visibility.<br><br>Regards,<p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">The Site24x7 team | ZOHO Corp<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">US: +1 408 352 9117 | UK: +44 203 564 7893 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">AUS: +61 280 662 895 | NL: +31 707006121 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">4708 HWY 71 E, Del Valle, TX 78617-3216, USA<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">About Site24x7 <\/a> | <a href=\"{{n1}}/overview.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Help guide <\/a> | <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/home?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Knowledge base <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/community/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Community <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/request-demo.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Demo <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/training.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Training<\/a><\/p><\/body>","alibabacloud_ecs.instancegpumemoryusedspace":"In