rces to mitigate the inefficiencies present in both CloudWatch and standalone standard server monitoring.","global.search.no.results":"No results found","azure.unit.rowssec":"rows/sec","al.field.filter.info":"Filter log lines at source based on field values. Only the log lines matching the filter criteria will be collected.","rdspi.db.sql.tokenized.stats.local.blks.written.per.call":"Local Blocks Written Per Call","oci.nw.policy.is.failed.desc":"Notify When Network Firewall Policy Is in Failed Status.","al.alert.new.aad.policy":"Azure AD Policy Change","velocloud.memory.util.avg":"Avg Memory Utilization","cl.server.mp.disabled.serv.btn":"Enable Service Metrics","help.assistant.ses.help.link":"<a href=\"{{help}}/aws/ses-integration.html\"target =\"_blank\"> Learn more<\/a>","thirdparty.lama.overall.report":"LAMA Overall Report","global.server.check.syslog.add":"Add Syslog Checks","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.tsdbcoldstorageusedbytes":"TSDB Cold Storage Used Bytes","cl.nw.discovery.profile.started":"Discovery started successfully.","thirdparty.zanalytics.plus.select.attributes":"Choose performance attributes, which will be synced with Analytics Plus.","ssl.host.port.help.text":"Specify the IP address or domain name of the host, and the port number. The host must accept an SSL / TLS handshake on the port.","global.select.more.locations":"Change Location Profile","entra.app.status.sort.popover":"Sort based on monitor status","cl.nw.ucs.blade_server.cmos.voltage.state":"Blade Server Cmos Voltage State","aws.cognito.user.attributes":"User attributes","pack.addon.to.update.text":"Update","global.snstopic.name":"SNS Topic","search.apminsight.views":"Search Views","login.newuser.agree.txt2.ae":"You can use your Zoho credentials to login to Site24x7.<br>Agree to Site24x7 <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.ae/terms.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Terms of Service<\/a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.zoho.com/privacy.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Privacy Policy<\/a> before accessing Site24x7."