is stopped","plugin.app.jboss.webapp.duplicated.sessions":"Duplicated Sessions","sdn.common.total.routes":"Total Routes","mssql.resp.logouts":"Logouts","cl.nw.san.cifs.title":"Storage CIFS","rum.help.avgrt.firstparty.resources":"Response time taken by all the resources in the parent domains.","apminsight.go.prerequisites.golang":"2. The agent supports Go binaries compiled with Go versions 1.12 through 1.22.0.","cl.nw.storage.netapp.node.util.max":"Node Utilization (Max)","router.capacity.type":"GCP Cloud Routers Capacity Planning","restapimetric.custom.metric.threshold":"Select the Custom Attributes Threshold Profile","practice.aws.workSpaces.unused.instances.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Check for unused AWS WorkSpaces instances in order to reduce the cost.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> WorkSpaces instance running within AWS account is adding charges even we not using that. It is highly recommends to removing any unused WorkSpaces instances available in AWS account in order to reduce the AWS costs.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Terminate any unused Amazon WorkSpaces instances available in AWS Account.<\/p>","gcp.cloudsqlsqlserver.monitortype":"GCP Cloud SQL for SQL Server","app.ibm_i.job_group.max_instances_range":"Max instances must be between 1 and 500","alibabacloud_analyticsdb_postgres.DBInstanceStatus":"DB Instance Status","global.action.type.analytics":"Start/Stop Managed Apache Flink Application","custom.fun.boolean":"Boolean","kube.collision.count":"Collision Count","rum.device.metrics":"Device Metrics","practice.gcp.sql.enable.cmk.encryption.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the instances are encrypted using Customer Master Keys (CMKs) instead of GCP managed-keys.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Google Cloud SQL encrypts data at rest using Google-managed keys by default, without any user intervention. <\/br> However, if you require full control over encryption, you can use CMKs through Cloud Key Management Service (Cloud KMS), which is ideal for sensitive or mission-critical data, especially in enterprise environments with strict security and compliance needs.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Ensure that your Google Cloud SQL database instances are encrypted with CMKs to enhance control over your data's encryption and decryption processes. You can create and manage these CMKs through Cloud KMS, which offers secure and efficient key management, along with controlled key rotation and revocation features.<\/p>","user.type":"User Type","network.watchers":"Network Watchers","cl.ncm.drafts":"Configuration Drafts","ad.reports.dra.read":"Report for DS Reads from DRA(%)","login.newuser.agree.txt2.jp":"You can use your Zoho credentials to login to Site24x7.<br>Agree to Site24x7 <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.jp/terms.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Terms of Service<\/a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.zoho.com/privacy.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Privacy Policy<\/a> before accessing Site24x7.","monitor.level.block.list":"Monitor-level Block List","apminsight.identify.cluster":"Identify Clusters Having","emr.jobs.running":"Jobs Running","gcp.container.memory":"Container Memory","cloudspend.budget.threshold.attribute.name":"When budget amount exceeds the target budget","alibabacloud_sas.memoryactualusedspace":"Memory Actual Used Space","device.avg.memutil":"Avg Memory Usage","azure.metric.outgoingmpnsinvalidcredentials.disp":"MPNS Invalid Credentials","veeam.azureappliance.num.of.success":"Number of sessions succeeded","alarms.category.monitor.filter":"Filter Monitor Type","lambda.edge.concurrent.exe":"Concurrent Executions","vmware.vdi.threshold.label.group.connservers":"View Connection Server Thresholds","nutanix.reserved.usage.percent":"Reserved Usage (%)","log.report.contentlength.units":"Content Length (B)","cl.core.ac.verify":"Alert Contact Verified","server.free.physical.mem":"Free Physical Memory","azure.metadata.tab":"Configuration Details","mobile.rbm.os.type":"OS T