g groups, you can specify the desired capacity or assign policies, to ensure an optimum number of EC2 instances are available to handle incoming application requests.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Organize your EC2 instances as AutoScaling groups.<\/p>","vxrail.manager.username.help.text":"The user must have administrator privilege to access the VxRail Manager.","aws.tg.attach.single.title":"Transit Gateway Attachment","dynamodb.metric.prov.read.cap.avg":"Provisioned Read Capacity Units Average","aws.valkey.automatic.backups":"Automatic backups","websites.down.txt":"Down","server.disk.individual.threshold":"Individual threshold","login.page.blogs.txt":"Blogs","notify.ec2.iops.exceed.check":"Notify When Volume IOPS Exceeds Provisioned IOPS","cl.nf.credform.info.ssh.port":"The port that should be used for SSH communication.","aws.lambda.runtime.invoke.timeouts":"Runtime Invoke Timeouts","azure.metric.storagepercent.desc":"Storage Percent","aws.dms.full.load.start.date":"Full Load Start Date","azure.metric.plusstreamzonesynczonesrecordstotal.desc":"Zone sync records total","traceroute.as.number":"AS Number","cl.nw.onprem.import.feature.ipam.failed":"Unable to import the IPAM subnet.","gcp.metric.opscount.desc":"Disk I/O Operations","plugin.cfg.idrac.host.info":"Enter the hostname or IP address of the iDRAC interface.","nsx.alert.indv.node.memory.used.exceed":"Used Memory for Node \"{{n0}}\"  {{n1}}KB","aws.agentcore.runtimeendpoint.arn":"Endpoint ARN","plugin.app.glassfish.title.request.status.codes":"Request Status Codes","msk.broker.prod.resp.queue.time.msmean":"Produce Response Queue Time Ms Mean","az.nwcon.bitsin.persec":"Bits In Per Second","vpc.vpn.tunnel":"Tunnel","digitalocean_domain.summary.title":"Summary Title","cl.nw.san.interface.monitor":"Interface Monitor","profile.connectiontime.from.secondary":"Connection time threshold for secondary locations","cl.nw.storage.adapter.down.reason":"The Adapter is Down","reason490102.singular":"{{n0}} secret ex