tream","problem.dns.resptime":"DNS Response Time Comparisons","global.ascending":"Ascending","rum.add.step1":"<label class=\"bold mrgrt5\">Step 1:<\/label>Copy the below script and insert it to the header/footer of your application or website which you would like to monitor. You can track your own events and user traits from your web app using this code snippet. Our snippet acts as a beacon to all user activities on your application.","al.fwd.webhook.auth.header":"Auth Header","rum.add.step2":"<label class=\"bold mrgrt5\">Step 2:<\/label>Check if site24x7 RUM snippet is configured in your website. Enter your website's URL.","aws.waf.countedrequests":"Counted Requests","profile.transactiontime.from.primary":"Transaction time threshold for primary monitoring location","brand.reputation.report.not.phishing":"<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\" href=\"https://www.google.com/safebrowsing/report_error/\" >Phishing/Deceptive<\/a>","es.node.encryption":"Node-to-node encryption","edit.ecs.monitor":"Edit ECS Monitor","alert.azure.protocol.change":"Alert if Protocol is Changed","winbackup.summary.title":"Microsoft Windows Backup Server Monitor Summary","apminsight.nodata.no.webtxn.header.msg":"<b>Web Transaction<\/b> data is not available for the selected time range.","sdn.xiq.topology.data.not.available":"No devices available","al.percentile.subtitle":"{{ percentile }}th percentile of {{ field }}","azure.metric.monitorlockcontentioncount.desc":"System Runtime Monitor Lock Contention Count","jsp.tools.regex-parser.apmfooter":"Get code level visibility and enhance your <a href=\"/application-performance-monitoring.html\" style=\"color: #518AFE;\">application's performance<\/a> using Site24x7 APM Insight.","global.server.dsize.threshold":"Notify when Directory Size Exceeds","network.path.loss.percentage":"Loss percentage","azure.vpn.site.address.prefixes":"Address Prefixes","aws.inspector.findings.per.run":"Finding Count Per Run","rum.delete.fil