ication directory, via terminal and execute the given command:<\/span><\/div><div class='entry col-sm-12 pricing-bold mrgbot10 mrgtop10'><span>heroku drains:add '{{api_end_point}}{{api_token}}&rawLogs=true&logSource=&lt;ApplicationName&gt;'<\/span><\/div><div class='clear'><span>Note:<\/span><ul><li>Enter your application name under '&lt;ApplicationName&gt;'<\/li><\/ul><\/div><div>","committed.nvidia.v100.gpus.per":"Committed Nvidia V100 GPUs per Project Region","global.networkdevice":"Network Device","device.threshold.interface.errorrate":"Error Rate  {{n1}} (%) for {{n0}}","azure.resource.trafficmanager":"Azure Traffic Manager Profile","oci.instance.pool.autoscaling.enabled":"Autoscaling Enabled","saas.application.netlify.url.info":"Please provide your customized Netlify URL here.","azure.metric.replicasqlrunning.desc":"Replica SQL Status","aws.dc.vi.bytes.title":"Virtual Interface Bytes Activity","azure.hostpool.user.id":"User ID","azure.metric.plushttpupstreamqueueoverflows.desc":"Upstream queue overflows","lightsail.lb.instance.response.time.unit":"Instance Response Time (Seconds)","cl.nw.trap.processor.name.empty":"Trap processor name can't be empty.","wpa.issues.tab.template.311":"Ensure CORS preflight requests return a 2xx status code and do not redirect.","topology.collect.message":"Data collection in progress. Topology details will be available shortly.","dynamodb.returned.records":"Returned Records Count","practice.default.vpc.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Ensures that your AWS application is not deployed with the default Virtual Private Cloud so as to follow security best practices.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> A default VPC is suitable for getting started quickly, and for launching public instances such as a blog or simple website, however, when you deploy complex applications and use multi-tier architectures you may need to create a non-default VPC that suits your specific requirements.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Cre