ults <\/li> <li> Receive alerts based on vaults for automated backup failure <\/li> <\/ul>","rdspi.db.sql.sort.rows":"Sort Rows","sdn.arista.device.config.diff.line.count.displayname":"Config Diff Lines","report.server.select":"Select server","addon.56.desc":"10GB-6Months Logs Storage Add-on","practice.aws.neptune.multi.az.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Ensures that your Neptune graph database clusters are deployed in at least two Availability Zones (AZs).<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> If you have Neptune graph database clusters in multiple Availability Zones and these share one Neptune graph database clusters, in the event of AZ failure the Neptune graph database clusters becomes unavailable and the resources within other Availability Zones lose internet access. Create fault tolerance by deploying Neptune graph database clusters in at least two AZs.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Remove a single point of failure and increase the availability of your application by deploying Neptune graph database clusters in atleast two  Availability Zones (AZs)<\/p>","global.alibabacloud_fc.monitortype":"Alibaba - Function Compute","apm.add.java":"Add Java Agent","logreport.dctype.pollnow":"Pollnow","azure.metric.io_requests.disp":"IO requests count","al.log.tag.rule.keywords.info":"You can provide a set of keywords to check along with the regex pattern. Regex pattern match will be ignored if these keywords are not present in the log line (or field)","global.schedule.frequency":"Frequency","s3.min.bytes":"Min Data Transfer","azure.clientsecret.required.errorlabel":"Provide the client secret key of the Application","practice.oci.vcn.subnet.type.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether Subnets are specific to the availability domain.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>Opting for a regional Subnet will mitigate availability domain failures since resources can be in any of the region's availability domain.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><