.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks for Amazon DynamoDB tables where encryption at reset is disabled.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable encryption at rest for your data (tables, local secondary indexes, and global secondary indexes) using a AES-256 and service-default AWS Key Mangement Service (KMS) key to protect sensitive information and achieve compliance requirements.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>You can't enable encryption at rest on an exiting table. Create a new encrypted table using the AWS management console or APIs.<\/p>","predefined.report.21.name":"APM Inventory Report","msk.broker.bw.in.allowance.exceeded":"Bandwidth In Allowance Exceeded","glue.updator":"Last Updated By","cl.nw.perfcounter.new":"New","stepfunction.site24x7.status":"Site24x7 Status","aws.vpc.ip.address.type":"IP address type","al.db.logon.stats":"Logon Stats","alibabacloud_apsaradb_tair.splitrwproxyintranetin":"Split RW Proxy Intranet In","aws.fsx.lz4.compress":"LZ4 Compression OpenZFS Volume","shrpt.oss.delayeddocsexceeds":"OSS gatherer documents delayed due to site hit frequency rules","huaweicloud_gaussdb.gaussdb_mysql035_innodb_del_row_count":"Row Delete Frequency","410":"The page no longer available at the server.","411":"Content-Length header missing.","412":"Precondition Failed","hyperv.storage.alert.errorcount.exceeds":"Error Count in \"{{n0}}\" Virtual Storage Device  {{n1}}.","azure.enable.ddosprotection":"Enable DDoS Protection","413":"Payload Too Large","sdn.cisco.sdwan.vmanage":"Manager","alert.postgresql.replication.sendinglag":"Replication sending lag","414":"Request URI too long.","oci.postgres.rpo":"Recovery Point Objective (seconds)","415":"Unsupported Media Type","416":"Range Not Satisfiable","azure.metric.pluscacheexpiredresponses.desc":"Cache expired responses","417":"Expectation Failed","418":"I'm a teapot","ad.ds.write.sam":"SAM Writes(%)","oci.lb.connection.accept":"Accepted Connections","kube.configmaps.monitor.edit":"Edit kube