 CMK customer-managed keys to protect the Amazon Storage Gateway File Shares which backed in Amazon S3, you gain full control over who can use these keys to access the volumes (cached or stored volumes). The AWS KMS service allows you to create, rotate, disable and audit CMK encryption keys for your file systems and helps you have more granular control over your data-at-rest encryption/decryption process. <\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Encrypt Amazon Storage Gateway File Shares with your own AWS KMS CMK customer-managed key.<\/p>","upload.file.json.site24x7.format":"Upload CSV File","tencentcloud_clb.wm_raw_table":"CLB Metrics","dc.imap.fail.ser-un":"The IMAP has failed due to service unavailable.","oauth2.send.token.as":"Authenticated request method","jenkin.job.lastbuildid":"JobLastbuildId","rum.custom.attributes.percentile":"Percentile","aws.agentcore.codeinterpreter.stop.latency.duration":"Code Interpreter Stop Latency and Duration","cl.nw.seconds":"secs","biztalkserver.pop3activesessions":"Active Sessions","ec2.server.integrate.update":"You get the following capabilities:<br/><br/>1. Better handling of AutoScaling instances - Contextual alerts, ability to discern between instance termination and instance crash.<br/>2. Performance charts for all your EC2 related metrics will now be available in a single unified view - no need to toggle between tabs<br/>3. Thresholds, notifications, maintainance - now all can be set up and configured on a single monitor.","cl.ipam.asset.tag":"Asset Tag","lambda.metric.invocations":"Invocations","global.action.start.app.gateways":"Start Application Gateways","vulnerability.severity.low.label":"Low Severity","huaweicloud_dcs.enable_ssl":"Enable Ssl","plugin.app.glassfish.report.avg.usedheapsize.count":"Avg Used Heap Size","global.statuspage.code.txt":"Copy the following HTML code to embed the status page on your site","vm.space.splitup":"Virtual Machine Space Split-up Summary","apminsight.responsetime.ms":"Resp. Time (ms