drock-agentcore:Get*\" read actions are not present in the assigned policy JSON.","practice.ses.dkim.enabled.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks for SES identies (domain and email addresses) that are not configured to use DKIM signatures.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Domain Keys Identified Mail (DKIM) is an email authentication protocol that allows senders to sign a particular representation of an email message cryptographically. The receiving mail server uses this signature to check whether the message was modified by a third party in transit.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Automatically add a DKIM signature to every email you send using Easy DKIM in Amazon SES or manually add your own DKIM signature.<\/p>","azure.metric.allocrate.desc":"System Runtime Allocation Rate","custom.fun.function.code":"Function Code","shrpt.excel.chartrequestspersec":"Chart Requests Per Sec","kube.nw.details.pagination":"Pagination","apminsight.thread.dump.no.data.identical.trace":"No Identical Stack Trace found","gcp.metric.apg.envapicallcount.desc":"Environment API Call Count","cl.nw.meraki.choose.org2":"Click Next to view the devices available in the organization.","cl.nw.meraki.choose.org1":"Choose the organization to be monitored.","azure.vm.start.postsuccess.msg":"Successfully posted the start action for the VM {{n1}}.","oracle.db.metric.datafile.maxbytes.desc":"Max Size","custom.report.tags.required":"Include Tags in Reports","client.marketing.agentcore.policy.service.bullet1":"There are no AgentCore Policies configured in the AWS account.","global.select.basicpkg.locations":"Select Locations","alibabacloud_polardb.opensearchindicesfielddataevictionscount":"OpenSearch Indices Fielddata Evictions Count","zia.guardrail.profile":"Guardrail Profile","veeam.enterprisemanager.num.of.failed.jobruns":"No. of Failed Job Runs","azure.metric.LowPriorityCoreCount.desc":"Total number of low-priority cores in the batch account","huaweicloud.monitor.edit":"Edit Huaw