described below:<ui><li>Knowing whether a message was delivered to the Amazon SNS endpoint.<\/li><li>Identifying the response sent from the Amazon SNS endpoint to Amazon SNS.<\/li><li>Determining the message dwell time (the time between the publish timestamp and the hand off to an Amazon SNS endpoint).<\/li><\/ui><\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Consider enabling delivery status logging for the SNS topic.<\/p>","global.select.bu":"Select Business Units","840":"A Celona monitor with the given credentials already exists","apminsight.flowmap.detailsview":"Component Details View","841":"Unable to connect to the Celona API (timeout)","842":"Celona API key is wrong or expired","843":"Invalid Celona Orchestrator URL","client.events.topup":"Top-up your account immediately.","844":"Insufficient permission for Celona API key","aws.appsync.field.connected":"Field Connected","845":"Celona customer not found","server.configuration.template.info":"For all the new server monitors to be added, create a template for thresholds, notification, and resource check profiles and associate them to appropriate user alert groups. Auto discover services and processes from our default list and mark them up for monitoring.","846":"Celona rate limit exceeded","847":"Celona upstream error","edit.oracle.rac.instance":"Edit Oracle Rac Instance","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.lindorm_multi_scan_num_ops":"Multi Scan Number of Operations","848":"Invalid Celona monitor","849":"Please delete the managed devices before deleting the Celona Orchestrator monitor","az.title.lsworkspace.completedruns":"Completed Runs","alibabacloud_polardbx.ibuf_read_hit":"IBUF Read Hit","threshold.payments.operation.latency.exceeds":"Payment Operation Latency is $ATTRIBUTE_VALUE","deep.discovery.new.smtp1":"Get your inbound and outbound mail servers checked regularly and track the round-trip-time of emails from 120+ locations.","mssql.min.fs":"Min Full Scan","plugin.app.glassfish.report.min.memusedperc":"Min Used Memo