send alerts to only the affected User Alert Groups (in your case, <b>DevOps Team<\/b>) alone; while the other User Alert groups associated with the monitor will not be disturbed.","oci.vcn.sl.capacity.threshold":"Security List Capacity Threshold","cl.core.view.card":"Card View","xen.vif.errors.recv":"Received Errors","aws.bedrock.query.engine.cluster.id":"Query Engine Cluster ID","plugin.app.sap_abap.metric.wp.upd2.status.summary":"Performance U2","ebs.health.threshold":"Healthy Threshold","errorcode.solution.dns.notupdated":"DNS records might not have been updated when we tried to initiate a connection, which has resulted in the failure while monitoring.","global.ncm.oper.last.state":"Last Operation Status","871":"Unable to connect to the Panorama API (timeout)","aws.vpc.protocol.title":"VPC Protocol","872":"Panorama API key is wrong or expired","873":"Invalid Panorama Orchestrator URL","elb.tg.connection.err.count":"Target Connection Error Count","875":"Invalid Panorama monitor","apminsight.app.alert.3xxerror.rate.exceeds":"3xx Error rate of application  {{n0}}","876":"Please delete the managed devices before deleting the Panorama monitor","dashboard.replicate.review":"Review","877":"Please delete the managed devices before suspending the Panorama monitor","alibabacloud_oss.table_bucket_total_recv":"Table Bucket Total Recv","878":"Panorama API key parameter is missing","879":"Panorama rate limit exceeded","cl.nw.san.aggregate.mirror.status":"Aggregate Mirror Status","practice.network.acl.unrestricted.outbound.traffic":"Network ACL - Unrestricted Outbound Traffic","oci.apigw.backend.type.bytes.sent.chart":"Bytes Sent by Backend Type","rds.instance.monitor":"RDS Instance Monitor","profile.ad.dbi.configuration":"Database Instance","az.title.sbtopics.enablepartitioning":"Enable Partitioning","inventory.k8s.workloads":"Kubernetes Workloads","k8s.file.deploy":"YAML to be uploaded","880":"Panorama upstream error","monitor.group.business.view.appserver.template.memcache.d