ross your network.<\/li><li><b>Dependency mapping: <\/b>Simplify troubleshooting by visualizing how devices interact.<\/li><li><b>Automated configuration management: <\/b>Save time with automatic backups and compliance tracking.<\/li><\/ul><b>Customer stories: <\/b>Learn how Site24x7 can save time and resources from our <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/casestudies/smartaction.html\">case study.<\/a><div style=\"border: 1px solid #21BC63; padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; margin:15px auto 0px; cursor: pointer; background: #21BC63; color: #fff; text-align: center; width: 100px;\"><a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/app/client#/home/monitors\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff; text-decoration: none;\">Explore now<\/a><\/div><br><br><br>Regards,<p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">The Site24x7 team | ZOHO Corp<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">US: +1 408 352 9117 | UK: +44 203 564 7893 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">AUS: +61 280 662 895 | NL: +31 707006121 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">4708 HWY 71 E, Del Valle, TX 78617-3216, USA<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">About Site24x7 <\/a> | <a href=\"{{n1}}/overview.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Help guide <\/a> | <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/home?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Knowledge base <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/community/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Community <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/request-demo.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Demo <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/training.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Training<\/a><\/p><\/body>","cl.nw.storage.netapp.disk.user.write.latency.ms":"User Write Latency Ms","alibabacloud_apsaradb_hbase.replaymean":"Replay Mean","vm.MemoryUtilizationChart":"VM Memory Utilization Chart","saas.application.bitbucket.title.add":"Add Bitbucket Monitor","iis.app.min.req.anon":"Min Anonymous Requests","practice.aws.eks.publicly.accessible.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Check if Amazon EKS cluster's Kubernetes API server endpoint is not publicly accessible from the Internet in order to avoid exposing private data.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> Amazon EKS creates an endpoint for the managed Kubernetes API server that communicate with newly created cluster. By default, this API server endpoint, managed by AWS EKS, can be accessed directly, outside of a Virtual Private Cloud (VPC), therefore every machine on the Internet can reach EKS cluster through its public endpoint. This can increase the opportunity for malicious activities and attacks.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> To disable public accessibility you need to reconfigure the visibility of your EKS cluster API server endpoints.<\/p>","tencentcloud_ckafka.summary.title":"Tencent Cloud - CKafka Summary","global.huaweicloud_gaussdb.monitortype.short":"GaussDB MySQL","rule.auto.enable.dbinisght":"Auto Enable MS SQL Database Insight","network.help.snmpcheckMIB":"How to check the SNMP reachability using MIB browser?","alibabacloud_oss.IntranetRecvBandwidth":"Intranet Recv Bandwidth","mongodbatlas.cluster.db.index.size.total":"Database Index Size","user.parameters.info":"Create custom parameters and assign values, which get dynamically substituted in your intended task. Use $ symbol in text fields to invoke a global parameter.","alibabacloud_csg.upload_queue":"Upload Queue","al.alert.anomaly.latency":"High Latency Requests","al.lc.error.1003.intro":"Log Files Configured in the 