ed and identifies instances that appear to be highly utilized.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>A ElastiCache for Memcached instance is deemed as over utilized if it meets the following criteria:<ul><li>The average daily CPU usage for the ElastiCache for Memcached instance is more than 90% for the last 7 days.<\/li><li>The average daily memory utilization for the ElastiCache for Memcached instance is more than 90% for the last 7 days.<\/li><\/ul><\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Consider changing the instance size.<\/p>","alibabacloud_eni.Ipv6Sets":"IPv6 Sets","azure.metric.outgoingwnsthrottled.disp":"WNS Throttled Notifications","oci.bs.keep.alive.connections":"Keep-alive Connections","bgp.errorcode.path.changed":"BGP AS path has changed","jsp.tools.json-minifier.reverseconverter":"Note : For reverse conversion, use <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/tools/json-beautifier.html\" style=\"color: #518AFE;\">JSON Beautifier<\/a>.","practice.oci.boot.volume.auto.tune.disabled.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether auto-tune performance is enabled for Boot Volumes.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>Auto-tune on Boot Volumes reduces costs during stopped or detached states by automatically lowering the performance tier.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Enable auto-tune on Boot Volumes to optimize cost during low-usage periods.<\/p>","al.log.tag.group.matching.info":"Entire logline will be matched for logtypes with no chosen fields","website.defacement.help.link":"Link Defacement - Identify 'href' attribute changes in the link elements of the web page.","nutanix.host.marketing.bullet1":"All you require is On-Premise Poller version&nbsp;<a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/kb/articles/upgrading-on-premise-poller-to-the-latest-version\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4.4.4 or above<\/a>&nbsp;to get started.","nutanix.host.marketing.bullet2":"Each Nutanix Host is licensed as a basic monitor.","cl.nw.test.perfcounter.monitor.nam