":"<ul><li>Monitor the status and availability of endpoint services across regions and availability zones.<\/li><li>Track the number and types of requests made to endpoint services.<\/li><li>Gather performance metrics such as request latency and throughput to ensure optimal service performance.<\/li><\/ul>","postgresqldatabase.metric.idleintransactiontime.desc":"Idle in transaction time","help.assistant.private.link.service.content.3":"<a href=\"{{help}}/aws/privatelink-service.html\" target =\"_blank\"> Learn more<\/a>","azure.metric.PremiumDataDiskCacheReadHit.disp":"Premium Data Disk Cache Read Hit","azure.update.credentails":"Update Client Secret Key (Application Secret Key)","practice.oci.storage.bucket.replication.disabled.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the Storage Buckets have a replication policy created.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>Replication policy provides protection from regional outages, aids in disaster recovery efforts, and addresses data redundancy compliance requirements. Maintaining multiple copies of data in regional locations closer to user access can also reduce latency.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Consider creating a replication policy for Storage Bucket.<\/p>","apminsight.app.alert.oldgc.time.exceeds":"Olf GC count of application  {{n0}}","aws.ssf.edit":"Edit Storage Gateway File Share","dscluster.details":"Datastore Cluster Details","website.defacement.allowed.domains":"Allow Domains","slo.newmonitor.frequency.help.text":"Calculate SLO at this frequency interval.","app.ibm_i.report.max.maximumjobsinsystem":"Max Maximum Jobs in System","cl.nw.storage.netapp.total.node.alert":"Total Node Size","veeam.enterprisemanager.hostname.ip.help":"Specify the host name or IP address of the server on which Veeam Enterprise Manager is running.","aws.appstream.icon.s3.location":"Icon S3 Location","oauth2.authorization.code":"Authorization Code","skype.chart.health.indices":"Health Indices","oracle.db.metric.waitc