on thresholds configured. The agent software also listens for server shutdown notifications. <br><br>To prevent false alerts due to any ISP issues at our already multi-homed datacenters, Site24x7 has heartbeat receiving capability spread across two different data centers. Well, it's time to get started!","practice.oci.nat.tagging.check.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether NAT gateways have required tags applied.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>Tags enable governance and cost attribution for NAT gateway resources.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Apply governance tags to all NAT gateways.<\/p>","automation.valid.timeout":"Enter valid timeout value. Range 1 - 300.","alibabacloud_rds.clusterproxycpuutilization":"Cluster Proxy CPU Utilization","apminsight.graphs.msg.parsingdatatext":"Parsing Data. Please Wait.","regional.external.managed.load.balancer":"Regional External Managed Load Balancer Forwarding Rules per Region per VPC Network","vmware.summary.title":"VMware Monitor","al.lprof.timezone.info":"If the time zone is not present in the log line, choose the appropriate time zone for your logs. If not, we will automatically fetch the time zone from the machine on which the Site24x7 server monitoring agent is installed.","alibabacloud_rds.three_seconds_executing_sqls":"Three Seconds Executing SQLs","poller.logs.zip.last.generated.time":"Last Log Archive Generated Time","mysql.metric.innodbxlockoswaits.desc":"InnoDB X Lock Os Waits","apigateway.route.capacity.type":"API Gateway Route Capacity Monitor","mysql.metric.comrevoke.desc":"Revoke Command","global.rds.proxy.target.monitortype":"RDS Proxy Target","kube.operator.topic.cluster.health":"Cluster Health","of365.min.licence.warningunits":"Min Warning units","gcp.fetch.current.data":"Fetch Current Configurations","alibabacloud_mongodb.writeavgrtnode":"Write Average Response Time Node","newclient.server.config.auto.agentupgrade":"Allow automatic agent upgrades","vulnerability.status.closed":"Closed","apm.add.ruby":"Add Ruby Agent","alibabacloud_ipv6_gateway.monitor.edit":"Edit Ipv6 Gateway Monitor","aws.ec.warm.threadpool.search.rejected":"Warm Threadpool Search Rejected","practice.gcp.iam.access.approval.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks if Access Approval is configured for the project.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Access Approval allows you to approve access to your data or configurations explicitly by Google personnel. Without Access Approval, Google staff might access your content during troubleshooting or support activities without your explicit approval.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable Access Approval for your project to maintain control over when Google personnel can access your content, particularly for sensitive workloads or regulated environments.<\/p>","mssql.slowquery.avgblocktime":"Average Blocked Time (ms)","nsx.bgp.threshold.down":"Notify when a BGP neighbor goes down","aws.dlm.ebs.snapshot.snapshots.copied.account.failed":"Snapshots Copied Account Failed","applogs.forwarding.label":"AppLogs Forwarding","cl.nw.ucs.san.port.channel.rxDropped":"RX Dropped","global.within":"Within","hpe.morpheus.manager.hostname.ip":"HPE Morpheus Manager Hostname or IP Address","plugin.app.glassfish.keepalive.countflushes":"Flushes","practice.aws.acm.certificates.validity.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Check if all the requests made during SSL/TLS certificate issue or renewal process are validated which managed by ACM.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> When your Amazon ACM certificates are not validated on time (within 72 hours after the request is made), these become invalid and you will have to request new SSL/TLS certificates, which could cause interruption to your applications or services.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Determine if there are any AWS ACM certificate requests that are not currently validated within your AWS account.<\/p>","msp.customer.inactive.msg":"You cannot view Inactive