Kubernetes stores secrets as base64-encoded plaintext in etcd. Enabling application-layer secrets encryption adds an extra layer of security by encrypting secrets with a Google-managed key or a customer-managed encryption key. This prevents unauthorized access to sensitive information like passwords, OAuth tokens, and SSH keys even if someone gains access to etcd storage.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable application-layer secrets encryption for your GKE clusters to protect sensitive Kubernetes secrets. For enhanced control, consider using customer-managed encryption keys.<\/p>","oci.application.network.security.group.ids":"Network Security Group IDs","network.router.med.buffer":"Medium Buffer Hits","aws.backup.num.of.recovery.points.avg":"Average Recovery Points","oci.tag.key":"Tag Key","oci.drg.static.routes":"Static Route Rules","cl.ipam.ip.connected.port.alias":"Port Alias","eks.addons.arn":"Addon ARN","cl.nw.device.filters.opt":"Device Filters (optional)","ebsvolume.volumetotalreadbytes.yaxislabel.text":"\u03A3 of bytes read","azurepubsub.metric.connectionquotautilization.desc":"Connection Quota Utilization","alibabacloud_ecs.cpu_wait":"CPU Wait","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.lindormmultisolrupdatemeanrt":"Lindorm Multi SOLR Update Mean RT","aws.elasticache.avg.currentitems":"Average Current Items","azure.metric.AzureToAzureProtectedItemsCount.disp":"Azure to Azure Protected Items Count","aws.cognito.id.pool.role.selection":"Role selection","client.marketing.sql.bullet1":"Gain deep understanding of various memory and buffer manager details for optimal capacity planning.","client.marketing.sql.bullet2":"Drill down to performance details such as errors, replications, SQL compilations and longest transaction time of SQL instances.","alibabacloud_analyticsdb_mysql.urlid":"URL ID","sdn.netcloud.cp.api.id.info":"The X-CP-API-ID header value from your NetCloud Manager v2 API credentials.","client.marketing.sql.bullet3":"Capture database attributes like d