/p><p>LRS replicates your data three times within a single data center in a region. If the disk is shared between multiple VMs, the shared disk becomes a single point of failure for your clustered application. If the shared disk experiences an outage, all the VMs attached to it will experience downtime.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Consider using zone-redundant storage for improved availability when using shared disk.<\/p>","cl.server.zookeper.watch.count":"Watch Count","nutanix.storage.container.type":"Storage Container","problems.list":"Problems-List","nodata.alert":"No Alerts created.","esx.bios.sensor.count":"Bios Sensor Count","global.perf.attributes":"Performance Attributes","oci.nosql.column.shard.key":"Shard Key","apminsight.errorcode.graphheader.fourxx":"Fourxx Error Code Splitup","practice.instance.termination.protection":"Termination protection","global.action.start.app.services":"Start App Services","alibabacloud_nas.bmcpfsdatathruputread":"Read Throughput","sdn.celona.ap.id":"AP Node ID","threshold.sysload.5min":"System Load (5 min Avg) Threshold","aws.guard.duty.finding.count":"Finding Count","apminsight.non.heap.memory.usage.percent":"Non Heap Memory Usage (%)","lambda.metric.invocations.min":"Minimum Invocations","predefined.report.80.name":"K8s Job Status","aws.cognito.idp.capacity.type":"Cognito Identity Provider Capacity","country.guernsey":"Guernsey","oci.opensearch.data.nodes":"Data nodes","practice.azure.aks.disk.cmk.encryption.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the AKS cluster disks are encrypted with CMK.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Using CMK for disk encryption provides enhanced control over encryption keys and meets compliance requirements. It ensures that your data is protected with keys that you manage and control.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Consider enabling cluster disk encryption with CMK.<\/p>","rdspi.db.sql.tokenized.stats.buffer.gets.per.sec":"Buffer Gets Per Second","avg.elb.5x