atch and agent driven system and application metrics for more insight into instance workloads.","mssql.min.planhit":"Min Plan Cache Hit","mysql.handler.details":"Handler","huaweicloud_gaussdbv5.rds094_gaussv5_tps_rt_delete":"DELETE Request Response Time","plugin.cfg.elasticsearch.username.info":"Provide the monitoring username to connect to Elasticsearch. The user must have `monitor` and `manage` cluster-level privileges, as well as `read`, `monitor`, and `view_index_metadata` index-level privileges.","rum.help.useragents":"User agent refers to  a web browser telling a website information about the browser . Enter a part or full useragent(max 250 characters).Eg:\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/68.0.3440.106 Safari/537.36\".","help.oci.inventory.dashboard.ui.learn.more":"<a href=\"{{help}}/reports/anomaly-report.html\" target =\"_blank\"> Learn more<\/a>","jenkin.queues.size":"Queues Size","eks.pod.mem.req":"Memory Requests","min.iis.w":"Min Shared/Physical memory","capacity.inherit.profile.info":"Option to clone existing profile from monitor type","azure.metric.kube_pod_status_phase.disp":"Number of pods by phase","ebs.launch.config":"Launch Config Name","apminsight.listview.noerrors":"No knows Errors present for the selected time window","cl.nw.storage.netapp.quota.quota.db.ugt.scan.state":"Quota Db Ugt Scan State","velocloud.ports.total.reason":"Ports count changed","mysql.chart.innodb.pages.io":"InnoDB Pages I/O","client.dd.settings.discovery.frequency":"Discovery Frequency","alibabacloud_apsaramq_kafka.clustermessageinput":"Cluster Message Input","sdn.fmg.fortigate.topn.device.last.checked":"Top N Last Checked","alibabacloud_polardb.cluster_pcu_by_cpu_cores":"Cluster PCU by CPU Cores","dashboard.unshare":"Unshare Dashboard","practice.gcp.storage.enable.lifecycle.management":"Cloud Storage - Enable life cycle management","vmware.vdi.cs.location.avg.pcoip.sessions":"Avg. PCoIP Secure Gateway Sessions by Location","user.management.common.info":"Manage users and their roles in respective products.","global.configuration.error.monitors":"Configuration Error Monitors","alert.process.cpu.exceeds":"CPU utilization of \"{{n0}}\" {{n1}}%.","benchmarks.title.global":"Global Benchmarks","mail.presales.activity.followup.content.statusiq.1":"<body style=\"font-family: Proxima Nova, Roboto, Sans-Serif, opensans, Helvetica; font-size: 14px; padding: 15PX;\">Welcome aboard! We''re excited to help you streamline your incident communication with StatusIQ-your dedicated hosted status page solution.<br/><br/><b>Kickstart your status page setup<\/b><ul><li>Create your first status page-public or private-to share real-time updates during incidents and maintenance.<\/li><li>Add key services and components your users rely on to provide clear visibility.<\/li><li>Customize your page with your brand elements-logos, colors, domains, and even custom HTML/CSS-for a fully tailored experience.<\/li><\/ul><br/><b>Getting started essentials<\/b><br>Follow our <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/help/statuspage/\">step-by-step <\/a> guide to create your status page, add components, and configure your settings with ease.<br><br><b>Need assistance?<\/b><br><a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/schedule-demo.html\">Schedule a personalized demo <\/a> with our experts to explore how StatusIQ supports your communication goals during incidents and beyond.<br><br>Stay tuned for more tips to help you get the most out of your StatusIQ experience.<br><br><b>Best,<\/b><br>The StatusIQ team<\/body>","velocloud.score.after.trans.report":"Transactional Score (After) Report","alibabacloud_acs_ksm.MaxResults":"Max Results","mail.presales.activity.followup.content.statusiq.4":"<body style=\"font-family: Proxima Nova, Roboto, Sans-Serif, opensans, Helvetica; font-size: 14px; padding: 15px;\">Hi,<br><br>Now that you''ve explored how to communicate effectively with users and internal teams, here''s how to close the loop: by integrating StatusIQ with your existing monitoring tools for faster, automated incident communication.<br><br><b>Challenges with manual incident updates<\/b><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#8226; Delays in informing stakeholders after issue detection<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#8226; Inconsistent updates across tools and channels<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#8226; Increased effort on communication during high-pressure incidents<\/p><br><b>Automate communication with StatusIQ integrations<\/b><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10003; Trigger real-time incident updates by integrating StatusIQ with Site24x7 or any monitoring tool.<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10003; Use APIs and native integrations to align incident communication with your existing workflows.<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10003; Deliver consistent, timely updates that reduce user uncertainty and free up teams to focus on resolution.<\/p><br><b>What our users say<\/b><br><i>\"We switched to Site24x7 from another provider because they could not provide an API to subscribe emails automatically to alerts. The StatusIQ dashboard is also well-designed, and we embed it in our web portal to provide transparency to our customers. The product is also well-priced, and I could configure it easily. Your payment system is also world-class; this is not an understatement.\"<\/i><br>- <b>Schalk van Veerden<\/b>, head of software development at AMECOR<br><br><b>Getting started essentials<\/b><br>Refer to our <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/help/statuspage/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration:none; cursor:pointer;\">help doc<\/a> to learn more about StatusIQ''s integrations with Site24x7 and other monitoring tools.<br><br><b>Need assistance?<\/b><br><a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/schedule-demo.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration:none; cursor:pointer;\">Schedule a personalized demo<\/a>or join our live webinar to see how StatusIQ fits into your incident response workflows.<br><br><br><b>Best,<\/b><br>The StatusIQ team<\/body>","mail.presales.activity.followup.content.statusiq.2":"<body style=\"font-family: Proxima Nova, Roboto, Sans-Serif, opensans, Helvetica; font-size: 14px; padding: 15PX;\">Hi,<br><br>As you explore StatusIQ, here''s how to keep users informed and build trust during incidents or scheduled maintenance.<br><br><b>Challenges with incident communication<\/b><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10148; Keeping users informed without overwhelming them<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10148; Delivering consistent updates across regions and platforms<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10148; Reducing manual effort during stressful situations<\/p><br><br><b>Improve incident communication with StatusIQ<\/b><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10003; Use predefined templates to standardize updates and localize them by language and time zone.<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10003; Schedule notifications across multiple channels to keep stakeholders in the loop-automatically.<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10003; Group components for easy navigation and let users subscribe to updates that matter to them. Include third-party service statuses for added transparency.<\/p><b>Getting started essentials:<\/b> Check out our <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/ws/client/#/help/statuspage/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\"> documentation to set up your status page<\/a> with ease.<br><br><b>Need help?<\/b><br><a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/schedule-demo.html\">Schedule a personalized demo <\/a> with our experts and see how StatusIQ supports better communication during every incident.<br><br><br><b>Best,<\/b><br>The StatusIQ team<\/body>","mail.presales.activity.followup.content.statusiq.3":"<body style=\"font-family: Proxima Nova, Roboto, Sans-Serif, opensans, Helvetica; font-size: 14px; padding: 15px;\">Hi,<br><br>As you continue setting up StatusIQ, here''s how to keep internal teams aligned during outages and maintenance-without exposing sensitive updates externally.<br><br><b>Challenges with internal outage communication<\/b><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#8226; Sharing updates securely within the organization<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#8226; Avoiding information exposure to external users<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#8226; Ensuring only the right teams see the right incidents<\/p><br><b>Secure internal communication with StatusIQ<\/b><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10003; Create private status pages to share internal-only updates. Enable access controls with SAML-based SSO for seamless, secure login.<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10003; Restrict access further using IP-based filters to ensure only users in specific networks can view the page.<\/p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&#10003; Add password protection and prevent indexing to control visibility and keep your updates truly internal.<\/p><br><b>Getting started essentials<\/b><br><a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/ws/client/#/help/statuspage/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration:none; cursor:pointer;\">Refer to our documentation<\/a> to set up your private status page quickly.<br><br><b>Need assistance?<\/b><br><a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/schedule-demo.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration:none; cursor:pointer;\">Schedule a personalized demo<\/a> with our experts to see how StatusIQ supports your internal communication goals.<br><br><br><b>Best,<\/b><br>The StatusIQ team<\/body>","alibabacloud_rds.cluster_openfiles":"Cluster Open Files","cl.nw.layer2.discoverymech":"Discovery Mechanisms","apminsight.identical.stack.trace":"Identical Stack Trace","msex.asset.max.out.con":"Max Outbound Connections","nutanix.host.write.iops.report":"I/O write operations per second from Hypervisor Report","alibabacloud_nas.bmcpfsfsetinodeused":"Inode Used","monitor.g