/b><\/p><p>Separation of duties is a security principle that prevents a single individual from controlling an entire process. When a principal has both Key Management Service (KMS) admin and crypto operation roles, they can create keys and use them, bypassing security checks and balances.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Implement separation of duties by ensuring that different principals are responsible for KMS administration and cryptographic operations. This enhances security through mutual oversight.<\/p>","hyperv.vm.cpu":"CPU Usage","veeam.no.of.scheduled.backup.jobs":"No. of Scheduled Backup Jobs","kinesis.put.activeconnections.avg":"Average Put Media - Active Connections","global.huaweicloud_gaussdbv5.monitortype.short":"GaussDB openGauss","oci.apigw.4xx.bytes.received":"4XX Bytes Received","social.site24x7.rss":"Subscribe to our RSS Feed","cl.nw.san.svmpeer.monitor":"SVM Peer Monitor","mysql.metric.sslclientconnects.desc":"SSL Client Connects","digitalocean_cdn.monitor.edit":"Edit DigitalOcean CDN Monitor","plugin.app.jboss.server.group":"Server Group","cl.nw.san.svmpeer.peer.state.availability":"SVM Peer Peer State Availability","ad.app.avg.kcc.search":"Avg KCC Searches","global.server.configured.checks":"Configured Checks","cl.core.nu.notfound":"Mobile Number Not Found","msk.replicator.throughput":"Replication ThroughPut","biztalkserver.highdatabasesize":"High Database Size","cl.core.hypv.ct.rtprossor.msr":"Root Virtual Processor MSR Accesses","portal.integration.add.uptimeb.button":"Add Uptime Button","apminsight.api.2165":"An application with this name already exists. Please choose a different name.","cl.core.imp.show.import":"Show Import Page","apminsight.api.2166":"Cannot set custom application name because this rule is linked to multiple applications.","apminsight.api.2163":"You have reached the maximum of {{n0}} enabled rules. Please disable the existing rules to enable more.","sdn.common.cambium.edge.monitors":"Cambium Edge monitors","apminsi