cs","oci.postgres.db.idle_sessions_primary_role.avg":"Average Idle Sessions (Replica)","practice.aws.eks.cluster.logging.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Check if Amazon EKS clusters have logs enabled in order to publish logs to AWS CloudWatch Logs.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> By enabling EKS Control Plane Logging feature, EKS sends audit and diagnostic logs directly to AWS CloudWatch Logs. These logs can help you to secure and efficiently run your EKS clusters. We can select log type(API, audit, controller manager, scheduler or authenticator logs) we need. Logging data sent to the AWS CloudWatch log group created for the specified Amazon EKS cluster.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Enabled for your AWS EKS clusters in order to publish API, audit, controller manager, scheduler or authenticator logs to Amazon CloudWatch.<\/p>","alibabacloud_mongodb.docsdeletedps":"Docs Deleted PS","client.marketing.emr.service.bullet1":"There are no Elastic MapReduce configured in the AWS account.","dashboard.perf.top.50.monitors":"Top 50 Monitors","add.contact.helptext.critical":"Select the preferred mode of notification for Critical Alerts","sp.admin.role.desc":"StatusIQ Admins will have read and write access to all the modules in the product except to the Billing section.","client.marketing.emr.service.bullet3":"The read-level actions necessary to discover Elastic MapReduce \"elasticmapreduce:List*\" and \"elasticmapreduce:Describe*\" are not present in the assigned policy JSON.","alibabacloud_polardb.pg_three_seconds_executing_sqls":"PostgreSQL Three Seconds Executing SQLs","onboarding.synthetic.description":"Monitor step-by-step interactions in important transactions. Identify broken or slow interactions in web or APIs.","data.edit.customize.template":"Customize Performance Charts & Attributes","practice.azure.vm.highusage.info.desc":"<h><b>Description : <\/b><\/h><p>An Azure VM is deemed over-utilized if it meets one or more of the following criteria:<\/p><ul><li>The average daily CPU usage is more than 90% for the last 7 days.<\/li><li>The average daily memory usage is more than 90% for the last 7 days (applicable only if the agent extension is deployed on the Azure VM).<\/li><li>The average daily VM Uncached IOPS Consumed Percentage is more than 95% for the last 7 days.<\/li><li>The average daily VM Uncached Bandwidth Consumed Percentage is more than 95% for the last 7 days.<\/li><\/ul>","apminsight.webtxn.error.split":"Errors Split Up","lighthouse.category.best.practices":"Best Practices","cl.nw.ucs.vlan.tag.title":"UCS VLAN","azure.metric.actionsstarted.desc":"Actions Started","of365.skype.user.activity":"Skype for Business User Activity","al.nlp.generating":"Generating Query","app.ibm_i.widget.monjobqueuedetails.uid":"Uid","global.ultimate.pack":"Ultimate","gcp.enable.integratity":"Enable Integrity Monitoring","azure.etag":"etag","azure.metric.storagesynccomputedcachehitrate.desc":"Cloud tiering cache hit rate","report.transactionTime.time.is.exceeded":"Transaction time from {{n0}} exceeded {{n1}} ms.","az.title.mediaservice.streamingpolicyquotausedpercentage":"Streaming Policy Quota Used Percentage","admin-bu.bu-management.business-units.tour.1.tabitem.global.subscriptions.right":"<div><h5>License Details<\/h5><div>View the overall License Summary, Usage and License Summary across Business Units, and purchase or distribute alert credits among Business Units.<\/div><\/div>","cl.nw.ucs.fabric.extender.serverPortsoperStatelinkdown":"Server Ports Oper State Link Down","aws.workspace.dns.address":"DNS Address","cl.nw.ucs.fabric.extender.adminState":"Admin State","oci.basedb.pdb.allocated.storage.utilization.by.tablespace":"Allocated Space Utilization By Tablespace","azure.metric.StorageSyncServerHeartbeat.disp":"Server Online Status","alibabacloud_polardb.opensearchclustertaskmaxwaitingtimeseconds":"OpenSearch Cluster Task Max Waiting Time (Seconds)","cl.nw.san.ha.failure":"Takeover/Giveback Failures","global