px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">About Site24x7 <\/a> | <a href=\"{{n1}}/overview.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Help guide <\/a> | <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/home?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Knowledge base <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/community/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Community <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/request-demo.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Demo <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/training.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Training<\/a><\/p><\/body>","cl.nw.san.eseries.disk.errors":"Disk Errors","azure.metric.workingset.desc":"Working Set","myaccount.notification.style.snackbar":"Snackbar","js.monitor.poll.now.failed":"Polling not initialized as the On-Premise Poller is down","al.ltype.select.all":"Select All","client.inspector.service.monitor.info":"Monitor resource usage and performance for Inspector.","msp.template.info":"Select a Notification Template to define how alerts are formatted and sent to your customers' integrated third-party tools. The selected template applies to all customers associated with this notification profile and ensures consistent incident structure and field mapping across environments. <a href=\"{{help}}/admin/configuration-profiles/notification-template.html\" target=\"_blank\">Learn how to add a Notification Template.<\/a>","api.gateway.details.page":"API Gateway Summary","iis.reports.res.bytesent":"Report for Response Bytes Sent","azure.resource.recoveryvault":"Azure Recovery Services Vault","azure.resource.provisi