_rt)Attr respectively.Attribute name should not contain any special characters.","tools.wmi.already.executing":"WMI Execution is already in progress","kube.cont.runningstate":"Running State","sdn.xiq.ap.platform":"Platform","al.alert.new.rmq.error":"RabbitMQ Error","threshold.operations.failed.exceeds":"{{n0}} : Operations Failed Replication  {{n1}} count.","azure.metric.MemoryPercentage.disp":"Memory Percentage","vpc.vpn.data.in.exceeds":"{{n0}} : Tunnel Data Received  {{n1}} MB.","practice.api.gateway.cloudwatch.metrics.for.apis.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Checks whether detailed CloudWatch metrics are enabled for all APIs created with AWS API Gateway.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> AWS CloudWatch metrics for API stages allow  you to fetch more granular metric data which can help you to act fast and take immediate actions based on information delivered by these metrics through alarms.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Enable detailed CloudWatch metrics for your Amazon API Gateway APIs stages.<\/p>","aws.rdspi.db.concurrency.edit":"DB Concurrency Edit","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.read_ops":"Read Operations","multiple.azure.resource.cosmosdbforpostgresqlcluster":"Azure Cosmos DBs for PostgreSQL Cluster","alibabacloud_alb.servergroupupstreamresponsetime":"Server Group Upstream Response Time","realbrowser.incognito.heading":"[Mandatory] Enable the incognito mode to start recording","oracle.rac.data.blocks.lost":"Data Blocks Lost","aws.appstream.insufficient.capacity.error":"Insufficient Capacity Error","alibabacloud_waf.wafblocks5m":"WAF Blocks 5m","sdn.celona.ap.topn.ap.temperature":"Top N Temperature","apminsight.jira.integ":"Jira Integration","azure.resource.spring.apps":"Azure Spring Apps","aws.infrequent.access.log.groups.count":"Number of Infrequent Access Class Logs Groups","global.Delete":"Delete","rum.ca.template.info":"The Custom Attribute Monitor Template allows you to create configurations which periodically creates Alert Me