ndpoints.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Ensures Amazon VPC endpoints are not exposed to everyone.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> When the Principal element value is set to (*) within the access policy, the VPC endpoint allows full access to any IAM user or service within the VPC using credentials from any AWS accounts. Allowing access in this manner is considered bad practice and can lead to security issues. Updating the access policy allows to stop any unsigned requests made to the supported services and resources.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Restrict access to your Amazon VPC endpoints by updating access  policy.<\/p>","detailspage.no.outages":"No outages for \"{{n0}}\"","mysqldb.database.chart.sequentialvsindex":"Sequential vs Index Scans","azure.subscription.error.info":"Please select atleast one subscription","custom.report.filter.enter.value":"Enter value","p.unit":"Nos.","hetznercloud_server.protection":"Delete Protection","client.marketing.agentcore.runtime.service.bullet3":"The read-level actions necessary to discover AgentCore Runtimes  \"bedrock-agentcore:List*\" and the related \"bedrock-agentcore:Get*\" read actions are not present in the assigned policy JSON.","biztalkserver.orchestrationssuspendedpersec":"Orchestrations Suspended/Sec","client.marketing.agentcore.runtime.service.bullet2":"You have opted out of monitoring by unselecting the checkbox next to the Amazon Bedrock AgentCore.","kinesis.get.requests":"Get Media - Requests","ses.mail.domain":"Mail From Domain","hpe.morpheus.server.agent.last.update.time":"Agent Last Update Time","alibabacloud_ehpc.jobrundurationbycluster":"Job Run Duration by Cluster","ip.range.or.subnet.mask":"IP Range/Subnet Mask","azure.metric.cbsvolumeprotected.desc":"Volume Backup Enabled","client.marketing.agentcore.runtime.service.bullet1":"There are no AgentCore Runtimes configured in the AWS account.","bgp.summary.hijack":"Hijack","max.msg.recv":"Max Messages Received","alibabacloud_rds.