 leading enterprise.<\/a><div style=\"border: 1px solid #21BC63; padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; margin:15px auto 0px; cursor: pointer; background: #21BC63; color: #fff; text-align: center; width: 100px;\"><a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/app/client#/home/monitors\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff; text-decoration: none;\">Explore now<\/a><\/div><br><br><br>Regards,<p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">The Site24x7 team | ZOHO Corp<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">US: +1 408 352 9117 | UK: +44 203 564 7893 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">AUS: +61 280 662 895 | NL: +31 707006121 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">4708 HWY 71 E, Del Valle, TX 78617-3216, USA<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">About Site24x7 <\/a> | <a href=\"{{n1}}/overview.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Help guide <\/a> | <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/home?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Knowledge base <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/community/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Community <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/request-demo.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Demo <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/training.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Training<\/a><\/p><\/body>","help.assistant.workspace.content.2":"<a href=\"{{help}}/aws/workspaces-integration.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Learn more<\/a>","rum.http.calls":"HTTP Calls","multiple.cron.desc":"Cron Monitors","thirdparty.intro.events.msg":"Site24x7 now supports integration with Slack and HipChat platforms, wherein you can be alerted vi