 unhealthy instance and creating a new one to replace it, reimaging the unhealthy instance, or restarting the unhealthy instance.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable automatic instance repairs to ensure the health and availability of your VM instances in the VM scale set.<\/p>","amazon.instance.application.requests":"Total Application Requests - Instance","global.Failed":"Failed","aws.acm.multiple.title":"Certificate Manager Certificates","aws.guard.duty.findings":"GuardDuty Findings","esx.threshold.label.group.memory":"Memory Thresholds","aws.az.count.trouble":"Number of Availability Zone Monitors in Trouble Status","amazon.ec.active.defrag.hits":"Active Defragmentation Hits","network.child.enable.monitoring":"Enable Monitoring","aws.route53.healthcheck.status.avg":"Average Health Check Status","azure.metric.CpuUtilizationMillicores.disp":"CPU Cores Used","saas.application.google_doc.desc":"A collaborative word processor platform from Google. Add a monitor to check the sign-in flow and the transactions to ensure application availability.","azure.metric.portsused.desc":"Ports used","alibabacloud_cloud_backup.BytesDone":"Bytes Done","azure.iot.tab.twinjobs":"Twins and Jobs","alibabacloud_rds.clusteractivesessions":"Cluster Active Sessions","port.status.check":"Check Port Status","sdn.netcloud.ecm.api.key.info":"The X-ECM-API-KEY header value from your NetCloud Manager v2 API credentials.","alibabacloud_apsaradb_hbase.capacityremaining":"Capacity Remaining","rum.ca.monitor.breakdown.one.monitor":"One monitor for everything","azure.metric.devicedatausagev.desc":"Total Device Data Usage (preview)","gcp.metric.bdt.lastexecjobrows.desc":"Last Execution Job Rows","nsx.manager.newmonitor.frequency.help.text":"The NSX-T Manager is monitored at this interval.","azure.compute.service.label":"COMPUTE","announcement.heading.empty.error":"Announcement Heading should not be empty","reports.topn.process.memory":"Servers by Process Memory Usage","quick.template.name.mass.