 (Min)","hyperv.vm.threshold.form":"Edit VM Configuration","rum.overview":"RUM Overview","server.monitor.sql.step4":"To enable Enhanced Microsoft SQL Server Insight,open the system tray and right-click <b>Site24x7 tray icon > App Monitor Config > Select the SQL instance<\/b>.Fill in the required credentials to connect to the instance, then click <b>Test connection<\/b> and <b>Save<\/b> to complete the configuration.","server.monitor.sql.step3":"Once installation is complete, the agent will auto discover the Windows server and the Microsoft SQL server. The SQL Monitor will be added in your Site24x7 account.","client.events.authtoken.deprecation.message":"We are receiving authtoken based API calls from your account. Authtoken based calls were deprecated on Aug 31, 2019, and we introduced OAuth 2.0 for API authentication to provide more secure access to your resources. <\/br><\/br>We request you to immediately migrate your API calls to our latest authentication mechanism based on OAuth 2.0. Failing to act before April 26, 2021, will break any integration done through Site24x7 APIs.","rds.databaseconnections.max":"Database connections Maximum","xenserver.add.help.text3":"Choose the On-Premise Poller that has access to your XenServer web services.","sdn.arubaedgeconnect.help.assistant.prerequisites.line":"Before setting up or accessing an Aruba EdgeConnect SD-WAN monitor, ensure the following:","analytics.flink.records.in":"Records In","practice.azure.vm.assign.managed.identity.to.vm":"Azure VM - Managed identity","esx.port":"Port","mssql.resp.lockmem":"Lock Memory","cl.nw.ucs.fan.operational.state.availability":"Fan Operational State Availability","plugin.app.sap_abap.metric.alert.log.freq":"Alert & Log Frequency","azure.metric.ContentKeyPolicyCount.desc":"How many content key policies are already created in current media service account","global.alibabacloud_ecs.monitortype.short":"ECS","practice.gcp.sql.disable.local.infile.desc":"CloudSQL MySQL instances with local_infile flag not disabled are displayed below.","gateway.route.authorization":"Authorization","client.vpc.vpn.monitor.info":"Monitor resource usage and performance for VPC-VPN Connection.","practice.aws.sm.secrets.encryption.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether AWS Secrets Manager secrets are encrypted using customer-managed keys (AWS Key Management Service).<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>A secret can be encrypted either with AWS-managed Key Management Service (KMS) keys (default option) or Customer Managed Keys (CMK). All secrets that have default encryption will be encrypted with the same AWS managed key and policy for the key cannot be edited since it is created by the service. Use CMKs in order to have granular control over key permissions and have each secret encrypted using different KMS keys.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Consider using AWS KMS CMKs for encrypting secrets instead of using AWS-managed KMS for encryption.<\/p>","azure.discover.customapp.label":"Authenticate with Custom App","poller.latest.version":"Latest version","cl.nw.storage.netapp.snapshot.cumulative.percentage.of.total.blocks":"Cumulative Percentage Of Total Blocks","cl.nw.ucs.port.if.role":"Port If Role","addon.23.desc":"Advanced Monitor Add-on","gcp.api.version":"API Version","cl.nw.ucs.fabric_extender.operational.state":"Fabric Extender Operational State","lightsail.lb.attached.instances":"Attached Instances","alibabacloud_polardb.cputotal":"CPU Total","tencentcloud_clickhouse.query_count":"Query Count","grpc.stream.method.disabled.msg":"Unary, Server Streaming and Client Streaming methods are supported. Bidirectional streaming methods on the list are disabled as they are not supported.","alibabacloud_apsaramq_rabbitmq.instancemessageinput":"Instance Message Input","mobile.rbm.edit.script":"Edit Script","isp.jitter":"Jitter","practice.gcp.shielded.cluster.desc":"Check the Shielded GKE Nodes configuration attribute value.","wanrtt.monitor.rtt.threshold.m