instead of AWS managed-keys.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> Upon defining and using your own KMS CMK customer-managed keys to protect the data available in Amazon Storage Gateway Tapes, you gain full control over who can use these keys to access the volumes (cached or stored volumes). The AWS KMS service allows you to create, rotate, disable and audit CMK encryption keys for your file systems and helps you have more granular control over your data-at-rest encryption/decryption process.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Encrypt Amazon Storage Gateway Tapes with your own AWS KMS CMK customer-managed key.<\/p>","aws.amq.edit":"Edit Amazon MQ Monitor","rdspi.db.sql.tokenized.stats.local.blks.hit.per.sec":"Local Blocks Hit Per Second","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.thrift_call_time_in_queue_ops":"Thrift Call Time In Queue Ops","ses.policy":"Policy","amazon.eks.node.monitortype":"EKS Node","kube.vm.failed":"Virtual Machine failed to start","rds.char.set.name":"Character Set Name","alert.noise.reduction.duration.info":"Choose a period after which your alerts should be consolidated and sent as a digest.","thirdparty.zanalytics.fetch.inprogress":"Initial Fetch in Progress","practice.aws.ecs.containers.root.filesystem.read-only.access.desc":"Amazon ECS containers should be limited to read-only access to root filesystems","oci.tunnel.p2remaining.lifetime":"Phase Two Remaining Lifetime In Seconds","app.ibm_i.job_group.search_failed":"Search failed. Please try again.","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.serverless_put_rt":"Serverless Put Response Time","cl.ncm.help.asstnt.box2.title":"Enable Network Configuration Manager and add devices","aws.dms.vbq.source.latency.avg":"Average Validation Bulk Query Source Latency","aws.ddb.opcounters":"Types of Commands Issued","cl.nw.storage.netapp.vol.read.ops":"Read Ops","azure.metric.nodecpuusagemillicores.desc":"CPU Usage Millicores","ec2.ebs.statuscheck.actions":"Status Actions","hpe.morpheus.cluster.cpu.usage":"CPU Usage","cl.n