ght.req.attr.store_in.calling_service":"Calling Service","rum.ca.description":"Description :","sdn.extreme.site.add.title":"Add ExtremeCloud SD-WAN Site","azure.metric.outgoingmpnsinvalidnotificationformat.disp":"MPNS Invalid Notification Format","app.ibm_i.report.avg.job.msgqueue.maximum.size":"Avg Job Message Queue Maximum Size","azure.deploy.diagnostic.logs.title":"Deploy Diagnostic Logs Collection","pack.name.MSP":"MSP","al.db.sq.cacsts":"Cache Stats","kube.dns.flows.dimension":"Query Dimension","az.lb.vip.availability":"Vip Availability","huaweicloud_kafka.group_msgs":"Accumulated Messages","oracle.db.pga.details":"PGA Details","aws.agentcore.code.interpreter.throttles":"Code Interpreter Throttles","cl.nw.ucs.blade.server.presenceState":"Presence State","apm.section.otel.child.agent.description":"Collect and forward OpenTelemetry data - full control over what gets instrumented and where it's sent.","api.act.lreq.verb":"Active Long Running Requests by Verb","problem.rca.task.already.scheduled":"RCA task already scheduled","alert.azure.vpngw.provisioning.unhealthy.tip":"Recommended value: Succeeded. Alerts when the VPN gateway provisioning state is not Succeeded; any other state means the gateway did not deploy or update cleanly.","mail.cloudspend.presales.content.15":"<p>Hi there!<\/p><p>Hope you are enjoying your <a style=\"color: rgb(0,0,255)\" href=\"https://{{n0}}/help/cloudspend/\" target=\"_blank\"> CloudSpend <\/a> journey so far. We&#39;ve enhanced our product to help you gain an accurate, detailed view of your cloud bills with some amazing features, such as:<\/p><p><ul> <li><b>Multicurrency<\/b>: View costs in multiple currencies for 25 geographic locations for different transactions and monitor expenses for your Cost Accounts or budget in your preferred currency.<br><br><\/li> <li><b>Effective chargebacks<\/b>: Group and understand cloud costs by different teams, projects, departments, subscriptions, and more with Business Units. Make individual Business Units more accountable by creating custom tags and allocating spending to one or more Business Units within the organization. <br><br><\/li> <li><b>Forecasting<\/b>: Obtain an estimated total bill amount for your chargeback entities for the ongoing month based on your past usage. This can help you assess the expenditure split-up for individual Business Units, plan accordingly, and take measures to avoid exceeding the monthly budget.<br><br><\/li> <li><b>Scaling your resources<\/b>: Track your CloudSpend account and budgets with Site24x7 and integrate your Cost Accounts with AWS and Azure monitors. Scale your resources up or down as needed through IT Automation.<br><br><\/li> <li><b>Alarms support<\/b>: Receive budget notifications through emails, Site24x7 Alarms, or third-party services like Slack, webhooks, or Cliq.<br><\/li><\/ul><\/p><p>We would love to learn about your experience using CloudSpend to manage your cloud bills. If there&#39;s anything that we can improve, please reach out to us at cloudspend-support@site24x7.com.<\/p><p>Regards, <br>The CloudSpend team <\/p>","container.event.type":"Event","azure.metric.LeavingNodes.desc":"Number of leaving nodes.","aws.msk.connect.worker.count":"Worker Count","alibabacloud_rds.cluster_comreplace":"Cluster COM Replace","nsx.lb.severity":"Severity","saas.application.bitrix24.url":"Bitrix24 URL","threshold.task.cpuReser.exceeds":"{{n0}} : Task Definition CPUReserved {{n1}} Unit.","plugin.app.sap_abap.report.avg.bgjob.count":"Avg Background Job Count","rule.azure.location":"Azure Locations","alibabacloud_ecs.diskusage_free":"Disk Free Space","rum.analytics.medium":"Medium","cl.nw.storage.disk.read.iops":"Disk Read IOPS","plugin.mysql.handler.rollback":"Handler Rollback","gcporg.child.count.inorg":"Total Folders/Projects Associated with Organization","aws.fsx.capacity.read":"Capacity Pool Read Bytes","cl.recommendations.desc":"A set of best practices curated for you to help make the best use of our product.","alibaba