Mware ESX/ESXi Credentials","practice.elb.without.multi.az.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks for load balancers operating in a single Availability Zone.<\/p> <p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>If you are launching EC2 instances in a single Availability Zone, then any failure occurring in that data center could render all of your instances unavailable. By launching multiple EC2 instances attached to different Availability Zones in the same Region, you remove a single point of failure.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>For increased resilience and fault tolerance, please ensure multiple EC2 instances attached to different Availability Zones are registered to your Load Balancer.<\/p>","cl.nw.storage.netapp.snapmirror.bandwidth.limit":"Bandwidth Limit","aws.mq.mem.used":"Memory Used (CloudWatch)","al.alert.trend.gae.latency":"GCP GAE Latency","oci.mysql.hw.add":"Add HeatWave Cluster","esx.partition.used.uikey":"Partition Used Space","oci.hmt.linked.file.system":"Linked File System","metrics.method.library":"Site24x7 JAVA Libraries","azureprovisioningservice.capacity.type":"Azure IoT Hub Device Provisioning Service Capacity Planning","threshold.strategy.longterm.processing.tokens.exceeds":"Strategy Long-term Processing Tokens exceeds threshold","practice.azure.sites.errorprone.desc":"Reduce the error response by proper error handling mechanisms and rectify the error modules.","config.auto.discover.process":"Match with our default list and start monitoring automatically","r53.inbound.endpoints":"Inbound Endpoints","mid.server.upgrade.available.text":"A new Nexus Gateway (On-Premise Poller) version is available. Click","al.ri.mail.status.3":"Reindex request completed","global.upgrade.multiple.login":"Multi-User Login, API Access & Public Reports","network.traps.unsolicitated.group.source":"Source","amazon.errorcode.999999998":"Instance is deleted","appsync.additional.authentication.providers":"Additional Authentication Providers","rum.waterfalls.cdn.doma