y using the $ symbol in these text fields. Once the form data gets rendered or is intended to be used, the specified parameter names get auto-replaced with their corresponding values.","pack.name.PROPROMOTHREEMONTHS":"Pro Promo","alibabacloud_oss.TableBucketTotalRequestQps":"Table Bucket Total Request QPS","addserver.windowsmonitor.step6":"Step 6","addserver.windowsmonitor.step5":"Step 5 (Optional)","addserver.windowsmonitor.step2":"Step 2","addserver.windowsmonitor.step1":"Step 1","aws.top.snaps.size":"Top Snapshots by Size","addserver.windowsmonitor.step4":"Step 4","addserver.windowsmonitor.step3":"Step 3","rds.result.serverless.capacity.avg":"Average Serverless Database Capacity","practice.oci.boot.volume.backup.policy":"OCI Boot Volume - Backup Policy Disabled","rum.browser.firefox":"Firefox","glue.job.diskp.executor":"Executor Disk Used","rum.snapshot.ondemand.range":"(Value should be greater than 2000)","cl.nw.storage.netapp.vol.other.latency.per.operation":"Other Latency Per Operation","esx.hardware.status.yellow":"The sensor is operating under conditions that are non-critical.","azure.metric.outgoinggcmauthenticationerror.disp":"GCM Authentication Errors","global.request.uri":"Request URI","global.status":"Status","threshold.lin.specific":"Linux Specific Attributes","min.writeops.text":"Min Write rate","alibabacloud_anycast_eip.summary.title":"Anycast EIP Summary","apminsight.last.executed.methods":"Last Executed Methods","gcp.settings.markasmaintenance.info":"Switch the toggle to Yes to move the stopped GCP resources into Site24x7's maintenance window","alibabacloud_apsaradb_hbase.containerskilled":"Containers Killed","oci.cx.edit":"Edit Cross Connect","al.search.groupby.showing":"Showing {{currentCount}} of {{totalCount}} unique values","avg.mssql.resp.logouts":"Avg Logouts","global.push.notification":"Push Notification","oci.app.allocated.total.concurrency":"Allocated Total Concurrency","multiple.hv.monitors":"VMware Horizon Monitors","aws.emr.encryptionm