ss is sufficient for monitoring. Store your PAT securely; it cannot be retrieved once generated.<\/div>","akamai_cloud.authtype.header.desc.2":"<div>1. In Akamai Cloud console, navigate to <b>OAuth Apps<\/b> > <b>Add An OAuth App<\/b> >.<\/div><div>2. Save and securely store the Client ID and Client Secret.<\/div><div>3. In Site24x7, navigate to <b>Admin<\/b> > <b>Configuration Profiles<\/b> > <b>OAuth Providers<\/b> > <b>Add Provider<\/b>.<\/div><div>4. Use Authorization Code Flow and set endpoints: i. <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/v1/oauth/authorize\">Authorization<\/a>  ii.  <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/v1/oauth/token\">Token<\/a><\/div><div>5. Enter Client ID, Secret, and Redirect URI and then authorize to generate the access token and validate configuration.<\/div>","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.lindorm_multi_wscan_num_ops":"Multi Write Scan Number of Operations","huaweicloud_nosql_mongo.mongodb008_mem_resident":"Resident Memory","nutanix.host.edit":"Edit Nutanix Host","alibabacloud_ecs.networkin_droppackages_percent":"Network In Dropped Packages Percent","alibabacloud_apsaradb_tair.splitrwnodeintranetin":"Split RW Node Intranet In","aws.nat.fl.desttype":"Destination type","global.restapiseq.extract.headers":"Import from request headers","cl.nf.map.dscp.templts.add.success":"The DSCP template has been added successfully.","settings.account.terminate.mspuser.txt":"Any account configuration and performance data will be permanently lost upon termination of your Site24x7 account. <\/br> <\/br>Please note that the account will not be terminated for 3-4 days and any Site24x7 Account Admin shall cancel the termination. <br/><br/> Do you still want to terminate?","slo.choose.slos":"Choose SLOs","practice.redshift.clusters.database.audit.logging.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks the configuration for Amazon Redshift for data warehouse clusters and alerts you if database audit logging is disabled.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>When audit logging is enabled, detailed information about authentication attempts, connections, disconnections, user activity, changes to DB user definitions and more are captured and uploaded to a S3 bucket.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable audit logging for security and troubleshooting purposes.<\/p>","practice.oci.lb.deletion.protection.disabled.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether deletion protection is enabled for Load Balancers.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>Without deletion protection, Load Balancers can be accidentally deleted, causing immediate service outages. This safeguard prevents unintentional removal.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Enable deletion protection on all production Load Balancers.<\/p>","vm.events.severity.splitup":"Virtual Machine Events Split-up by Event Severity","bu.migration.enable":"Enable Business Units","alibabacloud_apsaramq_kafka.instancediskcapacity":"Instance Disk Capacity","rds.tempdb.data.file.usage":"Tempdb Data File Usage","ebs.inactivity.timeout":"Inactivity Timeout","glue.job.records.processing":"Processing Records per Second","apminsight.transaction.cpu":"Transaction CPU Time","apminsight.comparing.with":"Comparing With","alibabacloud_apsaradb_tair.flow":"Flow","global.cluster.servername":"Cluster Server Name","dbinsight.next.run.time":"Next Run Time","global.baseitem.apm":"APM","aws.cognito.app.client.signup.success":"Sign Up Successes","velocloud.bps.rx.reason":"In Traffic (bps) {{n1}} (bps) for {{n0}}","cl.nw.discovery.completion.mail.alert.info":"Select Yes to receive an email with the discovery report once a network discovery completes. Select No to stop these emails.","global.prchase.credits":"Purchase credits","lambda.edge.pro.concurrent.invocations":"Provisioned Concurrency Invocations","hyperv.chart.title.virtualinstructions":"Virtual Processor Instructions","brand.reputation.webpages.suspect":"Suspected to be a threat","global.threshold.strategy.sum.poll":"Poll Sum","rdspi.d