ypting data at rest reduces the risk of data stored on disk being accessed by a user not authenticated by AWS. It adds another set of access controls to limit unauthorized users' ability to access the data. For example, API permissions are required to decrypt the data before it can be read. API Gateway REST API caches should be encrypted at rest for an added layer of security.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Consider enabling cache encryption for API Gateway REST API cache.<\/p>","pack.name.BASIC":"Basic","oracle.db.ora.alert.reason":"Oracle Error Captured: ''{{n2}}''","rdspi.db.sql.tokenized.stats.local.blk.read.time.per.call":"Local Block Read Time Per Call","threshold.container.ioserviced.total.label":"I/O Total exceeds","azure.rsv.backupitem.sourceremoval.period.alert":"Alert if the Source Resource was removed within (days)","aws.avg.batch.job.runnable":"Avg Batch Job Runnable","jenkin.builds.execution.duration":"Builds Execution Duration","stepfunction.execution.aborted":"No. of Executions Aborted","hadoop.total.volume.failures":"Number of volume failures","wanrtt.monitor.src.ip":"Source IP","nutanix.storage.fingerprint.write":"Finger Print on Write","aws.agentcore.codeinterpreter.session.count":"Session Count","aws.ec.warm.search.latency.avg":"Average Warm Search Latency","msexchange.smtp.outbound":"SMTP Outbound","notify.bedrock.model.foundation.model":"Notify when foundation model is not in use for more than an hour","emr.jobs.failed":"Jobs Failed","server.linux.added.no":"No linux process configured","cdns.fwd.res.count":"Forward Response Count","aws.amq.aws.owned.key":"AWS Owned Key","iis.reports.apps.stats":"Report for Application Stats","cl.nw.layer2.monitor.now":"Monitor Now","oci.basedb.work.requests.state":"State","status.maintenance.notification":"Scheduled Maintenance Notification","install.date":"Install Date","alibabacloud_rds_sqlserver.locking.deadlock":"Locking & Deadlock Metrics","huaweicloud_evs.group.utilization":"Utilization Metrics",