ount","al.date.last.24hr":"Last 24 Hours","threshold.dbops.count.exceeds":"Database operation count threshold","huaweicloud_nosql_cassandra.cassandra103_range_slice_count_latency":"Range Slice Count","amazon.threshold.newflow.exceeds":"{{n0}} : Newflow {{n1}} count.","client.ha.systems.aws.description":"Get an in-depth analysis into the health and performance of your Amazon web infrastructure.","postgresql.metric.maxwalsenders.desc":"Max WAL senders","cl.nw.topology.monitor.count":"Monitors count","rdspi.os.diskio.rdsdev.readiosps":"RDS Device Read IOPS","huaweicloud_ecs.network_vm_newconnections":"VM New Network Connections","ebsvolume.avg.read.latency.threshold":"Volume Average Read Latency","alibabacloud_mongodb.docsupdatedps":"Documents Updated Per Second","mongodbatlas.node.system.normalized.cpu.steal":"System Normalized CPU Steal","vmware.vdi.step.execute.script.args":"\"Primary Connection Server Hostname/IP address\" \"Domain Name\" \"Username\" \"Password\"","aws.lambda.url.request.latency":"URL Request Latency","cl.nw.san.adapter.bytes.read":"Bytes Read","practice.gcp.kube.enable.auto.upgrade.nodes.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the cluster node auto upgrade property is disabled.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p>Turning on auto-upgrades for your GKE cluster nodes streamlines upgrade management by automatically and securely updating Kubernetes to the latest supported version. This ensures access to the most recent security fixes, features, and enhancements.<p><\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable the auto-upgrade feature for all nodes in your GKE clusters to ensure they stay up to date with the latest supported Kubernetes version.<\/p>","global.dc.timeline.mail":"Mail Events","threshold.availability.azuresynapseworkspace":"Performance Thresholds for Azure Synapse Analytics","cluster.balloned.memory.widget":"Balloned Memory (MB)","vmware.vdi.hv.min.problemvms":"Min no. of Problematic Machines","server.service.uptime.thresh