","rum.walkthrough.step7":"Get a holistic view of your application's performance over various geographic regions. The geographic regions where your application's Apdex score is relatively poor is enlisted separately.","rum.walkthrough.step6":"View data for a specific time period, from last 1 hour to last 30 days. Use Custom date option to view data for a specific date and Custom period option to view data for a specified time interval.","sdn.common.edge.nodes":"Edge Nodes","rum.walkthrough.step9":"Understand how your application performs by analysing it's response time over various ISP's used by your customers.","rum.walkthrough.step8":"Your application's Apdex score along with response time, throughput and page views for all geographic locations is listed separately.","offers.rewarded.eval.user.message":"You have earned 15 extra days for your review on {{n0}}!","azure.foundry.connection.group":"Group","alibabacloud_mongodb.shardingdocsupdatedps":"Sharding Documents Updated Per Second","plugin.app.glassfish.gc.collection.time":"Collection Time","client.marketing.r53.hz.bullet1":"There are no Route53 Hosted Zones configured in the AWS account.","client.deep.discovery.no.resources.found.short":"No resources found.","vmware.vdi.hv.min.blast.conn":"Min. Blast Connections","instances.per.project.region":"Instances per Project Region","azure.metric.StorageAPIFailureCount.disp":"Storage API Failures","report.custom.period":"Custom Period","apminsight.app.alert.critical.ins.count.exceeds":"Critical instance count of application {{n0}}","free.daily.small.operations":"Free Daily Small Operations Per Project ('(default)' Database)","cl.nw.ucs.chassis.conn.status":"Chassis Conn Status","mysql.metric.handlerdelete.desc":"Handler Delete","monitors.help.text":"Monitors view helps you define entities and their configuration settings that are used for performance and availability monitoring. You can filter the view by various application types and perform other bulk operations on what is called in Site24x7 as \"Monitors\".","az.title.dbacc.indexusage":"Index Usage","custom.report.precision.digits":"Decimal digits of precision for availability percentage","plugin.app.jboss.version":"JBoss Version","of365.threshold.msgsent.count":"Top mail sender messages sent exceeds","cl.nw.interface.out.traffic.bps":"Out Traffic (bps)","winupdate.restart.required":"Server Restart Requirement","practice.aws.route53.empty.dns.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Route 53 hosted zone checks for the availability of Route 53 DNS service.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> Amazon Route 53 is a highly available and scalable cloud Domain Name System (DNS) web service. It effectively connects user requests to infrastructure running in AWS such as Amazon EC2 instances, Elastic Load Balancer, or Amazon S3. It is cost effective, secured with IAM and flexible with any AWS service.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Configure AWS Route 53 to DNS service for your domain.<\/p>","offers.rewarded":"Congratulations!","emr.avg.containerpending.ratio":"Average Container Pending Ratio","huaweicloud_rds_postgresql.rds046_replication_lag":"Replication Lag","hyperv.virtual.emulated.instructions":"Emulated Instructions","alibabacloud_nat_gateway.monitor.add":"Add Nat Gateway Monitor","custom.fun":"Custom Function","datalake.data.received.without.time":"Data received, but no collection time is available.","cloud.aws.infrastructure.tour.3.tabs.categories.right":"<div><h5>NOC view of all AWS resources<\/h5><div>View monitored AWS resources, according to their status, region, and the service type.<\/div><\/div>","sftp.server.endpoint.id":"Server Hostname","mssql.avg.ple":"Avg Page Expectancy","virtual.interface.bgp.details":"BGP Peers Details","lightsail.restricted.to":"Restricted to","cl.nw.ucs.fabric_extender.power.state":"Fabric Extender Power State","aws.services":"Services to be discovered","maintenance.weekly.execute.every.error":"Execute Every should not be less than