er Mist WAN Edges by Secondary CPU Utilization","threshold.availability.directconnect":"Performance Thresholds for Direct Connects","aws.appsync.active.subscriptions.avg":"Active Subscriptions Avg","dns.find.host":"<a onclick=\"javascript:window.open('/jsp/finddnshost.jsp',this.target,'scrollbars=yes,resizable=no,width=520,height=450');\">Find my DNS Host<\/a>","practice.dynamodb.pitr.enabled.desc":"DynamoDB tables should have point-in-time recovery enabled","tencentcloud_cynosdb_mysql.tps":"Transactions Per Second","glue.job.run.timeout":"Timeout Runs","ncm.configlet.remediation.template":"Remediation Configlet","rca.errorcode.615":"SSL Connection error occurred while connecting to the server.","thirdparty.moogsoft.auth.info":"Enter the authorization key which can be used for authentication while posting alerts to Moogsoft, from Site24x7.","global.switcher.site24x7":"Site24x7","rca.errorcode.614":"The request is getting redirected for more than 10 times. This may be due to some wrong server configuration.","rca.errorcode.613":"The server took too much time to respond to the request. This can also be caused due to temporary connection problem between the monitoring server and the target server.","msexchange.hub.restime":"Hub RPC Response time","dynamodb.metric.scan.returned.itm.cnt.avg":"Average Scan Returned Item Count","reports.cdn.all.cities":"All Cities","reports.netflow.destination":"Destination Report","aws.msk.connect.name":"Connect Name","plugin.app.glassfish.jsp.jsperrorcount":"JSP Errors","azure.metric.GpuMemoryUtilization.desc":"Percentage of memory utilization on a GPU node.","azure.metric.streamingingestresults.desc":"Streaming Ingest Result","mobile.rbm.app.file.size.exceeds":"File size should not exceed {{n0}} MB.","cl.nw.storage.snapshot.used":"Snapshot Used","cl.nw.meraki.help.assist.scope.info":"Ensure the availability of your Meraki devices like switches, cameras, security devices, and various wireless devices. Site24x7's Cisco Meraki monitoring provides the right set of metrics to stay on top of the performance of your Meraki devices. You can also view response times and packet loss for security devices to help with pinpointing downtime or connectivity issues.","azure.resource.privateendpoint":"Azure Private endpoint","aws.dms.cdc.incoming.changes.avg":"Average CDC Incoming Changes","zerto.vpg.actual.rpo.exceeds":"Reading of VPG Actual RPO \"{{n0}}\" {{n1}} s.","cl.nw.storage.netapp.devices":"Devices","azureroutetable.capacity.type":"Azure Route Table Capacity Planning","biztalkserver.totalinstances":"Total Instances","threshold.memory.overhead":"Overhead Memory exceeds","notify.threshold.instance.state":"Notify When the EC2 Instance of the DRS Recovery Instance is not Running.","al.db.pd.it":"Incident Triggered","tencentcloud.loc.eu-frankfurt":"Europe (Frankfurt)","al.db.pd.ir":"Incident Resolved","apm.apm-insight.details.tab.tour.2.apmactionmenu.right":"<div><h5>Edit agent configuration profile<\/h5><div>When you add an application, default agent configuration profile is applied. You can edit the configuration profiles and change threshold values to suit your monitoring requirements.<\/div><\/div>","azure.postgresql.flexible.server":"Azure Database for PostgreSQL flexible server","oci.apigw.post.type.http.responses":"POST Type HTTP Responses","plugin.eapps.add.cop.choose.poller_pollergroup":"Choose the <a href=\"{{help}}/admin/adding-a-monitor/on-premise-poller-group.html\" target=\"_blank\">On-Premise Poller Group<\/a> or On-Premise Poller installed on your network which has access to {{application_name}}.","aws.valkey.active.defrag.hits":"Active Defrag Hits","oci.basedb.db.terminated.reason":"Database is Terminated","aws.valkey.cluster.shard.edit":"Edit Elasticache Valkey Cluster Shard","vcenter.sessions.details":"vCenter Session Details","plugin.app.sap_abap.report.min.wp.bg.total":"Min Background Work Processes Total","onboarding.goto.gettingstarted":"Get Started with Monitoring","global.gettingstarte