> Update Neptune cluster configuration in order to set up a enough backup retention period.<\/p>","vmware.vdi.hv.location.avg.problemvms":"Avg no. of Problematic Machines by Location","alibabacloud_tablestore.count5xxnumber":"Count 5xx Number","app.ibm_i.system_pools.non.db.pages.exceeds":"Non-DB Pages Exceeds","client.aws.analytics.stop":"Stop Application","msk.broker.repli.bytesout.persec":"Replication Bytes Out Per Sec","ec2.cwagent.procstat.read.count":"Read Count","nutanix.storage.replica.factor":"Replica Factor","escaltion.after.third.poll":"Notify on every 3rd error","plugin.pmin.redis":"The <i>redis<\/i> Python package will be installed on your servers.","msp.bulk.profile.sync.operation.info":"Select the operation to perform.","cl.nw.perfcounter.imported":"Imported","al.fwd.col.status":"Status","help.assistant.dms.instance.content.1":"While you migrate your workloads to the AWS using the Data Migration Service (DMS), ensure that the data is loaded into the target database by monitoring the replication instance.","kube.cpu.use.lim":"Cpu Usage Over Limit","oci.allcompartment.report":"All Compartments Report","child.performance.report.interface":"Interface Performance Report","plugin.help.samba":"Configure our Samba plugin to monitor the performance metrics of your Samba servers","practice.gcp.vpc.unrestricted.postgresql.access":"VPC - Unrestricted PostgreSQL access","add.freebsd.server.monitor":"Add FreeBSD Server Monitor","dynamodb.reports.max.write.throttle.events":"Maximum Write Throttle Events","api.serv.areq.dur.res":"Average Request Duration by Resource","practice.ec2.security.groups.dangerous.port.exposed.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks the security group of monitored EC2 instances for rules that allow unrestricted access on the following ports (20, 21, 22, 1433, 1434, 3306, 3389, 4333, 5432, or 5500)<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Unrestricted access can lead to DDoS attacks or malicious traffic reaching your application.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Expose TCP ports 80 and 443 to the Internet, and minimize the opportunities for an attacker.<\/p>","saas.application.dropbox.title.add":"Add Dropbox Monitor","alibabacloud_apsaradb_clickhouse.clickhouse_disk_inode_utilization":"Disk Inode Utilization","ncm.advanced.configlet.info.timeout":"The timeout value for response.","aws.fsx.storage.deduplicate":"Deduplication Saved Storage","rdspi.db.sql.innodb.rows.changed":"InnoDB Rows Changed","cl.server.plugin.cfg.fm.case_sensitive.info":"Set to Yes to make the search case-sensitive, or No for a case-insensitive search.","amazon.settings.overwrite.threshold":"Overwrite Existing Settings","cl.ncm.config.captured":"Captured On","azure.metric.RunbooksList.desc":"Azure Runbooks List","global.mobile.web":"Mobile Web","azure.mlw.private.link.count":"Private Link Count","aws.ddb.instance.multiple.title":"DocumentDB Instances","cl.nw.san.shelf.running.status":"Running Status","global.upgrade.message.secondary":"Selectable Monitoring Locations","sdn.arista.org.list.info":"Organization List","apminsight.agent.php.install":"PHP Agent Installation","huaweicloud_dds.mongo028_repl_update_ps":"Replicated UPDATE Statements per Second","vpc.max.active.connections":"Max Active Connections","report.status.down":"Down","msk.cluster.child.broker.down":"Number of Brokers in Down State","rds.license.mode":"License Mode","aws.appsync.cache.authorizer.uri":"Cache Authorizer Uri","log.report.apm.traces":"APM Traces","cl.nw.migration.no.logs.found":"Once update is initiated, Your logs will be generated and listed here","sdn.common.performance":"Performance","shrpt.oss.blockeddocsexceeds":"OSS archival plugin total documents waiting for a queue","eks.nodegroup.max.size":"Max Size","azure.resource.learningservices.workspace":"Azure Learning Services Workspace","postgresql.metric.autovacuummaxworkers.desc":"Autovacuum max workers","practice.gcp.cloudrun.auto.runtime.security.updates":"Cloud Run - Automatic runtime secu