or.reason.16":"Circular nameserver references were detected in ''{{n0}}'' while querying ''{{n1}}'', preventing proper DNS resolution. This occurs when a nameserver relies on another that points back to itself. Ensure that authoritative DNS servers for ''{{n0}}'' are correctly configured with proper glue records to break the circular dependency.","rca.dns.error.reason.15":"An error occurred while establishing a TCP connection to the DNS server(s) while resolving ''{{n0}}''. This could be due to network failures, incorrect server configurations, or packet filtering policies. Ensure that ''{{n1}}'' is reachable over TCP and verify network connectivity.","rca.dns.error.reason.14":"The DNS server(s) refused the TCP connection request while resolving ''{{n0}}''. This may be due to server configuration restrictions, firewall policies, or the DNS server not supporting TCP queries. Verify that {{n1}} allows TCP connections and check firewall settings.","rca.dns.error.reason.13":"The DNS response for ''{{n0}}'' was truncated due to exceeding the UDP size limit, and the fallback to TCP mode failed. This could be caused by firewall restrictions, misconfigured DNS servers, or network issues preventing TCP-based DNS queries. Ensure that TCP support is enabled for DNS resolution and check firewall or security settings that may be blocking TCP traffic for ''{{n0}}''.","rca.dns.error.reason.12":"A mismatch was detected in the DNS glue records for the domain ''{{n0}}''. This occurs when the IP addresses of the authoritative name servers provided in the parent zone differ from those in the authoritative DNS server. Such inconsistencies can cause DNS resolution failures or delays. Verify and ensure that the glue records for ''{{n0}}'' are correctly configured and synchronized across all relevant DNS servers.","rca.dns.error.reason.11":"DNSSEC validation may have failed for the domain ''{{n0}}''. This could be due to an expired or incorrect DNSSEC signature, missing DS records, or a misconfiguration in the domain''s DNSSEC setup. Verify the DNSSEC configuration for ''{{n0}}'' and ensure that all necessary records are correctly published and aligned with the parent zone.","rca.dns.error.reason.10":"The DNS response for ''{{n0}}'' did not contain an answer section. This may be due to an incomplete or misconfigured DNS record, a query for a nonexistent subdomain, or a problem with the authoritative DNS server. Verify the DNS configuration and ensure that valid records exist for ''{{n0}}''.","mssql.db.lock.mode.config":"Lock Mode Threshold Configurtaion","huaweicloud_nosql_cassandra.cassandra168_imbalance_table_num":"Imbalanced Table Count","gcp.successfulkey.lookups":"Successful Key Lookups","oracle.db.metric.mrpsequence.desc":"Archive Redo Log Sequence","plugin.app.glassfish.report.max.filecache.hits":"Max Hits","gcp.metric.configupdatescount.desc":"configuration operations","saas.application.monday_sales_crm.title.add":"Add Monday Sales CRM Monitor","weekly.count":"Weekly Count","mysql.metric.innodbsemaphorewaits.desc":"InnoDB Semaphore Waits","azurecapacitypools.capacity.type":"Azure NetApp Files Capacity Pool Capacity Planning","add.gcp.quota.bigquery":"Add GCP BigQuery Quota","oracle.db.metric.redobufferallocationretries.desc":"Redo Buffer Allocation Retries","cl.nw.ucs.fabric_extender.admin.power.state":"Fabric Extender Admin Power State","regional.network.firewall.policies":"Regional Network Firewall Policies","country.scotland":"Scotland","aws.agentcore.ratelimit.id":"Rate Limit ID","alibabacloud_ecs.sysompacketstatusdrop":"Packet Status Drop","practice.oci.boot.volume.auto.tune.disabled":"OCI Boot Volume - Auto-Tune Disabled","aws.cognito.id.pool.title":"Cognito Identity Pool","rca.errorcode.505":"HTTP Version Not Supported","azure.title.trigger.summary":"Triggers Execution Summary","plugin.app.sap_abap.report.avg.buf.calendar.directory.used":"Avg Calendar - Directory Used","rca.errorcode.504":"Gateway Timeout.The server, while acting as a 