nsights also provides diagnostic information, such as container restart failures, to help you isolate issues and resolve them quickly.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Container insights cannot be enabled after a cluster is created. Consider creating a new cluster with container insights enabled.<\/p>","nsx.interface.transmitted.bytes.topn":"Top 10 Interfaces by transmitted bytes","alibabacloud_oss.internet_send":"Internet Send","gcp.metric.csm.requestcountbyzone.desc":"Request Count By Zone","reports.hyperv.vm.memory":"Avg Virtual Machine Memory Assigned and Demand","aws.rdspi.db.checkpoint.edit":"DB Checkpoint Edit","sla.report":"SLA Report","kinesis.put.connectionserrors":"Put Media - Connection Errors","alibabacloud_rds.pg_walreceiver_iothroughput":"PostgreSQL WAL Receiver IO Throughput","oci.ca.crl.object.storage.bucket.name":"Object Storage Bucket Name","kube.etcd.p2p.rd":"P2P Round Trip","kinesis.put.latency":"Put Media - Latency","vmware.health.dashboard.top.cluster.cpu":"Top 10 VMware Cluster by CPU","oci.drg.rd.multiple.title":"DRG Route Distributions","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.lindormmultiwscanrtmax":"Lindorm Multi W Scan RT Max","mysql.metric.innodbxlockspinwaits.desc":"InnoDB X Lock Spin Waits","ec.redis.connections":"Current Connections","huaweicloud.info.authtype.secret_key":"This is the Secret Access Key paired with your AccessKey ID. Site24x7 uses it to securely access Huawei Cloud APIs.","max.dscluster.percent.used":"Maximum Storage Utilization (%)","kube.node.allocatable.membytes":"Memory Allocatable","help.assistant.oci.feature.title.subtitle.six":"Guidance Report","service.bindings":"Service bindings","oauth2.request.body.tooltip":"Add additional parameters to be sent while requesting for an access token.","aws.memorydb.global.regional.clusters":"Regional Clusters","reports.elb.client.reset":"Average Client Reset Count","aws.agentcore.codeinterpreter.list.system.errors":"Code Interpreter List System Errors","huaweicloud_elb.m8_out_bps