nit.ticketbleed":"TICKETBLEED","huaweicloud_cfw.monitor.type":"Huawei Cloud CFW","rca.dig.output":"Dig Output","report.status.conferr":"Configuration Error","app.ibm_i.report.heading.db.free.per":"Average DB Free (%)","cl.nw.ucs.rack.server.adaptorsUnkFw":"Adaptors Unk Fw","practice.volume.without.snapshot.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks Amazon Elastic Block Store (EBS) volume configuration for associated snapshot ID.<\/p> <p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>EBS provides persistent block level storage support for your EC2 instances. Snapshots are a point in time, incremental backups of the data stored in your EBS volume. For redundancy, these Snapshots get stored in S3 buckets across multiple Availability Zones. In the event of a failure, these snapshots help you to create new volumes or move volumes across Availability Zones or Regions.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Create weekly snapshots for your EBS volumes.<\/p>","aws.mq.message.ready.count":"Message Ready Count (CloudWatch)","cl.nw.ucs.chassis.configState":"Config State","huaweicloud_dcaas_vintf.local_gateway_v4_ip":"Local Gateway V4 Ip","report.apm.top.web.transactions.by.four.hundred.one.count":"Transactions by 401 Error Count","kube.mem.percentage":"Cluster Memory Percentage","mongodbatlas.node.fts.disk.usage":"FTS Disk Usage","plugin.mysql.aborted.clients":"Aborted Clients","alibabacloud_rds.cluster_tempdisktablecreates":"Cluster Temp Disk Table Creates","practice.oci.drg.unused":"OCI DRG - Unused","al.intro":"Introducing AppLogs","practice.aws.log.metric.filter.alarm.should.exist.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Determines if CloudWatch metric filter and alarm are present for detecting changes to CloudTrail configurations.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> Each time a configuration change is made at the CloudTrail service level, a CloudWatch alarm created in your AWS account is triggered. Use CloudWatch alarms to detect AWS CloudTrail configuration changes to maintain the integrity of the service configuration.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Ensure that a log metric filter and an alarm are enabled.<\/p>","push.third.party.param.source_type":"This is similar to the product_module.","msp.subscriptions.info":"Provides the subscription details of various customer accounts.","thirdparty.snow.integration.error":"Enable CMDB when you are choosing the Do Not Notify option.","kube.grtns":"Tag Not Specified","plugin.mysql.handler.observation":"Handler Operations","plugin.monitoring":"Monitoring","alibabacloud_rds.sqlserver_checkpointpagesrersec":"SQL Server Checkpoint Pages/sec","kubernetes.vm.capacity.type":"Kubernetes VM Capacity","cl.nf.discovery.failed":"NetFlow Device Addition Failed","oci.opensearch.subnet":"Subnet OCID","dynamodb.metric.put.latency":"Put Latency","alibabacloud_apsaradb_tair.splitrwnodeusedqps":"Split RW Node Used QPS","rds.aurora.aurora.pq.request.attempted":"Aurora Pq Request Attempted","add.oracle.rac.cluster":"Add Oracle RAC","eks.container.total.mem.failures":"Total Memory Failures","azure.metric.incomingallrequests.disp":"All Incoming Requests","spokesperson.role.desc":"User will have read access to all the modules. User will have permission to post public comments through Dashboards.","alibabacloud_cloud_backup.hwappliancediskinfo":"HW Appliance Disk Info","llm.saving.state":"Saving...","website.defacement.event.intro":"Now safeguard your brand\u2019s online identity in a matter of minutes. Set up Site24x7 Website Defacement Monitor to spot defacements on your website and rectify issues before your customers are affected.","practice.gcp.vpc.default.network.in.use.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks if the default network is being used in your VPC configuration.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>A default network is automatically created for each project with predefined settings that may not align with security best practices. It includes default firewall rules that allow ingress traffic on common ports and create subnets in each region with predetermined IP ranges.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Create custom VPC networks with properly defined subnets and firewall rules instead of using the default network. Consider deleting the default network if not needed to reduce the attack surface.<\/p>","thirdparty.chatgpt.generate.server.command.info":"Eg: Delete all log files that are older than 30 days.","aws.region.name":"Region name","help.assistant.automations.sns":"<ul><li><a href=\"{{help}}/it-automation/sns-actions.html\" target =\"_blank\">Publish SNS message<\/a><\/li><\/ul>","oci.fs.metadata.lat.remove":"Metadata Latency (Remove)","threshold.ping.notify":"Trouble Alert if pinged within {{n0}}","plugin.app.jboss.webapp.active.sessions":"Active Sessions","of365.chart.lyncsessions.title":"Session Statistics","vmware.vdi.hv.vdesktops.automated.disabled":"Number of Automated Desktop Pools in Disabled State","server.avail":"Availability","max.huaweicloud_vpcep.usage":"Max","huaweicloud_cfw.group.ips":"IPS Metrics","plugin.installation.linux.header":"Download and install the latest Linux Server agent before configuring a plugin.","azure.metric.systeminterfacepacketsrcvd.desc":"Interface packets received","data.responsecode.10010":"No data was received from the monitor.","snapshot.age.days":"Age (Days)","plugin.app.glassfish.child.webapp":"Web App","sdn.arubaedgeconnect.link.parent.device":"Parent Edge","cl.nw.ucs.fabric_interconnect.port.mode":"Port Mode","practice.azure.sites.untagged.desc":"Tag the Azure resources with appropriate key:value pairs to ease management.","15003":"Entra ID data collection is in progress. Kindly try after few minutes.","15002":"Azure Metric Selection Configuration Profile cannot be deleted since monitor(s) are associated","azure.dependency.legend.association":"Associated","15001":"Resource Deployment in Progress","app.ibm_i.diskdetails.disk.wait.time":"Disk Wait Time","es.metric.clusterstatus.red":"ClusterStatu