 : <\/b><\/p><p>Cloud Content Delivery Network(CDN) caches content at Google's edge locations to reduce latency, minimize origin server load, and reduce serving costs. Without Cloud CDN, your applications might experience increased latency, higher origin server load, and higher data transfer costs, especially for static content.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable Cloud CDN for your HTTP(S) load balancers to improve performance and reduce costs. Configure appropriate cache settings based on your application's content characteristics. For dynamic content that must be served from the origin, consider using cache control headers to optimize caching behavior.<\/p>","skype.chart.mediation.server":"Mediation Server","efs.permitted.throughput":"Permitted Throughput","client.marketing.vpc.bullet3":"The read-level actions necessary to discover VPC \"ec2:Describe*\", \"logs:Start*\", \"logs:Get*\", \"logs:Describe*\" is not present in the assigned policy JSON.","client.marketing.vpc.bullet2":"You have opted out of monitoring by unselecting the checkbox next to the VPC listing.","cl.nw.ucs.fabric_extender.server.portsoper.statesfpnotpresent":"Fabric Extender Server Portsoper Statesfpnotpresent","client.marketing.vpc.bullet4":"There are no Flow logs enabled for VPC.","huaweicloud_gaussdb.private_write_ips":"Private Write Ips","gcp.cloudsqlmysql.tab.computeavailability":"Compute and Availability","analytics.flink.managed.memory.total":"Managed Memory Total","aws.cloudwatch.logs.group.level.transformed.bytes":"Log Group Level Transformed Bytes","alibabacloud_mongodb.shardinglogdiskamount":"Sharding Log Disk Amount","huaweicloud_dcaas.apply_time":"Apply Time","cl.nw.san.port.mac.address":"MAC Address","aws.workspace.edit":"Edit WorkSpace Monitor","thirdparty.enable.attribute.info":"By enabling mapping for attribute alerts with the ServiceNow assignment group, you can assign a group to the ticket in ServiceNow based on the status: Trouble, Critical, or Down","apminsight.