 automated scanning and exploitation due to its role in providing administrative access to systems.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Restrict SSH access to specific trusted IP ranges or use more secure access methods like Identity-Aware Proxy (IAP) or bastion hosts. Consider implementing additional security controls like multi-factor authentication for SSH access.<\/p>","cl.fullstackagent.bulk.action.windows.version":"Selected Windows Agent Version","jsp.tools.csv-to-sql.apmfooter":"Want to <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/application-performance-monitoring.html\" style=\"color: #518AFE;\">find out the problematic query<\/a> that is causing slowness in your application? Use Site24x7 APM Insight.","practice.oci.autonomous.db.backup.retention.period.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether an Autonomous Database has a backup retention period of at least seven days.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>It is recommended to have a minimum backup retention period of seven days in order to achieve compliance requirements.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Consider setting the backup retention period of an Autonomous Database to at least seven days.<\/p>","aws.workspace.directory.id":"Directory ID","c2d.cpus":"C2d CPUs","client.marketing.lightsail.lb.bullet2":"You have opted out of monitoring by unselecting the checkbox next to the Lightsail Load Balancer listing.","avg.hyperv.rootvirtualprocessor.instructions":"Avg Root Virtual Processor Instructions","glue.job.last.modified":"Last Changed Date","oci.mt.fqdn":"Fully qualified domain name","mysql.plugin":"MySQL Monitoring","saas.application.github.desc":"A platform for version control and collaboration built around Git. Add a monitor to verify that the service remains reachable and functional.","wincls.alertmsg.resource.down":"Resource group \"{{n0}}\" is down.","aws.waf.wafsummary":"Web ACL Summary","rds.backtrack.window.alert":"Backtrack Window Alert","of365.max.shp.activedrivedeploy":"Max Ac