al Machines Split-up","alibabacloud_anycast_eip.AnycastEipBindInfoList":"Anycast Eip Bind Info List","oci.autodb.character.set":"Character set","al.mail.trial.st.con.2":"<br><br>We offer support to over <a href=''{{n0}}/help/log-management/supported-log-types.html'' target='_blank'>100 log types<\/a> and log frameworks by default, and you can also customize to monitor anything more. Our <a href=''{{n0}}/help/log-management/index.html'' target='_blank'>help documents<\/a> will walk you through the features and the steps to use them.","nutanix.num.of.disks":"Number of Disks","al.mail.trial.st.con.1":"Hi there,<br><br>Welcome aboard <a href=''{{n0}}/log-management.html'' target='_blank'>Site24x7 AppLogs<\/a> the one-stop solution for all your log management needs. You can now stay on top of your system and application issues with all your logs being monitored in a single dashboard with quick troubleshooting options. Configure and receive instantaneous <a href=''{{n0}}/help/log-management/alerts.html'' target='_blank'>alerts<\/a> which give you heads-up on the issues quickly.","al.mail.trial.st.con.4":"<br><br>Acknowledging your interest, we also offer you a 30-day free, unlimited access to all our log management features. Try the fully functional log management and register your valuable feedback at <a href='mailto:support@site24x7.com'>support@site24x7.com<\/a>.","al.mail.trial.st.con.3":"<br><br><b>Refer to:<\/b><br><a href=''{{n0}}/help/log-management/monitor-logs.html'' target='_blank'>Creating log profiles<\/a> | <a href=''{{n0}}/help/log-management/query-language.html'' target='_blank'>Query language<\/a> | <a href=''{{n0}}/help/log-management/saved-searches.html'' target='_blank'>Saved searches<\/a> | <a href=''{{n0}}/help/log-management/alerts.html'' target='_blank'>Alerts<\/a>","ad.reports.ldap.clientsessions":"Report for LDAP Client Sessions","oracle.db.metric.freecursorsper.desc":"Free Cursors Percentage","cloud.authentication.type.tokenbased":"Token-Based A