.<\/li><li>Search for specific error codes or fields within your logs to quickly identify and address issues, enhancing your troubleshooting capabilities.<\/li><li>Monitor only the log groups updated in the last month, providing better insights into currently active log groups and reducing noise from inactive logs.<\/li><\/ul>","apminsight.ins.alert.5xxerror.exceeds":"5xx Error count of instance  {{n0}}","global.unit.celsius":"Celsius","azure.recommended.action":"Recommended Action","cl.nw.meraki.org.api.nodata.solution":"No data received from Meraki Organization API.","apminsight.agentconfig.parametrizetracesql":"Obfuscate SQL Parameters","tencentcloud.newresourcescount":"Discovered Resources","azure.metric.originhealthpercentage.desc":"Origin Health Percentage","neptune.cluster.replicalag.maximum":"Cluster ReplicaLag Maximum","dms.task.capacity.type":"DMS Replication Task Capacity","threshold.availability.computedisk":"Performance Thresholds for GCP Disk","kube.kproxy.pen.enpchg.tot":"Total Pending Endpoint Changes","apminsight.slowtransactions.responsetime":"Resp. Time","sdn.cisco.sdwan.controller.details":"Controller Details","wincls.threshold.msgreceived.exceeds":"Message Received","global.action.type.appstream.action":"Amazon AppStream 2.0 Actions","oci.realm.domain":"Realm Domain","info.apminsight.http.errors.ignore":"Specified List of HTTP Error codes will be skipped from tracking.","uptime.button.integrate":"Integrate Uptime Buttons","ecs.disk.read.write.iops":"Disk Read/Write IOPS","dashboard.widget.currentstatus.ungrouped":"Ungrouped","oci.tunnel.time.status.updated":"Status Updated Time","global.time.To":"To","client.system":"System","report.mail.tencentcloud_tke.desc":"Tencent Cloud - TKE Report","gcp.metric.internal.backendrequestcount.desc":"Internal Backend request Count","alibabacloud_rds.pg_connectiontotal":"PostgreSQL Total Connections","al.log.tag.group.enable":"Enable Log Tag Group","ftp.errorcode.7021.1":"Password authentication successfully co