m.geographic.summary":"Geographic Summary","plugin.tomcat.instruction.content":"<p><ul><li>A Tomcat monitoring user with the required roles (<code>manager-gui<\/code>, <code>admin-gui<\/code>, <code>manager-script<\/code>) exists. Enter this user's credentials in the Username and Password fields.<\/li><li>If Tomcat is installed on the target server with the install type as <b>APT<\/b>, the monitoring user and roles are automatically created if the user does not exist or the password is incorrect.<\/li><li><p>For binary-installed Tomcat servers, create the monitoring user manually if it does not already exist.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>Follow the steps below:<ol><li>Navigate to the following directory: <code>/opt/tomcat/conf<\/code><\/li><li>Open the <code>tomcat-users.xml<\/code> file.<\/li><li>Ensure the following roles are added to the user:<copy>&lt;user username=\"&lt;USER&gt;\" password=\"&lt;PASSWORD&gt;\" roles=\"manager-gui,admin-gui\"/&gt;<br>&lt;user username=\"&lt;USER&gt;\" password=\"&lt;PASSWORD&gt;\" roles=\"manager-script\"/&gt;<\/copy><\/li><li>Restart the Tomcat server.<\/li><\/ol><\/p>","client.dd.rediscover":"Rediscover","ec2.elasticgraphics.gpu.health.avg":"Average GPU Health Check","country.vietnam":"Viet Nam","aws.agentcore.target.priority":"Priority","vmware.vdi.vd.min.num.sessions":"Min. Number of Sessions","azure.contributor.role.errormsg":"Please provide Contributor Role to your application","practice.azure.web.app.disable.ftp.desc":"FTP deployment should be disabled.","oci.waf.origin.requests":"Number of Requests - Module: origin","tencentcloud.loc.me-saudi-arabia":"Middle East (Riyadh)","azure.metric.tempdisklatency.desc":"Temp Disk Latency (Preview)","oci.waf.threat.bandwidth":"Bandwidth - Module: threat","alibabacloud_oss.InternetRecv":"Internet Recv","cl.ipam.discovered.subnets":"Discovered Subnets","ad.app.max.inbound.values":"Max Replication Inbound Values","plugin.app.glassfish.title.jsp.details":"JSP Details","aws.valkey.pub.sub.shard.chann