t.","al.fwd.prereq.webhook.1":"An HTTPS endpoint reachable from Site24x7 that accepts POST requests and responds with a 2xx status.","help.assistant.automations.rds":"<ul><li><a href=\"{{help}}/it-automation/rds-actions.html\" target =\"_blank\">Stop, start or reboot RDS instances<\/a><\/li><\/ul>","jsp.tools.json-to-yaml.title":"JSON to YAML Converter: Site24x7 Tools","aws.msk.broker.capacity.threshold":"Performance Thresholds for MSK Broker","nsx.bgp.established.connection.count":"Connections Established","neptune.cluster.identifier":"Cluster Identifier","cl.nw.storage.netapp.disk.util":"Disk Utilization","hyperv.logical.processors.exceeds":"Host Logical Processors","aws.cwhit.getmetricdata.text":"GetMetricData API Hits","kube.hpa.scaletarget.refname":"Scale Target Reference Name","shrpt.app.visio.errorrequests/sec":"Error Requests Per Sec","wincls.resource.view":"Resource Group View","network.interface.status":"Interface Status","ec2.autoscaling.ondemand.above.capacity":"On Demand Percentage Above Base Capacity","avg.rs.afailure":"Avg Access Violation","huaweicloud_gaussdb.gaussdb_mysql342_iostat_iops_write":"Write IOPS","sdn.common.2.4.ghz.clients":"2.4 GHz Clients","thirdparty.zanalytics.plus.description":"Get a comprehensive view of your key business metrics, create appealing data visualizations, insightful dashboards, etc. and get an insight into your IT operations.","global.upgrade.total.permonth":"Total cost/month","shrink.last.fourtyeight.hours":"This report is based on last 48 hour's data.","server.checks.alerting.mechanism":"Alerting Mechanism","al.db.ops.ac":"Alerts Created","lightsail.database.public.access.enabled":"Public Access Enabled","practice.auto.scaling.template.metadata.response.hop.limit.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether Amazon EC2 Instance Auto Scaling group launch template configuration has a metadata response hop limit greater than one.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>The Instance Metadata Service (IMDS) provides metadata information about an Amazon EC2 instance and is useful for application configuration. Restricting the HTTP PUT response for the metadata service to only the EC2 instance protects the IMDS from unauthorized use.<\/p><p><p>The Time To Live (TTL) field in the IP packet is reduced by one on every hop. This reduction can be used to ensure that the packet does not travel outside EC2. If metadata response hop limit is greater than one, the token can leave the EC2 instance.<\/p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Consider modifying metadata response hop limit of the launch template to one.<br>(<b>Note:<\/b> Modifying a launch template will create a new version of the template. Consider deleting older versions of the launch template if they're no longer required.).<\/p>","apminsight.units.percent":"%","al.fwd.section.schedule":"Schedule & Retry","al.db.ops.ae":"Alert Events","purchaseaddon.alertpack.text":"Include SMS/Voice Alert Credits","threshold.memory.reserved.pod.exceeds":"{{n0}} : Memory Reserved for Pod exceeds {{n1}} %.","dynamodb.reports.avg.query.latency":"Average Query Latency","multiple.azure.resource.frontdoor":"Azure Front Doors (classic)","vmware.help.text.esxi.auto.add":"Automatically discover and create monitors for every ESX/ESXi host in the vCenter.","global.smtp.dnstime.units":"SMTP DNS Response Time (ms)","nw.eigrp.srtt.report":"Smooth Round Trip Time Report","alibabacloud_rds.mysqlredologsize":"MySQL Redo Log Size","veeam.avg.successfull.backupjob.count.location.avg":"Avg Successfull Backup Jobs by Location","app.ibm_i.report.max.currentintractiveperformanceper":"Max Current Interactive Performance (%)","msp.saml.auth.delete.confirm":"Deleting SAML will remove SAML based SSO for this Customer. Do you wish to delete it?","title.server.network.bytes.received":"NIC Input Traffic","al.db.ops.nas":"New Alert Summary","rum.resources.cdn":"CDN Resources","cl.nw.storage.netapp.node.wafl.metadata.io":"Wafl Metadata Io","cl.nw.ucs.fi_storage_partition.mon