he AWS account.","client.marketing.bedrock.knowledge.base.service.bullet3":"The read-level actions necessary to discover Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases  \"bedrock:ListKnowledgeBases\" and \"bedrock:GetKnowledgeBase\" are not present in the assigned policy JSON.","oci.autodb.is.storage.autoscaled.reason":"Storage Autoscaling Activated","regional.external.managed.backend.services":"Regional External Managed Backend Services per Project Region","cl.nw.trap.processor.help.failurecomponent":"This option is useful when you deal with a single trap OID that has multiple failure components. The Varbinds containing more details on the trap will have information on the failed components (entities like CPU, Temperature etc). You can match the entity too by appending the VarBind number in this field to generate separate alarms for the failed components. For instance, $Source_trapName_trap_$v5.","oci.region.apseoul1":"Seoul, South Korea","alibabacloud_apsaramq_kafka.groupmessagenumoutput":"Group Message Num Output","server.unit.count":"Count","practice.oci.bucket.oci.bucket.logging.disabled.desc":"Storage bucket should have access logging enabled","winupdate.showdetails.title":"Updates Summary","preview.role":"Preview Role","ncm.compliance.configuration.custom.config.block.start":"Configuration Block Start","aws.agentcore.harness.version":"Harness Version","server.cdiscovery.not.supported":"Action not supported for this version of agent.","esx.tabs.overview":"Monitor Overview","emr.running.maptasks":"Running Map Tasks","alibabacloud_apsaradb_clickhouse.clickhousefailedinsertqueryee":"Failed Insert Query (EE)","azure.metric.ProvisioningRuns.disp":"Provisioning Runs","aws.msk.broker.capacity.type":"MSK Broker Capacity Monitor","cl.nw.san.quota.db.ugt.scan.state":"Quota DB UGT Scan State","aws.guard.duty.threshold.count.exceeds":"{{n0}} : Findings Count {{n1}}.","k8s.pd.drag.to.resize":"Drag to resize","thirdparty.notify.status.empty.error":"This field is mandatory","global.action.s