.domain.help.txt.eu":"<div>You can publish the status of your services using this domain. It will be accessible even if your website is down. Follow the steps below to publish the service status via your custom domain: <\/div><ul class=\"padl15 mrgtb10\"><li class=\"mrgbot5\">Create an HTTPS domain to host your status page.<\/li><li>Configure the CNAME record in the DNS zone file to point your domain name to site24x7host.eu.<\/li><a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/kb/articles/how-to-map-your-cname-record-and-enable-status-page-access-via-a-custom-domain\" target=\"_blank\">Know More<\/a><li class=\"mrgtb5\">Access <b>Site24x7 Admin > Share > Add Status Page<\/b>, configure your <em>domain name<\/em> and <em>custom URL path<\/em> and click <b>Save<\/b>.<\/li><li>Within <b>15 mins<\/b> of configuring your status page, you will be able to access the service status view via the custom domain.<\/li><\/ul>","cl.server.auto.discover.container":"Auto-Discover Docker Containers","vxrail.cluster.health.status":"VxRail Cluster Health Status","aws.bedrock.agent.capacity.type":"Bedrock Agent Capacity","al.server.agent.upgrade":"Upgrade AppLog Agent","ebsvolume.avg.write.latency.threshold":"Volume Average Write Latency","aws.waf.totalcountedrequests":"Total CountedRequests","nsx.bgp.neighbor.perf":"BGP Neighbor Performance Details","amazon.errorcode.11703":"AWS Backup Vault Permission Not Granted","aws.s3.sf":"S3","amazon.errorcode.11702":"AWS Backup Vault is Deleted","thirdparty.zanalytics.plus.create.report":"Create Reports in Analytics Plus","amazon.errorcode.11701":"AWS Backup Permission Not Granted","amazon.errorcode.11700":"AWS Backup is Disabled","network.path.node.label":"Node label","vc.rp.child.memory.overall.usage":"Child Resource Pool Memory Overall Usage","amazon.errorcode.11709":"VPC Transit Gateway Attachment Flow Log permission not granted","client.marketing.plugin.bullet1":"<a href=\"{{help}}/admin/adding-a-monitor/plugins.html\" target=\"_blank\">Down