ve disabled discovery and want Site24x7 to monitor your AWS Backup Resource Type, then click on the Edit Integrated AWS Account button shown below, scroll down to the Discovery Options section, select the check box next to the AWS Backup listing and click on Save.","bgp.leak.unknown.parties":"<b>Unauthorized Transit Networks<\/b><br> <i>Description:<\/i><br> Route traverses through autonomous systems that are not recognized as legitimate transit providers or expected network operators for this routing path, indicating potential route leak through unauthorized networks.<br> <i>Detection:<\/i><br> Route passes through {{n0}} unknown or unexpected AS(es): [{{n1}}]. These ASes are not recognized transit providers or expected network operators in the normal routing path for this prefix. This pattern may indicate a route leak where traffic is being routed through unauthorized or unexpected networks.","oci.permission.postgres.node":"Manage Postgres DB Nodes","test.alert.prominent.feature.tour":"<div><h5>Trigger Test Alerts<\/h5><div>You can trigger test alerts from here.<\/div><\/div>","apminsight.download.php.linux.agent":"Download PHP Linux Agent","server.process.instance.threshold":"Process Instance count Threshold","avg.biztalkserver.totalmessagespublished":"Avg Total Messages Published","msk.replicator.message.lag":"Message Lag","azure.snapshots":"Snapshots","nsx.node":"NSX-T Node","app.ibm_i.report.heading.asp.total":"Average ASP Total","help.assistant.s3endpoint.content.2":"<ul><li>Select from a list of more than 90 global locations<\/li><li>Run checks every 1 minute<\/li><li>Choose any HTTP method including GET and HEAD<\/li><li>Visualize DNS resoulution and connection time<\/li><\/ul>","amazon.firehose.monitor":"Kinesis Firehose","help.assistant.s3endpoint.content.1":"Know immediately when your S3 object URLs become slow or go down.","alibabacloud_ecs.sysom_pingtrace_lrxtaskwaking":"Ping Trace LRX Task Waking","help.assistant.s3endpoint.content.3":"<a href=\"{{help}}/aws/s3-integration.html#object-endpoint\" target =\"_blank\"> Learn more<\/a>","cl.nw.storage.netapp.iscsi.login.failed":"Login Failed","alibabacloud_apsaradb_hbase.allocatedcontainers":"Allocated Containers","huaweicloud_gaussdb.gaussdb_mysql119_disk_used_ratio":"Disk Usage","amazon.errorcode.11683":"CloudWatch agent Plugin Procstat is Inactive","amazon.errorcode.11682":"CloudWatch agent Plugin Procstat is Removed","amazon.errorcode.11681":"CloudWatch agent Plugin Procstat Permission not Granted","cl.nw.ucs.fabric.extender.switchPortsmodepromiscuousAccess":"Switch Ports Mode Promiscuous Access","isp.maxlatency":"Maximum Latency","aws.bedrock.agent.tab":"Agents","global.ec2cwagent.monitortype":"CloudWatch Agent","cl.nf.flow.export.device.type.info":"Select the vendor or type of the device that is exporting flow data to Site24x7.","practice.aws.route53.public.hosted.zone.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Checks the publicly available hosted zone with private DNS records in order to prevent information expose outside of AWS.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> Checks AWS Route 53 Public Hosted Zones that contain DNS records for private IPs/resources. For publishing website you need public hosted zone and private hosted zone only responds to queries coming from within the associated VPC. You can use Amazon Route 53 to configure split-view DNS, also known as split-horizon DNS. If you want to maintain internal and external versions of the same website or application, you can configure public and private hosted zones to return different internal and external IP addresses for the same domain name.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Makesure that you don't have any private DNS records in your Route 53 Public Hosted Zones.<\/p>","rdspi.db.buffer.manager.page.writes":"Page Writes","sdn.cisco.sdwan":"Catalyst","azure.metric.RebootingNodeCount.disp":"Rebooting Node Count","statsd.monitor.haa.2":"Yes, a Linux monitoring agent is required to discover the application metrics that are pushed to StatsD. Ensure the agent version is 17.7.0 and above to use this feature.","statsd.monitor.haa.1":"The Site24x7-StatsD Integration is a metrics aggregation service, bundled with the Site24x7 server monitoring agent. The agent gets the custom application metrics through the StatsD protocol and pushes it to Site24x7.","dns.record.dnskey":"DNSKEY","ad.app.avg.ntdsapi.read":"Avg NTDSAPI Reads","statsd.monitor.haa.5":"Up to 500 metrics without threshold checks are free. Metrics with thresholds will be considered as paid monitors. 10 paid metrics will be considered as 1 Basic monitor.","statsd.monitor.haa.4":"Timer, counter, gauge, and set metrics can be monitored using Site24x7 StatsD Integration.","apm.business.analytics.configure.journey":"Configure Journey","statsd.monitor.haa.3":"Ensure <i>Enable StatsD Metrics<\/i> is set to <b>Yes<\/b> in the <b>Admin > Server Monitor > Settings<\/b> page. The host and the port should be configured correctly in the <i>/opt/site24x7/monagent/metrics/statsd/statsd.cfg<\/i> file.","eks.container.filesystem.utilization":"File System Utilization","alibabacloud_apsaramq_rocketmq.sendmessagecountpertopic":"Send Message Count Per Topic","rds.readthroughput.text":"Read Throughput","aws.agentcore.execution.role.arn":"Execution Role ARN","event.correlation.llm.config":"Correlation LLM Prompt Config","cl.server.plugin.windows.security":"Windows Security","aws.ecr.pub.repo.title":"ECR Public Repository","cl.dhcp.ad.username.info":"Enter the username for Active Directory authentication.","mysql.chart.qcache.free.blocks":"Qcache Free Blocks","app.ibm_i.report.min.batchjobsonunassignedjobqueue":"Min Batch Jobs on Unassigned Job Queue","nutanix.cluster.configuration":"Nutanix Cluster Configuration","cl.nw.storage.netapp.disk.power.on.time.interval":"Power On Time Interval","amazon.errorcode.11664":"EC2_CWAGENT is Inactive","amazon.errorcode.11663":"EC2_CWAGENT is removed","alibabacloud_analyticsdb_postgres.adbpgse