2 CPUs per Project Region","practice.amazon.cloudFront.distributions.configure.origin.failover.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks if monitored CloudFront distributions have origin failover configured.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>CloudFront distributions with origin failover configured provide high availability. Distributions can be configured to have primary and secondary origin, whereby if the primary satisfies the configured failover criteria, then the secondary can be used to serve content.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><p><p>Configure failover for distributions by satisfying all the conditions below:<ul><li>CloudFront distribution should have at least two origins.<\/li><li>CloudFront distribution should have an origin group with primary and secondary origins configured.<\/li><li>The CloudFront distribution origin group should have failover criteria configured.<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","aws.amq.nc.add":"Add Amazon MQ Network Connector","az.title.dbacc.documentcount":"Document Count","global.cloud.servers":"Cloud Server","cl.nw.ucs.fabric.extender.portChannelsadminStatedisabled":"Port Channels Admin State Disabled","cl.nw.ucs.fabric.extender.serverPortsadminStatedisabled":"Server Ports Admin State Disabled","sdn.mist.wan.edge.topn.ospf.peers.down":"Juniper Mist WAN Edges by OSPF Peers Down","oci.help.assistant.mysql.title.1":"Site24x7's integration with MySQL DB Systems provides you the following benefits:","apminsight.allcomponents.throughput.graph.info":"Number of requests handeled per minute by a component. Top 5 components with a higher throughput is shown here.","neptune.cluster.replicalag.avg":"Average Cluster Replica Lag","huaweicloud_autoscaling.disk_write_bytes_rate":"Disk Write Rate","kube.vmi.conditions":"VMI Conditions","global.action.hyperv.processor.count":"Set Processor Count","cl.nw.san.hardware.current.value":"Current Value","rum.dashboard.inactive.apps":"Inactive Websites or Applications","firehose.bucket.arn":"S3 Bucket ARN","ste