><p>User-managed keys for internal service accounts (like those ending with iam.gserviceaccount.com) create unnecessary security risks. These internal service accounts are meant to be managed by Google Cloud services, and manual key management introduces potential misconfigurations.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Avoid creating user-managed keys for internal service accounts. Use alternative authentication methods appropriate for the service, such as workload identity federation, impersonation, or attached service accounts.<\/p>","alerts.alerthistory":"Alert Logs","2508":"Attribute - \"{{n0}}\" for child resource \"{{n1}}\" already configured in category - \"{{n2}}\". Duplicate Configurations not allowed.","cl.nw.monitor.template.metric.name":"Metric Name","cl.nw.ucs.fabric_extender.server.portsoper.stateadmindown":"Fabric Extender Server Portsoper Stateadmindown","2507":"Attribute - \"{{n0}}\" already configured in category - \"{{n1}}\". Duplicate Configurations not allowed.","2506":"We already have a monitor with same url.If you are the owner or admin of your Url, please contact support@site24x7.com to streamline the usage.","oracle.insight.invalid.objects":"Invalid Objects","cl.nw.storage.netapp.disk.user.reads":"User Reads","wanrtt.monitor.valid.payload":"Enter valid Payload value.","delete.plugin.template":"Delete Template","activedirectory.ds.threadsused":"Threads Used","azure.customer.id":"Customer ID","multiple.azure.netappfiles.capacitypool":"Azure NetApp Files Capacity Pools","emr.step.identifier":"Generated Step Identifier","reports.servers.ram":"Servers By RAM","poller.latest.version.desc":"Access new features with improved performance and a smoother user experience.","practice.gcp.vm.disable.preemptive.desc":"Google Cloud Platform (GCP) preemptible instances displayed below.","apminsight.min.cputime":"Min. CPU Time","glue.crawler.source":"Crawler Data Source","aws.bedrock.model.lifecycle.status":"Model lifecycle status","aws.agentcore.policy.en