updating task definition with container definition with the read-only root file system option enabled.<br><b>Note:<\/b><ul><li>When you update a task definition, it does not update running tasks that were launched from the previous task definition. To update a running task, you must re-deploy the task with the new task definition.<\/li><li>Certain operating system software running inside a container may need to write to the root file system for proper functioning. Assess the usage of container and decide whether to give read-only access or not.<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","emr.mr.decommissionednodes":"MR Decommissioned Nodes","cl.nw.san.aggregate.wv.fsinfo.blks.reserve":"Aggregate Wv Fsinfo Blks Reserve","incident.compare":"Compare","device.ups.outputcurrent":"Output current","ses.last.fresh.start":"Last Fresh Start","scheduled.reports.quarterly.info":"Specify the business quarter months as per your need so as to schedule a quarterly report during the first month of every quarter.<br><br>   E.g. Upon selecting \"Feb - May - Aug - Nov\" as your default business quarter, the report will be scheduled  at a specified date and hour of February, May, August, and November months.<br><br>   Note: Suppose the selected date doesn't fall/exist in the calendar month range, (for e.g. February 30) the report will be scheduled for the last day of the month, i.e. February 29, at the selected time, by default.","public.report.note.text.edit":"Edit Public Report","apminsight.nodata.down.header.msg":"Agent is not communicating with Site24x7 Server. Last data collection was","llm.chart.avg.cost.per.request":"Avg Cost Per Request","alibabacloud_cloud_backup.IndexUpdateTime":"Index Update Time","mysqlndbnode.metric.indexmemoryavailable.desc":"Index Memory Available","al.db.gcp.method.actions":"Method Actions","alert.failure.fourth":"Notify after four continuous failures","global.bulk.edit.not.supported":"Bulk Edit is not supported in Free Edition","tpt.jira.isty.info":"Choose the Jira Issue Type t