l be resolved automatically when the monitor turns \"UP\".<\/li><li> <b>Close Incident:<\/b> The incident will be closed automatically when the monitor turns \"UP\".<\/li><li> <b> Custom Status : <\/b>When monitor is Up, the incident state will be updated to custom status.<\/li><\/ol>","restapimetrics.fields.example.value":"Fields Value","databricks.job.task_failure_percentage":"Task Failure (%)","predefined.report.9.description":"Response time over time for web monitors","client.lightsail.lb.service.monitor.info":"Monitor resource usage and performance for Lightsail Load Balancer.","vpc.tot.traffic.report":"Total Traffic Report","rds.storage.encrypted":"Storage Encrypted","amazon.errorcode.11053":"Amazon MQ Broker Permission not Granted","amazon.errorcode.11052":"EKS Permission not Granted","amazon.errorcode.11051":"Lightsail Instance Permission not Granted","amazon.errorcode.11050":"Certificate Manager Permission Not Granted","oauth2.empty.access.token.uri":"Access Token URI cannot be empty","gcp.kms.monitortype":"GCP Cloud KMS","ad.monitor.feature.desc":"Get insights on the performance metrics of Microsoft Active Directory details including active client sessions of LDAP, Replication traffic, Database instances, Domain Services and more.","scheduled.maintenance.monthly.bydate.time.passed":"The maintenance will be scheduled from the upcoming month as today's Start Time set by you has already passed.","practice.kinesis.stream.kms.encrypted.desc":"Checks for Amazon Kinesis Data Streams where Server-Side Encryption (SSE) is enabled by AWS managed CMKs","aws.rmq.web.console":"Web Console","plugin.app.glassfish.report.min.waiting":"Min Waiting","apminsight.compare.not.supported.message":"Compare View isn't supported for this page.","alibabacloud_analyticsdb_mysql.executoravgreadbytesmb":"Executor Average Read Bytes (MB)","biztalkserver.alertmsg.trackingdatasize":"Tracking data size for message box \"{{n0}}\"  {{n1}}","velocloud.orch.apikey.info":"Enter the API key of a