se Database backup retention period meets minimum standards.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>A short retention period limits your ability to recover from incidents discovered after a delay. A minimum of 30 days is recommended based on workload criticality.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Increase the backup retention period to meet recovery requirements.<\/p>","global.automation.success":"The test automation was executed successfully on {{n0}}","apminsight.recent.txn.traces":"Recent Transaction Traces","client.monitor.type.info":"Choose the monitor type to be added as a capacity planning.","oci.drg.type":"DRG","dashboard.widget.general.notes.empty.desc":"Changing the Content/Title will let you preview the widget you add to the dashboard.","of365.shp.licenseassign.history":"Assigned License History","oci.database.availability.avg":"Average Database Availability","aws.cloudwatch.logs.medium.anomaly.count":"Medium Priority Anomaly Count","vmware.vdi.label.title.uag.details":"Unified Access Gateway Details","sdn.ubiquitiUnifi.device.uplink.rx.rate.bps":"Uplink Rx Rate","amazon.quota.name.title":"Quota Name","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.ExpiredMilliseconds":"Expired Milliseconds","azure.metric.plushttpresponsecount.desc":"Server zone HTTP responses","of365.widget.servicehealth.title":"Service Health","ad.app.avg.nspi.read":"Avg NSPI Reads","rca.traceroute.error.reason.1000":"Destination network cannot be reached","oci.mt.export.set.id":"Export Set OCID","security.policy.rules.per.project1":"Security Policy Rules per Project Region","azure.metric.SenderDisconnects.disp":"SenderDisconnects","mysql.metric.maxconnections.desc":"Max Connections Allowed","report.mail.tencentcloud_waf.desc":"Tencent Cloud - WAF Report","sdn.arista.probe.probe.jitter.millis.min":"Min Probe Jitter","reports.top.nf.if.volume.tx":"Top 10 Interfaces by Tx Volume","ec2.cwagent.disk.inodes.free":"Disk Inodes Free","vmware.vdi.hv.machines.available.state":"Number of Machines in Available S