tigation","aws.secret.manager.rotation.enabled":"Rotation enabled","incident.settings.info":"Alert Noise Reduction Settings","esx.network.linkspeed":"Link Speed (Mbps)","redshift.queries.succeeded.ctas":"CTAS Queries Succeeded","server.conf.overview.noservice":"No services are currently being monitored for alerting.","global.statsd.template.monitor":"StatsD Integration","alert.duplicate.url":"This URL is already configured for this profile","analytics.record.format":"Record Format","cl.core.dash.topn.resType.tooltip":"Select All Monitors to list the Top N monitors across all the monitors in the account. Select Monitor Group to view the Top N monitors for the selected metric in that group.","cl.nw.meraki.status.change.msg":"The status of the device <span class=\"bold\">'{{n0}}'<\/span> has been updated to <span class=\"bold\">'{{n1}}'<\/span>","ebs.debug.count":"Number of Debug events","aws.msk.subtitle":"Amazon MSK is a fully managed service that enables you to build and run applications that use Apache Kafka to process streaming data.Get a detailed view on your Kafka Applications health by monitoring the Clusters, Brokers, Topics, Replicators and Connectors.","iis.apps.detail":"Active Application Details","practice.aws.auto.scaling.elb.health.check.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Checks if auto scaling groups associated with a load balancer have a health check configuration for the load balancer.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> The default health checks for an auto scaling group are EC2 status checks only, and the ASG does not consider an instance unhealthy if it fails the health checks provided by a load balancer. You can determine an instance's health provided by the load balancer by configuring the ASG to use load balancer health check.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Add a load balancer health check to an ASG so that instance health is determined by the EC2 status checks and the load balancer health checks.<\/p>","oci.unit.parses.persecond":"Parses Per Second","sdn.mist.switch.cpu.idle.avg":"Avg CPU Idle","global.child.type":"Child Type","az.title.redis.operationspersecond":"operations Per Second","bu.monitors.summary.warning":"The usage count for the Business Unit has exceeded 10K monitors. You may tend to experience a deterioration in screen rendering of data with the addition of more monitors. Please create a new business unit and allocate additional monitor licenses there for a better user experience. <a ng-click=\"dismissBUWarning()\">Dismiss<\/a>","aws.appsync.cache.curr.items.avg":"Current Items Avg","plugin.app.glassfish.report.heading.usedheapsize.count":"Average Used Heap Size","client.viewaccount":"View My Account Settings","aws.msk.replicator.capacity.threshold":"Performance Thresholds for MSK Replicator","mail.presales.activity.eval.pkg.content.3":"<body style=\"font-family: Proxima Nova, Roboto, Sans-Serif, opensans, Helvetica; font-size: 14px; padding: 15PX;\">Hi,<br><br>Monitoring and managing modern IT <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/infrastructure-monitoring.html?src=tip-mailer\">infrastructures<\/a> is critical and challenging. Site24x7 can help you monitor them seamlessly. <br><br><b>Hybrid IT infrastructure challenges<\/b><ul><li>Managing diverse on-premises, containerized, and cloud resources<\/li><li>Balancing resource allocation to prevent overprovisioning or underprovisioning in dynamic environments<\/li><li>Troubleshooting issues in ephemeral workloads.<\/li><\/ul><b>How Site24x7 helps with unified monitoring and automation<\/b><br><ul><li>Holistic monitoring across physical, virtual, containerized, and cloud-native resources<\/li><li>AI-driven capacity planning and auto-healing capabilities for streamlined management<\/li><\/ul><b>Onboarding essentials: <\/b>Download our white paper on <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/whitepapers/multi-cloud-monitoring.pdf\">multi-cloud observability<\/a> for your hybrid cloud environments. <br><br><b>Best practices<\/b>: Follow Site24x7''s <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/help/best-practices/?src=tip-mailer\">best practices<\/a> for monitoring hybrid IT.<br><br><b>Complete your setup<\/b>: Complete your Site24x7 setup by referring to the <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/app/client#/home/help-assistant\">recommendations<\/a> to get the most out of your monitoring experience.<div style=\"border: 1px solid #21BC63; padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; margin:15px auto 0px; cursor: pointer; background: #21BC63; color: #fff; text-align: center; width: 100px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/app/client#/admin/inventory/monitors-configure/SERVER/-/server\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff; text-decoration: none;\">Get started<\/a><\/div><br><br><br><b>Need assistance?<\/b><br><br><a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/schedule-demo.html?src=presales-mail-server?src=tip-mailer\">Schedule a personalized demo<\/a> with our product experts and learn how Site24x7 can cater to your organization''s website monitoring needs. You can also <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/webinars.html?src=tip-mailer\">register now<\/a> and join our experts for a live product demo webinar.<br><br>Regards,<p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">The Site24x7 team | ZOHO Corp<\/p> <p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">US: +1 408 352 9117 | UK: +44 203 564 7893 <\/p> <p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">AUS: +61 280 662 895 | NL: +31 707006121 <\/p> <p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">4708 HWY 71 E, Del Valle, TX 78617-3216, USA<\/p> <p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">About Site24x7 <\/a> | <a href=\"{{n1}}/overview.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Help guide <\/a> | <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/home?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Knowledge base <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/community/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Community <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/request-demo.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Demo <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/training.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Training<\/a><\/p><\/body>","mail.presales.activity.eval.pkg.content.2":"<body style=\"font-family: Proxima Nova, Roboto, Sans-Serif, opensans, Helvetica; font-size: 14px; padding: 15PX;\">Hi,<br><br>As you explore Site24x7, here''s how to improve user satisfaction and ensure smooth <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/digital-experience-monitoring.html\">digital experiences<\/a><br><br><b>Challenges with business-critical websites<\/b><ul><li>Ensuring continuous uptime and speed.<\/li><li>Delivering consistent content across devices.<\/li><li>Maintaining trust and satisfaction.<\/li><\/ul><b>Providing a better user experience with Site24x7''s website monitoring<\/b><ul><li>Monitor website availability, performance, and latency.<\/li><li>Proactively test business-critical workflows with synthetic monitoring.<\/li><li>Capture real user interactions and optimize experiences.<\/li><\/ul><br><br><div style=\"border: 1px solid #21BC63; padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; margin:15px auto 0px; cursor: pointer; border-color: #21BC63; color: #000; text-align: center; width: 650px;\"><span>Recognized in the 2024 GartnerAE Magic Quadrant\u2122 for Digital Experience Monitoring<\/span><\/div><br><br><b>Onboarding essentials : <\/b>Check out our <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/ebook/performance-ebook.pdf\">digital experience monitoring guide <\/a> for strategies.<br><br><b>Best practices: <\/b>Follow Site24x7''s best practices for website monitoring for easy setup, analysis, and website maintenance.<br><br><b>Complete your setup: <\/b>Complete your Site24x7 setup by referring to the <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/app/client#/home/help-assistant\">recommendations <\/a>to get the most out of your monitoring experience.<br><br><div style=\"border: 1px solid #21BC63; padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; margin:15px auto 0px; cursor: pointer; background: #21BC63; color: #fff; text-align: center; width: 100px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/app/client#/admin/inventory/monitors-form/URL/0?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff; text-decoration: none;\">Get started<\/a><\/div><b>Need assistance?<\/b><br><a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/schedule-demo.html?src=tip-mailer\">Schedule a personalized demo<\/a> with our product experts and learn how Site24x7 can cater to your organization''s digital experience goals. You can also <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/webinars.html?src=tip-mailer\">register now<\/a> and join our experts for a live product demo webinar.<br><br>Regards,<p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">The Site24x7 team | ZOHO Corp<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">US: +1 408 352 9117 | UK: +44 203 564 7893 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">AUS: +61 280 662 895 | NL: +31 707006121 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">4708 HWY 71 E, Del Valle, TX 78617-3216, USA<\/p> <p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">About Site24x7 <\/a> | <a href=\"{{n1}}/overview.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Help guide <\/a> | <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/home?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Knowledge base <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/community/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Community <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/request-demo.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Demo <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/training.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Training<\/a><\/p><\/body>","mail.presales.activity.eval.pkg.content.1":"<body style=\"font-family: Proxima Nova, Roboto, Sans-Serif, opensans, Helvetica; font-size: 14px; padding: 15PX;\">Hi,<br><br>We''re excited to have you on board! To ensure you make the most of our monitoring platform, here''s a quick-start guide to set up your IT environment for seamless monitoring:<br><br><ul><li><b>Add your first monitor: <\/b> Start monitoring websites, servers, applications, cloud services, or network devices<\/li><li><b>Explore our AI-powered platform features: <\/b>Leverage our powerful AI-powered insights to optimize performance, detect anomalies, and automate routine tasks for proactive issue resolution.<\/li><li><b>Configure alerts: <\/b>Group your IT teams, tailor alert channels, and streamline incident response workflows.<\/li><li><b>Collaborate with your team:<\/b>Add team members, assign roles, and manage users for a unified monitoring experience.<\/li><li><b>Leverage dashboards and reports: <\/b>Unlock actionable insights with dynamic dashboards and tailored reports that make monitoring effortless.<\/li><\/ul><div style=\"border: 1px solid #21BC63; padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; margin:15px auto 0px; cursor: pointer; background: #21BC63; color: #fff; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/app/client#/admin/inventory/add-monitor?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff; text-decoration: none;\">Get started with monitoring<\/a><\/div><br><br><b>Learn more<\/b><br><ul><li><b><a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/help/\">User guide: <\/a><\/b> Here''s our user guide to help you get the hang of Site24x7. Also, go through the <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/en/kb/site24x7/\">knowledge base articles <\/a>and <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Site24x7\">videos<\/a> when you need help.<\/li><li><b><a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/schedule-demo.html?src=presales-mail-network\">Product demo: <\/a><\/b> Schedule a personalized demo with our product experts and learn how Site24x7 can cater to your organization''s IT monitoring needs.<\/li><li><b>Training<\/b> Explore our <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://training.site24x7academy.com/#/home\">learning management system <\/a> and online  <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/training.html\">training<\/a> programs to master monitoring with ease.<\/li><\/ul><b>Stay informed<\/b><br><br> Over the next couple of weeks, we''ll be sharing a few more tips to help you make the most of Site24x7. If you have any questions, reply to this email, and we''ll get back to you.<br><br>Regards,<p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">The Site24x7 team<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">US: +1 408 352 9117 | UK: +44 203 564 7893 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">AUS: +61 280 662 895 | NL: +31 707006121 <\/p> <p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">4708 HWY 71 E, Del Valle, TX 78617-3216, USA<\/p> <p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">About Site24x7 <\/a> | <a href=\"{{n1}}/overview.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Help guide <\/a> | <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/home?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Knowledge base <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/community/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Community <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/request-demo.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Demo <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/training.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Training<\/a><\/p><\/body>","mail.presales.activity.eval.pkg.content.7":"<body style=\"font-family: Proxima Nova, Roboto, Sans-Serif, opensans, Helvetica; font-size: 14px; padding: 15PX;\">Hi $CXNAME,<br><br>Your 30-day Site24x7 trial is set to expire today.<br><br>To avoid any interruptions, we recommend upgrading now. Once your trial ends, your monitors will move to a suspended state, impacting your ability to stay on top of your critical IT assets.<br><br>Here''s how you can upgrade:<ul><li><b>For Site24x7: <\/b>Log in to your account, navigate to<b> Admin > Subscriptions, <\/b>and click <b>Upgrade your account.<\/b><\/li><li><b>For CloudSpend: <\/b>Log in to your account and go to <b>Upgrade your account.<\/b><\/li><li><b>For StatusIQ: <\/b>Log in to your account and proceed to <b>Upgrade your account.<\/b><\/li><\/ul>Need more time or have questions about pricing? Let us know-we''re happy to discuss an extension or address any concerns.<br><br>Looking for additional guidance? Register for a <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/schedule-demo.html\">detailed product demo.<\/a><br><br>Don''t let your monitoring stop-upgrade now to continue experiencing the power of Site24x7.    <br><br>Regards,<p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">The Site24x7 team | ZOHO Corp<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">US: +1 408 352 9117 | UK: +44 203 564 7893 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">AUS: +61 280 662 895 | NL: +31 707006121 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">4708 HWY 71 E, Del Valle, TX 78617-3216, USA<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">About Site24x7 <\/a> | <a href=\"{{n1}}/overview.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Help guide <\/a> | <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/home?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Knowledge base <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/community/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Community <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/request-demo.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Demo <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/training.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Training<\/a><\/p><\/body>","huaweicloud_dms_rocketmq.monitor.type":"Huawei Cloud DMS RocketMQ","mail.presales.activity.eval.pkg.content.5":"<body style=\"font-family: Proxima Nova, Roboto, Sans-Serif, opensans, Helvetica; font-size: 14px; padding: 15PX;\"> Hi,<br><br>Site24x7 can help ensure your <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/network-monitoring.html\">network<\/a> operates without interruptions. Here''s how:<br><br><b>Challenges with hybrid enterprise networks<\/b><br><ul><li>Monitoring varied environments like SD-WANs, the cloud, and traditional devices.<\/li><li>Planning capacity for inter-application traffic and ensuring smooth east-west data flow.<\/li><li>Managing configurations, firmware updates, and staying compliant with policies.<\/li><\/ul><b>Simplify network management with Site24x7<\/b><br> <ul><li>Gain real-time insights into network availability, latency, and bandwidth.<\/li><li>Prevent bottlenecks with detailed traffic analysis.<\/li><li>Manage IPs, SD-WANs, and configurations seamlessly.<\/li><li>Auto-discover devices, map dependencies, and troubleshoot efficiently<\/li><\/ul><b>Onboarding essentials: <\/b>Read our article on <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/solutions/network-resilience.html\"> achieving network resilience through observability <\/a>to learn how to handle complex IT environments.<br><br><b>Best practices: <\/b>To maximize the benefits of network monitoring, try to follow certain <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/help/best-practices/network-monitoring.html\"> best practices <\/a>while setting up your networks for monitoring. <br><br><b>Complete your setup: <\/b>Complete your Site24x7 setup by referring to the  <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/app/client#/home/help-assistant\"> recommendations <\/a>to get the most out of your monitoring experience.<a href=\"https://{{n0}}/app/client#/network/network-discovery/NETWORK?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><div style=\"border: 1px solid #21BC63; padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; margin:15px auto 0px; background: #21BC63; color: #fff; text-align: center; width: 100px;\">Get started<\/div><\/a><br><b>Need assistance?<\/b><br><a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"hhttps://www.site24x7.com/schedule-demo.html?src=presales-mail-network\"> Schedule a personalized demo <\/a>with our product experts and learn how Site24x7 can cater to your organization''s website monitoring needs. You can also  <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/webinars.html\">register now<\/a> and join our experts for a live product demo webinar. <br><br>Regards,<p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">The Site24x7 team | ZOHO Corp<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">US: +1 408 352 9117 | UK: +44 203 564 7893 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">AUS: +61 280 662 895 | NL: +31 707006121 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">4708 HWY 71 E, Del Valle, TX 78617-3216, USA<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">About Site24x7 <\/a> | <a href=\"{{n1}}/overview.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Help guide <\/a> | <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/home?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Knowledge base <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/community/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Community <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/request-demo.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Demo <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/training.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Training<\/a><\/p><\/body>","favourites.limit.reached":"You have reached the maximum number of favorites. Remove an existing favorite to add a new one.","oci.key.state":"Key State","mail.presales.activity.eval.pkg.content.4":"<body style=\"font-family: Proxima Nova, Roboto, Sans-Serif, opensans, Helvetica; font-size: 14px; padding: 15PX;\">Hi,<br><br>Let''s dive into how Site24x7 simplifies application performance monitoring (APM).<br><br><b>Challenges for DevOps<\/b><br><ul><li>Pinpointing issues in microservices<\/li><li>Mapping application dependencies<\/li><li>Troubleshooting performance bottlenecks.<\/li><\/ul><b>End-to-end APM with Site24x7<\/b><ul><li>Trace applications built on  <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/application-performance-monitoring.html?src=tip-mailer\">different platforms.<\/a><\/li><li>Monitor infrastructure dependencies and identify slow components.<\/li><li>Centralize log management to streamline troubleshooting.<\/li><\/ul><b>Onboarding essentials: <\/b>Download our  <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/whitepapers/mastering-application-performance-monitoring.pdf\">white paper on mastering APM <\/a>to enhance troubleshooting.<br><br><b>Best practices<\/b>: Follow Site24x7''s <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/help/best-practices/apm.html\">best practices<\/a> for better APM and troubleshooting.<br><br><b>Complete your setup: <\/b>Complete your Site24x7 setup by referring to the <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/app/client#/home/help-assistant\">recommendations<\/a> to get the most out of your monitoring experience.<div style=\"border: 1px solid #21BC63; padding: 10px; font-size: 16px; margin:15px auto 0px; background: #21BC63; color: #fff; text-align: center; width: 100px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/app/client#/admin/inventory/monitors-configure/APM-Insight-Application//?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #fff; text-decoration: none;\">Get started<\/a><\/div><b>Need assistance?<\/b><br><a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/schedule-demo.html?src=presales-mail-network\">Schedule a personalized demo<\/a> with our product experts and learn how Site24x7 can cater to your organization''s website monitoring needs. You can also <a style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\" href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/webinars.html?src=tip-mailer\">register now<\/a> and join our experts for a live product demo webinar.<br><br>Regards,<p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">The Site24x7 team | ZOHO Corp<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">US: +1 408 352 9117 | UK: +44 203 564 7893 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">AUS: +61 280 662 895 | NL: +31 707006121 <\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\">4708 HWY 71 E, Del Valle, TX 78617-3216, USA<\/p><p style=\"margin:5px 0px;\"><a href=\"https://{{n0}}/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">About Site24x7 <\/a> | <a href=\"{{n1}}/overview.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Help guide <\/a> | <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/home?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Knowledge base <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/community/?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Community <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/request-demo.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Demo <\/a> | <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/training.html?src=tip-mailer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#428bca; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;\">Training<\/a><\/p>","cl.nw.san.eseries.pool.state":"Pool State","help.oci.guidance.report.ui.learn.more":"<a href=\"{{help}}/oci/guidance-report.html\" target =\"_blank\"> Learn more<\/a>","ebs.notification.topicname":"Notification Topic Name","databricks.job.runs.duration.title":"Run Duration Analysis","aws.bedrock.guardrail.arn":"Guardrail ARN","practice.ses.identity.exposed.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks for Amazon SES identities, both email address and domain with no attached sending authorization policy.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>An identity is an email address or domain that Amazon SES users can use to send mail. A sending authorization policy is an document that you can attach to an identity to help another AWS account, IAM user or service to send email through SES on your behalf. A identity with no policy can lead to unauthorized access.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Create a sending authorization policy and then attach the policy to the email identity or domain identity to prevent unauthorized access.<\/p>","alibabacloud_fc.functionasyncmessagelatencymax":"Function Async Message Maximum Latency","vmware.vdi.cs.min.conn":"Min. Connections to Server","saas.application.canvas_lms.url":"Canvas LMS URL","vmware.help-assistant.tour.2.vmwareTabItem.right":"<div><h5>View ESX/ESXi metrics deeply<\/h5><div>Keep track of the hardware sensors that monitor the health and performance in addition to the basic monitoring metrics.<\/div><\/div>","azure.metric.plushttpsslhandshakes.desc":"HTTP successful SSL handshakes","global.forums":"Forums","al.help.intro.kubernetespodlog.btninfo":"Pod Logs will be enabled for all Nodes in this cluster.","thirdparty.zanalytics.schedule.type":"Schedule Type","global.action.type.fsx.action":"Amazon FSX Actions","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.lindormmultisearchhotstorageusedbytes":"Lindorm Multi Search Hot Storage Used Bytes","alibabacloud_ecs.sysomiomondisksioburstcntexception":"IO Monitor Disk SIO Burst Count Exception","dashbo