rofile.html\">Learn more<\/a>","client.marketing.vcenter.bullet3":"Verifies hardware component functionality of your VMware ESX/ESXi servers and monitors disk failures and voltage problems.","azure.metric.TcpFinWait1.disp":"TCP Fin Wait 1","client.marketing.vcenter.bullet2":"Monitors CPU, disk, memory, datastore and network utilization.","edit.gcp.quota.cloudrun":"Edit GCP Cloud Run Quota","alibabacloud_apsaradb_mongodb.CapacityUnit":"Capacity Unit","az.title.storage.availability":"Availability","alibabacloud_apsaradb_clickhouse.clickhousedistributedddlcountcc":"Distributed DDL Count (CC)","eks.update.id":"Update Id","practice.gcp.cloudrun.cmek.encryption.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether customer-managed encryption keys (CMEKs) are used for Cloud Run services.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Using CMEKs allows you to have full control over the encryption keys used to protect your data, enhancing security and compliance with regulatory requirements.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Use CMEKs for your Cloud Run services to enhance security and compliance.<\/p>","cl.nw.meraki.zx.add.title":"Add Meraki TeleWorker Monitor","apminsight.helpcard.threshold":"Threshold","offers.content.eval.user":"Tell us about your experience with Site24x7. Share your thoughts on any of the following platforms and submit the link to claim your rewards.","alibabacloud_oss.HdfsOperationRequestQps":"HDFS Operation Request QPS","oci.discovery.marketing.blog.content.3":"Cloud monitoring tools assist in this regard by helping organizations stay ahead of issues and maintain control over their cloud environments always.","al.fwd.aws.monitor":"AWS Monitor","oci.discovery.marketing.blog.content.2":"Leverage intelligent monitoring with AIOps and various aspects.","az.lb.dip.availability":"Dip Availability","ssl.cert.organization.unit.aead":"AEAD","kinesis.data.stream.arn":"Stream ARN","practice.oci.nlb.public.exposure.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether Network Load Balancers are unnecessarily exposed to the public internet.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>Publicly accessible NLBs that front internal services unnecessarily expand the attack surface. NLBs should only be public when serving internet-facing workloads.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Make Network Load Balancers private unless they are explicitly required to be internet-facing.<\/p>","vmware.total.alarms":"Total Alarms","addon.advanced.total":"Used Advanced Additional Checks :","global.subtitle.linkchecker":"Link Checker","nutanix.cluster.enforce.rackunit.aware.placement":"Rackable Unit Aware Placement Enforced","oci.igw.drops.from.igw":"Packet Drops from Internet Gateway to VCN","practice.gcp.iam.primitive.roles.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks if principals are assigned primitive roles (roles/owner, roles/editor, roles/viewer).<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Primitive roles provide broad permissions that violate the principle of least privilege. They grant access to all resources within a project rather than to specific services or actions, increasing the risk of accidental or malicious misuse.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Replace primitive roles with predefined or custom roles that grant only the permissions required for specific tasks. This reduces the risk surface and improves security posture.<\/p>","app.ibm_i.report.avg.processingunit.percentage":"Avg Processing Unit Percentage","vpc.rt.tab":"Route Tables","os.loadaverageminute.title":"OS Load Average Minute","report.mail.alibabacloud_eni.desc":"Alibaba Cloud Network Interface Report Description","cl.nw.ucs.fabric.extender.serverPortsoperStatehardwarefailure":"Server Ports Oper State Hardware Failure","esx.hardware.fan.sensor.exceeds":"Reading of Fan Sensor \"{{n0}}\"  {{n1}} %.","aws.valkey.auto.failover":"Auto-failover","emr.underreplicated.blocks":"Under Replicated Blocks","apminsight.search.no.instances":"No instances found","aws.restore.jo