Commands to open files and use of text editors are not supported<\/li><li><a href=\"{{help}}/admin/server-monitor/live-terminal-connect.html\" target=\"_blank\">Help Resources<\/a><\/li><\/ul>","device.interface.chart.rxutil.title":"Rx Utilization","global.android.title":"Android","lightsail.instance.integrate.tip":"All you have to do is click on integrate; we will take care of syncing your server monitoring data, with the Lightsail Instance monitor. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"{{help}}/aws/lightsail-instance-agent-integration.html\">Know More<\/a>","of365.team.activity":"Teams Activity Count Statistics","winupdate.monitor.how.it.works":"The server monitoring agent collects the Windows update and pushes it to Site24x7. Alerts are triggered based on thresholds configured. The agent software also listens for server shutdown notifications. <br><br>To prevent false alerts due to any ISP issues at our already multi-homed datacenters, Site24x7 has heartbeat receiving capability spread across two different data centers. Well, it's time to get started!","azure.metric.replitems.health":"Replicated Items Health","cl.nw.san.vol.edit.title":"Edit Volume","apm.keytxn.raw.report":"APM Business Transaction Raw Data","vmware.announcement.info":"Snapshots eat up datastore space, slowing down the virtual machines (VMs) associated with that datastore. This is why it's critical to monitor not just the datastore and VM, but the snapshots as well. Site24x7 offers the right features to solve snapshot management issues, including:","units.ms":"ms","custom.report.preview.generate.tooltip":"You are currently in Preview Mode. Generate the report to view the full report.","rum.table.title.snapshot.splitup":"Snapshot Resources Splitup","mongodbatlas.node.max.process.normalized.cpu.children.kernel":"Max Process Normalized CPU Children Kernel","azure.metric.datadiskiopsconsumedpercentage.desc":"Data Disk IOPS Consumed Percentage","user.roles.module.modify.third.party.integerations":"Modify Third 