memory pressure, replication lag, or network bottlenecks before they impact application performance.<\/li><li>Optimize resource usage by identifying unused or underutilized nodes.<\/li><li>Correlate cache performance with application and infrastructure metrics for faster root cause analysis.<\/li><li>Maintain high availability and ensure reliable data delivery with proactive alerts and historical trend reports.<\/li><\/ul>","support.phone.no.uk":"+44 20 7660 8803","oci.vpn.points":"<ul><li>Monitor the uptime and availability of each VPN tunnel to ensure uninterrupted connectivity.<\/li><li>Track data in and out of the VPN to spot unusual usage spikes or drops that might signal issues.<\/li><li>Detect tunnel failures early to prevent downtime for critical workloads.<\/li><li>Identify underused or idle VPN connections to optimize resources<\/li><li>Get instant alerts on tunnel state changes or performance issues for faster troubleshooting.<\/li><li>Maintain an audit trail of tunnel metrics and performance trends for compliance and capacity planning.<\/li><\/ul>","global.server.profile.checks.count":"Total Checks in the Profile","rdspi.db.databases.write.transactions.total":"Total Write Transactions","al.ltype.click.enable":"By enabling, you allow us to look for logs across any new servers that have been associated with this log type and start upload logs if found.","apminsight.set.threshold.configuration":"Set the transaction threshold to be greater than this response time to get traces","js.tools.jsonFormatter.inputjson":"Input JSON","poller.server.integration.inprogress":"Server agent integration is in progess. Please wait for a while to fetch tasks, events and alarms metrics.","aws.vpc.vpcid":"VPC ID","client.r53.missing.metrics":"You're missing out on monitoring DNS Queries for your Route 53 Hosted Zone!","vmware.vdi.hv.location.avg.machines":"Avg no. of Machines by Location","aws.dc.vi.bps.egress.avg":"Average VirtualInterfaceBpsEgress","oci.app.functions.throttl