at control inbound and outbound traffic. Instance performance can be affected if the security group has a large number of rules.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Delete unnecessary or overlapping rule in a EC2-VPC security group.<\/p>","global.prof.msg":"Monitor websites from any of our monitoring locations worldwide. Starts at $1 per website.","rum.help.ip.track":"Track the ip address of the users visiting real user monitor enabled web pages.","bus.status":"Bus Status","nsx.vpn.packets.out":"Packets Out","ncm.compliance.policy.title":"Compliance Policy","of365.max.av.conferences":"Max AV Conferences","server.cpu.header":"CPU","rum.table.subtitle.snapshot.ganttchart":"Total Resources","esx.fan.reading.desc":"Fan Reading (%)","global.send.feedback":"Send Feedback","plugin.group.colaboration":"Collaboration","alibabacloud_oss.metering_put_request":"Metering Put Request","velocloud.path.packets.rx.avg":"Average Packets Rx","ds.vm.snapshot.size":"Space Occupied by Snapshots in VM","global.hetznercloud_volume.monitortype":"Hetzner Cloud - Volumes","cl.nw.network.health.dashboard.title":"Health Dashboard","rum.device.metrics.info":"Note: Device connection types and memory are collected from browsers supporting these metrics.","nutanix.monitors.all.tour.1.nutanixTabItem.right":"<div><h5>Manage cluster performance<\/h5><div>Keep track of the performance of every disk, content cache, and storage controller in your Nutanix cluster.<\/div><\/div>","iis.app.avg.pipeline":"Avg Concurrent Requests","alert.azure.pool.name.change":"Alert if Pool Name is Changed","client.marketing.vpn.extra":"If you have disabled discovery and want Site24x7 to monitor your Site-to-Site VPN, then click on the Edit Integrated OCI Account button shown below, scroll down to the Discovery Options section, select the check box next to the Site-to-Site VPN listing and click on Save.","practice.azure.load.balancer.enable.tcp.reset.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether TCP Reset is enabled on outbound rules of the load balancer.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>TCP resets on your load balancer send bidirectional TCP reset packets to both client and server endpoints on idle time-out to inform your application endpoints that the connection timed out and is no longer usable. Enabling TCP Reset on the load balancer helps in quickly terminating idle or long-lived connections, improving the overall performance.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable TCP Reset on your load balancer to ensure efficient connection management and ensure the desired application behavior.<\/p>","azure.resource.mysqldb.servers.promptlabel":"MySQL Server Database","azure.metric.rsv.rpo.disp":"Last RPO (in seconds)","huaweicloud_dds.mongo022_wt_cahe_dirty":"Tracked Dirty Bytes in WiredTiger Cache","rds.replicalag.yaxislabel.text":"Seconds","global.schedule.deprecate.interval":"Deprecate Interval","rum.applications.view.session":"View Session","esx.hardware.status.green":"The sensor is operating under normal conditions.","alibabacloud_eni.NetworkInterfaceTrafficMode":"Network Interface Traffic Mode","mysql.metric.innodbqueriesinside.desc":"InnoDB Queries Inside","windows.fullstackagent.download":"Download Full-Stack Agent for Windows","workspace.capacity.type":"WorkSpace Domain Capacity","dashboard.type.servers":"OS / Server","tools.winservices.start":"Start Service","biztalkserver.tab.adapters":"Adapters","dashboard.threshold.filter":"Filter by Threshold","oci.permission.nosql.child":"Manage OCI NoSQL Child Tables","oci.opensearch.pipeline.fqdn":"OpenSearch Pipeline FQDN","client.marketing.cf.bullet1":"There are no CloudFront Distributions configured in the AWS account.","huaweicloud_sfs_turbo.monitor.type":"Huawei Cloud SFS Turbo","velocloud.ha.type":"HA Type","alert.oracle.insight.en":"Enabled for \"{{n4}}\": \"{{n0}}\".","report.mail.alibabacloud_nas.desc":"Alibaba Cloud NAS Report Description","ssl.ignore.hostname.error":"Ignore Hostname Error","client.market