 security to protect your sensitive AWS resources with both your password and time-synchronized one-time password (OTP).<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Use a security token-based MFA to protect your AWS account.<\/p>","practice.aws.glue.enable.obs.metrics.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the Job Observability metrics are enabled for the Glue Job.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>The AWS Glue Observability metrics provides insights into job performance and resource usage, allowing you to optimize and troubleshoot your ETL processes. These CloudWatch metrics are billed at the same rate as the CloudWatch custom metrics.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Select the Job observability metrics option to generate insights into each job run process.<\/p>","ad.title.sam.write":"SAM Writes(%)","firehose.log.group.name":"Log Group Name","azure.metric.totalkeys0.disp":"Total Keys (Shard 0)","rum.add.trackajaxcalls":"Track Ajax Calls","vpc.rst.packets.received":"Rst Packets Received","dashboard.step.transaction.report.chart.name":"Step Transaction Time Report","plugin.app.sap_abap.report.min.dia.srv.response.time":"Min Server Dialog Response Time","oci.vc.reason.failed":"Virtual Circuit Connection Setup has Failed","msg.domain.register.date":"Registration Date","azure.steps1.part5":"Step 5: Copy the <b>client secret value in the Value column<\/b> and save it for later use, since the value disappears shortly.","azure.steps1.part4":"Step 4: Under <b>Manage<\/b> \u2192 <b>Certificates & secrets<\/b>, click <b>+ New client secret<\/b>. Add a description, set an expiry period, and click <b>Add<\/b>.","azure.steps1.part1":"Step 1: Navigate to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://portal.azure.com/\"> Azure portal<\/a> \u2192 <b>Microsoft Entra ID<\/b> \u2192 <b>+ Add<\/b> \u2192 <b>App registrations<\/b>.","kube.pod.restarts":"Restarts","azure.steps1.part3":"Step 3: From the app overview page, copy the Directory (tenant) ID and Ap