tances to improve resource organization, cost tracking, and governance capabilities. Consider implementing a consistent labeling strategy across your Google Cloud resources with labels such as environment, application, department, cost center, or project.<\/p>","al.db.cache.perf":"Cache Performance","ec2.cwagent.swap.used.percent.avg":"Avg Swap Used Percent","ad.service.dns.client":"DNS Client","plugin.mail.template.reminder_plugin_discovery.content":"<p>Hello, <\/p><p><span>This is a reminder that we have enabled automatic discovery and addition of the <\/span><a href=\"https://github.com/site24x7/plugins/tree/master/windows_security\" target=\"_blank\" >Windows<\/a><span> or <\/span><a href=\"https://github.com/site24x7/plugins/tree/master/linux_security_updates\" target=\"_blank\" >Linux<\/a><span> security plugins (depending on the type of server) in your Site24x7 Server Monitoring agent.<\/span><\/p><p>To disable future deployments, navigate to <strong>Admin<\/strong> &gt; <strong>Plugin Monitor<\/strong> &gt; <strong>Settings <\/strong>&gt; <strong>Auto discover and add plugins on your server<\/strong> and toggle to<strong> No<\/strong>.<\/p><p><span>If you face any issues or need further clarification, reach out to <\/span><a href=\"mailto:support@site24x7.com\" target=\"_blank\" >support@site24x7.com<\/a><span>.<\/span><\/p><p><span >Regards, <\/span><\/p><p><span >The Site24x7 team<\/span><\/p>","practice.aws.acm.certificates.renewal.desc":"Check if SSL/TLS certificates managed by AWS ACM are renewed before their validity period ends","myaccount.notification.preference.all":"All notifications","nutanix.disk.free.space.report":"Free Space Report","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.lindormmultisearchselectp95rt":"Multi Search Select Response Time P95","server.process.handle.count":"Process Handle Count","kube.etcd.prop.fail":"Proposals Failed","aws.bedrock.invoke.agent.input.token.count":"Agent Input Token Count","emr.running.reducetasks":"Running Reduce Tasks","