"oci.app.functions.responses":"Functions Response","practice.gcp.vpc.unrestricted.sql.server.access.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks for firewall rules that allow unrestricted access to SQL Server ports (TCP ports 1433, 1434).<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Exposing SQL Server database ports directly to the internet creates significant security risks, including brute-force attacks, exploitation of vulnerabilities, and unauthorized data access. Database services should typically be accessible only from authorized application servers or through secure channels.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Restrict SQL Server access to specific application servers or internal networks. Use private connectivity or VPN for external access requirements. Implement strong authentication and encryption for all database connections.<\/p>","alibabacloud_apsaramq_kafka.monitor.add":"Add Kafka Monitor","server.errorcode.display.key.8015":"Server Shutdown","oci.bs.http.responses3xx":"HTTP 3xx Responses","server.errorcode.display.key.8014":"Server Reboot","azure.metric.ibdatastorageused.desc":"Ibdata1 Storage Used","al.fwd.usage.by.destination":"Forwarding Usage by Destination","azure.metric.serverLoad7.disp":"Server Load (Shard 7)","activedirectory.ds.suboperationsecurity":"Suboperations Security","oracle.db.metric.fixedsgasize.desc":"Fixed SGA Size","direct.connect.lag.id":"LAG ID","huaweicloud_dcaas_vintf.network_outgoing_packets":"Network Outgoing Packets","server.conf.overview.services.monitored":"Currently, the following services are being monitored:","cl.nw.layer2.seed.device":"Seed Device","wanrtt.monitor.test.params.payload":"Payload","threshold.availability.backup.vault.resource":"Performance Thresholds for AWS Backups Vault Services","slo.percent.value.empty.error":"Percentage of time should not be empty","cl.core.dash.topn.period.tooltip":"Select a pre-defined time period to generate the list of Top N monitors.","critical.duration":"Critical Duration",