age for various AWS resources like EC2, RDS, S3, DynamoDB, Elastic Load Balancer, ElastiCache, EBS volume, SNS and Lambda Functions.","practice.gcp.sql.enable.log.checkpoints.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks if the log_checkpoints flag is enabled for PostgreSQL instances.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>The log_checkpoints flag logs checkpoint operations to the server log. Checkpoint operations write all modified data to disk to ensure data durability. Logging these operations helps monitor database performance and recovery processes.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable the log_checkpoints flag in your CloudSQL PostgreSQL instance to track checkpoint operations for better performance monitoring and troubleshooting.<\/p>","dashboard.widget.problems.unacknowldged.tooltip":"Toggle to exclude acknowledged problems.","hadoop.non.heap.mem.used":"Non Heap memory used","alibabacloud_oss.mirror_traffic":"Mirror Traffic","edit.wincls.disk.storage":"GCP Edit Storage","kaleyrasms.status.handset-busy":"Subscriber is in busy condition.","kube.cluster.inventory.report":"Kubernetes Cluster Inventory Report","edit.azure.postgresql.flexible.server":"Edit Azure Database for PostgreSQL flexible server","nsx.add.help.text3":"Select the On-Premise Poller installed on your network which has access to your NSX-T Infrastructure.","al.fwd.upsell.diag.src.servapp":"Server \u00B7 App \u00B7 K8s","nsx.add.help.text2":"Install On-Premise Poller anywhere on your network where there is access to your NSX-T Infrastructure.","cl.ipam.tool.tip.subnet.location":"(Optional) Enter the physical location of the subnet.","capacity.healthcheck.availability":"Availability","dynamodb.reports.min.scan.latency":"Minimum Scan Latency","oci.basedb.node.stopped.reason":"Node is Stopped","network.disform.plugin.notinstalled":"Network Module is not installed on this On-Premise Poller.","jsp.tools.yaml-to-xml.desc":"Free tool to convert the data in YAML format to XML format. Options to