etheus.monitor.action.disable":"Disable Prometheus Integration","social.site24x7.facebook":"Follow us on Facebook","practice.gcp.sql.disable.3625.trace.flag.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks if <i>trace flag 3625<\/i> is disabled for SQL Server instances.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Trace flag 3625 limits the information returned to users when SQL Server exceptions occur. While this can be useful in production to prevent potential exposure of sensitive information, it can also hide details needed for proper auditing and security monitoring.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Ensure trace flag 3625 is properly configured according to your environment's security requirements. For environments requiring comprehensive audit logs, consider disabling this flag to ensure full error information is captured.<\/p>","ec2.ebs.write.bytes":"EBS Write Bytes","sam.maccreation.exceeds":"Machine Creations","sdn.mist.wan.edge.vpn.peers.up":"VPN Peers Up","sdn.pano.firewall.list.info":"Firewall status","url.newmonitor.accepted.status.codes":"Accepted HTTP Status Codes","practice.gcp.vm.disable.preemptive.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether the instance's preemptible flag is enabled.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Preemptible instances are cost-effective, short-lived VMs that Google Cloud can stop at any moment. Designed for interruptible workloads, they provide substantial cost savings but have a maximum runtime of 24 hours.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p><p>To ensure that your instances are not preemptible, follow these steps:<\/p><ol><li>Navigate to the GCP console > <b>Compute Engine<\/b> section.<\/li><li>Stop the VM instance you wish to modify.<\/li><li>Edit the VM instance settings and set <i>Preemptibility<\/i> to <b>Regular<\/b> instead of <b>Preemptible<\/b>.<\/li><li>Save the changes and restart the instance.<\/li><\/ol><\/p>","server.adwindows.commandline.newinstall.au":"You can also <a href=\"https://www.site24x7.com/help/admin/adding-a-monitor/command-line-installation.html#command-line-installation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">associate configuration profiles<\/a> (threshold, resource, notification profiles and group name) to a windows server during agent installation","aws.ct.account.type":"Account Type","oci.nosql.capacity.mode":"Capacity Mode","oracle.db.metric.clusterdatabase.desc":"Cluster Database","oci.opensearch.opendashboard.fqdn":"OpenDashboard FQDN","apminsight.tab.memory.allocation":"Memory Allocation","iis.apps.cache":"Cache Details","alibabacloud_apsaradb_clickhouse.clickhousetcpconnusagecountee":"Clickhouse TCP Conn Usage Count EE","saas.application.gitlab":"Gitlab","cl.ipam.ip.sys.uptime":"Last Downtime","azure.rsv.backup.time.alert":"Alert on Delayed Initial Backup (24 hrs)","global.sup.ver.msg.23000":"Available from agent version 23.0.00","threshold.availability.ecsservice":"Performance Thresholds for ECS Cluster Services","capacity.assigned.threshold":"Configured Threshold","aws.appsync.overview":"AppSync Configuration","alibabacloud_bandwidth_package.netrx.rate":"Network RX Rate","glue.crawler.table.breach":"Notify for Maximum Table Threshold","huaweicloud_gaussdbv5.rds079_standy_not_replayed_log":"Size of Read Replica Logs Not Replayed","aws.appstream.application.configuration":"Application Configuration","n2d.cpus.per.project.region":"N2d CPUs per Project Region","tencentcloud.ha.desc":"Monitor your Tencent Cloud infrastructure, auto-discover resources via CAM authentication, and ensure comprehensive performance monitoring across regions.","alibabacloud_apsaradb_tair.ArchitectureType":"Architecture Type","global.outside":"Outside","dashboard.page.writes.chart.name":"Page Writes Operations Report","tencentcloud_mongodb.MongoVersion":"Mongo Version","apminsight.ins.alert.dbops.cnt.exceeds":"Databases request count of instance {{n0}}","global.gcp.monitortype":"Google Cloud Platform (GCP)","rule.add.scheduled.jobs":"Add Scheduled Jobs","cl.nw