arch JVM GC Collection Count","cl.nw.migration.initiate.migration":"Initiate Upgrade","azure.metric.workflowtriggerscompleted.desc":"WorkflowTriggersCompletedCount","cl.ap.help.asstnt.box1.content":"Access point (AP) monitoring in Site24x7 enables real-time visibility into the health, performance, and client activity of wireless access points. It provides granular metrics such as SSID usage, connected client details, and signal strength to help IT teams proactively manage wireless connectivity issues.","oci.vpn.tunnel.capacity.type":"Tunnel Capacity","mysql.metric.versioncompileos.desc":"Version Compile Os","saas.application.tableau.url":"Tableau URL","subscriptions.suggested.plans.pack.price":"Base Price","ec2.cwagent.swap.used.percentage":"Swap Used Percentage","azure.metric.VipAvailability.disp":"Data Path Availability","apm.autoprofiler.condition.value.empty.violation":"Please enter a value","msp.enabled.menus":"Enabled Menu","plugin.mail.template.triggered.content":"<p>Hello,<\/p><p>To ensure server security and system integrity, we have enabled automatic discovery and addition of the <a href=\"https://github.com/site24x7/plugins/tree/master/windows_security\" target=\"_blank\" >Windows<\/a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/site24x7/plugins/tree/master/linux_security_updates\" target=\"_blank\" >Linux<\/a> security plugins (depending on the type of server) in your Site24x7 server agent.<\/p><p><strong>What does it do?<\/strong><\/p><p>These plugins enable proactive security threat monitoring and ensure real-time protection, making them essential for monitoring your systems.<\/p><p>Learn more about these plugins <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/en/kb/articles/new-plugin-added-in-server-agent\" target=\"_blank\" >here<\/a>.<\/p><p><strong>What does this mean for you?<\/strong><\/p><p>These essential plugins will be automatically added to your new servers, enabling immediate monitoring. For your existing servers, they have been added in phases.<\/p><p>Note that if your servers already have other plugins installed, these plugins won't be added to avoid licensing changes.<\/p><p>If you don't need these plugins, you can suspend them via the web client. To disable the addition for new servers or future deployments, navigate to <strong>Admin<\/strong> &gt; <strong>Plugin Monitor<\/strong> &gt; <strong>Settings<\/strong> &gt; <strong>Auto discover and add plugins on your server<\/strong> and toggle to <strong>No<\/strong>.<\/p><p>If you face any issues or need further clarification, reach out to support@site24x7.com.<\/p>","global.memorydb.cluster.node.monitortype":"MemoryDB Cluster Nodes","oci.bs.http.responses200":"HTTP 200 Responses","cl.nw.ucs.ports":"Ports","cl.nw.interface.alias":"If Alias","mobile.rbm.enter.application.name":"Enter Application Name","pagerduty.alert.settings":"Alert Settings","dynamodb.provisioned.write":"Provisioned write capacity units","vmware.vdi.vd.summary.title":"Virtual Desktop Monitor Summary","report.mail.akamai_cloud_database.desc":"Report Mail Description","kube.sch.bac.ppod":"BackoffQ Pending Pods","aws.oneindex.apistage.4xx":"$AWS12001 4xx errors","gcp.errorcode.cloudsqlmysql.termination":"GCP Cloud SQL for MySQL is Terminated","oci.hmt.metadata.iops":"Metadata IOPS","jsp.tools.json-beautifier.toolname":"JSON Beautifier","alibabacloud_oss.TotalRecvBandwidthUsageRate":"Total Recv Bandwidth Usage Rate","cl.oracle.db.dashboard.instance":"Status of Oracle Instances","alibabacloud_mongodb.shardingcpuusernode":"Sharding CPU User Node","apm.txn.by.performance":"Top Transactions - performance","app.ibm_i.monjobqueuedetails.current.active":"Current Active","alibabacloud_oss.qos_max_extranet_send_flow":"Qos Max Extranet Send Flow","ec2.autoscaling.metric.upperband":"Metric Interval Upper Band","azure.metric.registrationcreate.disp":"Registration Create Operations","edit.alibabacloud_csg.monitor":"Edit CSG Monitor","alibabacloud_ecs.cpu_other":"CPU Other","clickhouse.plugin":"ClickHouse Monito