n.marketing.content.title":"<b>Subscribe to ManageEngine CloudSpend to keep receiving key cloud recommendations<\/b>","myaccount.edit.profile":"Edit Profile","pop.mail.subject":"Mail Subject","azure.metric.plushttplocationzonerequestbytesrcvd.desc":"Location zone HTTP bytes received","msg.cert.expires.in":"Certificate expires in {{n0}} day(s)","azure.resource.continuousjob":"Azure Continuous WebJob","cl.nw.discovery.rule":"Interface Discovery Rule","practice.gcp.vpc.unrestricted.rpc.access.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks for firewall rules that allow unrestricted access to Remote Procedure Call (RPC) ports (TCP ports 135, 137-139, 445) from the internet.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Allowing unrestricted access to RPC and related SMB/CIFS ports creates significant security risks. These protocols are commonly targeted in network attacks and have historically been associated with many critical vulnerabilities. Exposing these ports to the internet can lead to unauthorized access, data breaches, and system compromise.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Block or strictly limit access to RPC and SMB/CIFS ports (135, 137-139, 445) from the internet. If these services are required for specific use cases, restrict access to trusted networks and implement additional security controls like VPN or private connectivity.<\/p>","azure.backup.storage.version":"Backup Storage Version","plugin.cfg.tls_certificate_key_file_password":"TLS Certificate Key File Password","al.db.auth0.gd_send_sms":"SMS Send","threshold.availability.azurestreamingjobs":"Performance Thresholds for Azure Stream Analytics Job","pdf.address.1":"4141 Hacienda Drive","cl.nw.device.limit.deleted":"Some devices were not added as the device limit for the On-Premise Poller has been reached.","rum.waterfalls.poorly.cached.resources.info":"Resources with a browser cache rate < 50%.","server.notify.down.tip":"Get notified when any service/process is down","pdf.address.2":"Pleasanton, CA 94