ases. Your account has been downgraded and identified as inactive, with no monitors for quite a while now. \n \n We are reaching out to inform you that your Site24x7 account ({{n1}}) data will be deleted in 25 days.\n \n If you no longer wish to maintain your account and would like to have your data deleted, please disregard this email. We will proceed with the account clean-up and the deletion of all associated data. However, if you wish to retain your account and prevent the deletion of your data, please log in to \"https://www.site24x7.com\" and start monitoring. \n \n If you have any questions or require assistance, please don't hesitate to reach out to our support team at support@site24x7.com.\n \n We appreciate your cooperation and look forward to continuing to serve you.\n \n Best regards, \n \n The Site24x7 team","neptune.gremlin.requests.avg":"Average Gremlin Requests","aws.health.monitored.affected":"Monitored Affected Resources","mssql.resp.jobsuccessrate":"Job Success Rate","country.nicaragua":"Nicaragua","cl.nf.show.graph":"Show Graph","hetznercloud_server.public_ipv4_dns":"Public IPv4 DNS","alert.sqlagreplica.db.dbd":"Database State: \"{{n0}}\".","cl.core.email.remove":"Email Address Rejected","alibabacloud_apsaradb_hbase.summary.title":"Summary Title","gcp.metric.lazywritecount.desc":"Lazy Write Count","azure.metric.ModelDeploySucceeded.disp":"Model Deploy Succeeded","oci.drg.vcn.default.route.table":"VCN Default Route Table","oci.guaranteed.throughput":"Volume Guaranteed Throughput","cl.nw.ucs.fabric_extender.switch.ports.mode":"Switch Ports Mode","predefined.report.98.name":"K8s CPU/Memory Trend","sdn.ubiquitiUnifi.device.cpu.util.pct":"CPU Utilization","huaweicloud_nosql_mongo.nosql001_cpu_usage":"CPU Usage","alibabacloud_polardb.pg_pls_iops_write":"PostgreSQL PLS IOPS Write","practice.gcp.vm.enable.auto.restart.desc":"Auto restart disabled instances are displayed below.","url.monitor.pollnow.primary":"Primary","huaweicloud_dcs.connections_usage":"