CN Availability Domain","client.oci.cache.monitor.info":"Monitor your OCI Cache Cluster performance and metrics","saas.application.contentful.desc":"A headless content management system (CMS). Monitor its accessibility to ensure seamless content delivery across digital platforms.","cl.nw.migration.initiation.not.supported":"Network Module upgrade is not supported for this On-Premise Poller version. Please upgrade the On-Premise Poller to the latest version and try again.","cl.asm.disk.used.percent":"Disk Utilization","alibabacloud_alb.urlid":"URL ID","ad.ntdsapi.read.percentage":"NTDSAPI Reads(%)","ds.lun.not.found":"No LUN details are found","plugin.app.jboss.running.mode":"Running Mode","mysql.metric.maxsprecursiondepth.desc":"Max Sp Recursion Depth","of365.max.group.deleted":"Max Group Deletion","cl.nw.ucs.fabric.extender.serverPortsencapnegotiate":"Server Ports Encap Negotiate","msg.cert.chacha.statement":"ChaCha [CHACHA] is a stream cipher that operates on a state of 16 32-bit words that are initialized from the input words. It consists of 20 rounds that alternate between \"column\" rounds and \"diagonal\" rounds.","velocloud.edge.degraded.reason":"Edge is in a degraded state","azure.metric.c2dcommandsegresscompletesuccess.disp":"C2D message deliveries completed","aws.amq.audit.log":"Audit log","amazon.ec.get.type.cmds.latency":"Get Type Commands Latency","data.dest.threshold.configuration":"Data Stream Destination Threshold Configuration","alibabacloud_oss.QosMaxIntranetSendFlow":"Qos Max Intranet Send Flow","new.plan.excess.usage.content.3":"Dear {{n0}},<br><br>We are reaching out to let you know that the grace period for extending your license allocation has ended. As such, the monitors that exceed the {{n1}} plan and your purchased add-ons are suspended.<br><br>To continue monitoring these additional items, please purchase the required add-ons. To view a list of monitors that were suspended as part of the plan conversion, please navigate to <b>Admin > Operations > Audit Logs<\/b>.If you have any queries regarding the new licensing plans, feel free to contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@site24x7.com\">support@site24x7.com<\/a>.<br><br>Happy monitoring!<br><br>Best regards,<br>The Site24x7 Team","new.plan.excess.usage.content.2":"Dear {{n0}},<br><br>We wanted to follow up on our previous email about your change from the <b>{{n1}}<\/b> plan to the <b>{{n2}}<\/b> plan. Since we have not heard back from you, we want to remind you that some of your monitors may be suspended soon as part of this transition.<br><br>To continue using these monitors, please consider purchasing the appropriate add-ons. In the absence of your response or no action taken, some of your monitoring actions will be suspended by {{n3}}.<br><br>We appreciate your prompt attention to this matter. If you have any queries regarding the new licensing plans, feel free to contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@site24x7.com\">support@site24x7.com<\/a>.<br><br>Happy monitoring!<br><br>Best regards,<br>The Site24x7 Team","new.plan.excess.usage.content.1":"Dear {{n0}},<br><br>We\u2019re reaching out to confirm your subscription update from the <b>{{n1}}<\/b> plan to the new <b>{{n2}}<\/b> plan, as requested. We have curated the plans and add-ons to meet your usage and requirements.<br><br>After the transition, if you notice any discrepancies or wish to expand your monitoring capabilities, you are welcome to purchase additional add-ons as needed. The monitors that are not included in your current subscription will continue to be active only for the next 30 days.<br><br>If you have any queries regarding the new licensing plans, feel free to contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@site24x7.com\">support@site24x7.com<\/a>.<br><br>Happy monitoring!<br><br>Best regards,<br>The Site24x7 Team","plugin.app.glassfish.tab.http.requests":"HTTP & Requests","bu.migration.who.2":"If individual Business Units in your organization need the exclusive rights to access their IT monitoring reports and dashboards, you can try out Business Units to enable a secure reporting.","bu.migration.who.1":"Any organization, which has multiple ITOps teams to monitor and manage their business unit\u2019s disparate IT assets can use a single Business Units Portal instead of depending on separate monitoring accounts for every Business Unit.","alibabacloud_oss.availability":"Availability","al.db.most.loggen":"Most Log Generator","cl.nw.san.adapter.is.enabled.str":"Adapter Is Enabled String","oci.fs.metadata.iops.by.op":"Metadata IOPS by Operation","cl.nw.ucs.rack_server.motherboard.temperature":"Rack Server Motherboard Temperature","aws.agentcore.policy.simple":"Policy","vmware.rp.threshold.label.group.rp":"Inner Resource Pool Thresholds","vc.rp.cpu.overall.usage.max":"Max Cpu Overall Usage","huaweicloud_gaussdbv5.rds090_gaussdbv5_statement":"SQL Statements","gcp.interconnect.attachment":"Interconnect Attachment","oci.sgw.bytes.from.service":"Bytes From Service","azure.custom.window":"Custom Window","dashboard.add.new":"+ Add new dashboard","global.restapiseq.import.step2.har":"Step 2: Select a HTTP Archive (HAR) file","huaweicloud_apig.req_count_2xx":"2xx Request Count","poller.pcr.progress.info":"Monitors configurations are being sent to the agent to resume data collection.","apminsight.scroll.to.top":"Scroll To Top","winupdate.chart.title.updaterollups":"Pending Update Rollups","global.digitalocean_namespace.monitortype.short":"Namespace","velocloud.bps.tx.max.report":"Out Traffic (bps) Max Report","aws.trusted.advisor.category.capacity.type":"Trusted Advisor Category Capacity","global.tencentcloud_clb.monitortype.short":"CLB","certificate.version.tab":"Versions","vmware.total.events":"Total Events","alibabacloud_polardbx.urlid":"URL ID","of365.healthy":"Healthy","js.monitor.poll.now.failed.reason.dc.running":"Polling is underway at present.","mysql.chart.innodb.contention.spin.rounds":"InnoDB Contention - Spin Rounds","mobileapm.reactnative.perform":"Build the app and perform a few actions to begin collecting performance data.","newclient.server.config.disable.autocreate_monitor":"Auto create monitor groups based on domain","aws.agentcore.codeinterpreter.session.duration":"Code Interpreter Session Duration","interconnect.attachments.per.region.per":"Interconnect Attachments per Region per Project Region","practice.gcp.vm.public.ip.desc":"Public IP Addresses Assigned Instances are displayed below.","digitalocean_load_balancer.dropletshttpresponses":"Droplets HTTP Responses","al.mail.tried.user.con.3":"<br><br>You can drop us a comment on our <a href='$APPLOGS_COMMUNITY_LINK' target='_blank'>community wall<\/a> or e-mail us at <a href='mailto:support@site24x7.com'>support@site24x7.com<\/a> to share your feedback or request new features.","gcp.lb.edge.security.policy":"Edge Security Policy","al.mail.tried.user.con.2":"<br><br>You can also try different <a href=''{{n0}}/help/log-management/query-language.html'' target='_blank'>search query options<\/a> such as groupby, timeslice, distinct, and count. We''ve also discovered a few other log types on your servers; click <a href='$DISCOVERED_LOGTYPES_LINK' target='_blank'>here<\/a> to view them and add them to AppLogs.","al.mail.tried.user.con.1":"Greetings from Site24x7!<br><br>We''re happy to see that you''re using Site24x7 AppLogs to manage and analyze your logs. We hope that features like the <a href=''{{n0}}/help/log-management/saved-searches.html'' target='_blank'>saved searches<\/a> and timely <a href=''{{n0}}/help/log-management/alerts.html'' target='_blank'>alerts<\/a> serve you in the way you need. If you haven''t tried these features yet, then you''re missing out on the full potential of AppLogs.","msg.cert.self.signed.cert":"Self-Signed Certificates.","of365.chart.consumedunits.title":"License Consumed units","oci.dedicated.vm.host.memory.utilization":"Instances Memory Utilization (Avg)","vmware.vdi.hv.label.session.logintime":"Session Logged in Time","apminsig