p><p> Checks whether field-level encryption is enabled for your Amazon CloudFront web distributions.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> CloudFront field-level encryption lets you add an additional layer of security, along with SSL encryption (HTTPS), helping you protect specific sensitive data throughout system processing so that only certain applications within your environment can see this data.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Enable field-level encryption for your Amazon CloudFront web distributions.<\/p>","cloud.title.wmrawtable":"Monitored Metrics","plugin.app.glassfish.report.avg.total3xx":"Avg Total3Xx","oci.postgres.backup.copy.retention":"Backup Copy Policy Retention Period","oracle.db.metric.databasemode.desc":"Database Mode","reports.average.client.tlserror":"Average Client TLS Errors","oci.opensearch.node.capacity.threshold":"OCI OpenSearch Node Capacity Threshold","alibabacloud_alb.listenerhttpredirect":"Listener HTTP Redirect","country.slovenia":"Slovenia","azure.metric.usedmemory6.disp":"Used Memory (Shard 6)","dynamodb.metric.read.throttle.events":"Read Throttle Events","network.credential.save":"Save Credential","ds.writelatency":"Top Virtual Machines by Write Latency (ms)","huaweicloud_nosql_mongo.mongodb002_delete_ps":"Deleted Per Second","practice.oci.vcn.nsg.unrestricted.rdp.access.desc":"Network security group should not allow unrestricted RDP access","alibabacloud_polardbx.diskusageofgms":"Disk Usage of GMS","elb.avg.new.flow":"Avg New Flow","tencentcloud_emr.EmrVersion":"Emr Version","plugin.app.glassfish.title.gc.details":"Gc Details","sftp.domain":"Domain","datalake.monitor.discovery.progress":"Discovery is currently in progress. Kindly refresh the page after a short while.","cl.nw.storage.netapp.aggregate.raid.plex.count":"Raid Plex Count","kube.pv.monitor.add":"Add Kubernetes Persistent Volume Monitor","alibabacloud_eip.BandwidthPackageType":"Bandwidth Package Type","list.req.filter.reg":"List Requests Filter Cost Overhead per