o.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks the disabled life cycle management policies of your GCP storage buckets.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Life cycle management policies help manage the life cycle of objects in your storage buckets, such as transitioning objects to different storage classes or deleting them after a certain period.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Implement life cycle management policies to optimize storage costs and manage object life cycles effectively.<\/p>","alibabacloud_analyticsdb_mysql.DBNodeClass":"DB Node Class","al.alert.nginx.500":"Nginx Access Logs 500 Errors","alert.mssql.database.dbm":"DB Mode: \"{{n0}}\".","shift.name.required":"Shift name should not be left empty","sdwan.sla.wan.link.title":"SDWAN SLA","aws.rds.proxy.client.connections.setup.failed.auth":"Client Connections Setup Failed Auth","aws.backup.copy.completion.time.min":"Minimum Copy Job Running Time","shape.ocpus":"OCPU Count","plugin.app.sap_abap.report.max.lock.exclusive":"Max Exclusive Locks","alibabacloud_ecs.memoryfreeutilization":"Memory Free Utilization","firehose.compression":"S3 Compression Format","alibabacloud_polardb.opensearch_indices_doc_number":"OpenSearch Indices Document Number","ecs.executive.arn":"Executive Role ARN","oci.fs.clone.root":"Clone Root","bulk.action.child.threshold.limit.message":"You can select up to 5000 child entities at a time for this bulk action.","vmware.vdi.cs.avg.tunneled.conn":"Avg. Tunneled Connections","global.pack.name":"Plan Name","amazon.sso.errorcode.11004":"Problem in Role Creation.","of365.avg.tele.conferences":"Avg Tele Conferences","db.query.plan.list.view":"List View","amazon.sso.errorcode.11003":"Problem in fetching AWS Accounts. Please try again.","standard.xeisv4.family.vcpus":"Standard XEISv4 Family vCPUs","alibabacloud_oss.MaxPutObjectE2eLatency":"Max Put Object E2e Latency","apminsight.application":"APM Insight Application","amazon.sso.errorcode.11002":"Access portal authentication failed.","