re used by IAM users to sign into the AWS management console. By deleting the unused IAM user or disabling the password you can add an extra layer of security to your AWS account.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Delete the inactive IAM user or disable the sign-in credentials.<\/p>","avg.hyperv.virtual.hypercalls":"Avg Virtual Processor Hypercalls","nw.hardware.voltage.sensor.problematic.state":"Alert when the voltage sensor is malfunctioning","oracle.db.metric.blocked.service.desc":"Blocked Services","msp.users.info":"Set up customer login access who can access the monitoring console.","cl.core.topn.limit.100":"Top 100","threshold.partition.used":"Used for Guest Disk exceeds","container.io.total.report":"Report for Container I/O Total","azure.extension.operations":"Allow Extension Operations","tencentcloud_cls.monitor.edit":"Edit Tencent Cloud - CLS Monitor","vmware.vdi.hv.min.vdesktops":"Min no. of Desktop Pools","icon.tsv":"TSV icon","oci.application.capacity.type":"OCI Application Capacity","oci.edge.policy.hc.method":"Health Check Method","global.cisco.aci.device":"Cisco ACI","cl.server.aupg.skip.docker.agent":"Upgrade skipped: Docker agent.","global.cluster.add.configuration":"Add Cluster Configuration","sdn.cambium.wireless.add.title":"Add Cambium Wireless","aws.memorydb.network.max.bytes.out":"Network Max Bytes Out","ds.vm.not.monitored":"Not Monitored","urlform.internallocation.addprobe":"Add On-Premise Poller","webtransaction.naming.use.requesturl":"Use complete URL for naming","dbinsight.locks.reads":"Locks Reads","iis.app.min.req.timeout":"Min Request Timeout","plugin.mysql.last.IO.errno":"Last IO Errno","oci.bs.is.warn":"Notify When Backend Set Health Status is Warning","apminsight.younggc.time":"Young GC Time","sla.best.response.time":"Best in Class Response Time","tencentcloud_es.EsVip":"Es Vip","cl.nw.topology.maps":"Topology Maps","plugin.help.prestodb":"Gain visibility into PrestoDB query execution, cluster performance, and resource usage.",