>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks if the RDS event subscriptions for instance source type has Security Patching event category included.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>RDS DB instances occasionally require operating system updates to improve database performance and overall security posture. Using event subscriptions, you can set up email or text alerts to get notified as soon as an update becomes available. You can use these alerts to plan for updates that may be required to help you meet your compliance obligations.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Consider subscribing to the security patching event category for instance source type.<\/p>","apminsight.threads.tableview.column.usertime":"User Time (ms)","msk.broker.net.rx.packets":"Network Rx Packets","amazon.elb.http.directs":"HTTP Redirect Count","alert.csscount.exceeded":"CSS count  {{n0}}","coutrycode.us":"US","global.action.restart.app.services":"Restart App Services","wincls.quorum.own.changed":"Quorum Owner Changed","coutrycode.uk":"UK","rum.global.pageviews.consumed":"Consumed Pageviews","aws.cognito.app.client.type":"Cognito App Client Capacity","winupdate.chart.title.updates":"Pending Updates","settings.industry":"Industry","vmware.vdi.vd.min.idle.duration":"Min. Idle Duration","direct.connect.issue.time":"LOA Issue time","server.load.1min":"1 Min Load Average","oci.vcn.nsg.ingress.rules":"Number of Ingress Rules","custom.report.four.digits":"4 digits","cl.nw.san.iscsi.title":"iSCSI","of365.max.shp.freesitesize":"Max Free Site Size","cl.dhcp.reserved.ip.count":"Total Reserved Resources","ecs.requires.attributes":"Requires Attributes","practice.aws.lambda.use.latest.runtime.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p> Checks if the runtime used for Lambda functions are deprecated or not.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p> AWS Lambda runtime (execution) environment is nothing but a container built based on the configuration settings while creating your Lambda function. Lambda deprecates a runtime when support for a component of the runtime is disabled in security updates. With the latest runtime, you can benefit from new features and enhancements, security, performance, and reliability.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p> Utilize the latest runtime to leverage the best security improvements, reducing the risk of bugs and vulnerabilities in your Lambda function.<\/p>","ds.snapshot.space.splitup":"Snapshots by Virtual Machines","oci.info.realm.domain":"Enter the second-level realm domain of your OCI Dedicated Region or Alloy environment (e.g., example.com).","app.ibm_i.report.heading.system.count":"Average System Count","azure.bgp.override":"BGP Override","azure.metric.Average_VirtualSharedMemory.disp":"Virtual Shared Memory","plugin.tcp.udp.connection":"TCP UDP Connections","internal.protocol.forwarding.rules.per1":"Internal Protocol Forwarding Rules per Peering Group","practice.azure.aks.configure.authorized.ip.range":"Azure Kubernetes Service - Authorized IP range","alibabacloud_mongodb.shardingrecipientchunkstarts":"Sharding Recipient Chunk Starts","server.overall.diskfree":"Overall Disk Free Space","practice.kube.child.memrequests.desc":"Configure memory requests to workloads","report.mail.alibabacloud_ipv6_gateway.desc":"Ipv6 Gateway","azure.extension.profile":"Extension Profile","threshold.availability.kubernetes.node":"Performance Thresholds for Kubernetes Node","azure.metric.mongocollectioncreate.desc":"Mongo Collection Created","nw.fan.sensor.down":"Fan Sensor {{n0}} is down","aws.tg.bytes.out":"Bytes Out","apminsight.error.rate":"Error Rate","msexchange.rpc.restime":"RPC Response time","ec2.agent.mailer.restart":"Restart the agent","alibabacloud_apsaramq_kafka.instancerebalancetimev2":"Instance Rebalance Time V2","aws.org.account.is.suspended.reason":"Account Suspended in the AWS Organizational Unit.","practice.elb.with.unhealthy.instances":"ELB with unhealthy instances","huaweicloud_dcaas_vintf.bgp_asn":"Bgp Asn","sdn.mist.ap.mem.used.kb":"Mem