configuration for Amazon Redshift and identifies clusters where database encryption is disabled.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>When you enable encryption for a data warehouse cluster, the data blocks, query results, system metadata and cluster snapshots are all encrypted using industry standard AES-256 ciphers.You can enable encryption to protect data at rest and to comply with data protection guidelines.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Enable encryption for clusters that contain sensitive data to keep your data secure.<\/p>","apminsight.finaliser.thread.struck":"Finalizer Thread 'Stuck' - Memory Problems","al.fields.definition":"Fields can be defined in the Log pattern by the following syntax","oci.mounttarget.export.state.notify":"Export State Failed","huaweicloud_apig.output_throughput":"Output Throughput","al.servers.select":"Select Servers","escalation.contact.group":"Escalation Contact Group","sftp.bytesin.avg.mb":"Bytes In-Average","predefined.report.17.name":"APM GC & Thread Health","alibabacloud_rds.mysql_innodblogwrites":"MySQL InnoDB Log Writes","alibabacloud_oss.ClientOtherErrorRate":"Client Other Error Rate","azure.foundry.connection.shared":"Shared to all","edit.azure.resource.aks":"Edit Azure Kubernetes Service","cl.nw.ucs.blade_server_component.monitor":"Blade Server Component Monitor","grpc.configuration":"gRPC Configuration","rum.source.upload.formtitle":"File(s) Upload","hyperv.snapshot.filesize.exceeds":"Hyper-V Snapshots Threshold Configuration","plugin.app.glassfish.report.min.freemem":"Min Free Memory","hyperv.vmnet.alert.bytesreceivepersec.exceeds":"Bytes Receive Per Sec in \"{{n0}}\" Virtual Network Adapter  {{n1}}.","dashboard.netflow.deviceflow.widget":"NetFlow - Flow Type","cl.ipam.help.asstnt.box1.intro":"IP address management (IPAM) scans a subnet to check the status of IP addresses and track IP utilization in that subnet.","vmware.vdi.hv.vdesktops.rds.enabled":"Number of RDS Desktop Pools in Enabled State","alibabacloudf