ess token expiration","commvault.commandcenter.username.help.text":"The user must have administrator privilege to access the Commvault Command Center.","cl.ncm.timeout":"Timeout (ms)","client.marketing.oci.igw.noresource":"Oops, looks like there are no monitored Internet Gateway. This may be because of one or more of the following reasons:","huaweicloud_waf.access_status":"Access Status","oci.postgres.db.read_latency_primary_role.avg":"Average Read Latency (Replica)","subscriptions.size.rum.25M":"25M RUM Pageviews","nutanix.virtual.disk.indiv.controller.iops.exceeds":"Current I/O operations per second for the virtual disk \"{{n0}}\" exceeds {{n1}} count/sec.","threshold.availability.azurecosmostable":"Performance Thresholds for Azure Cosmos DB for Table","reports.hyperv.switch.packetspersec":"Avg Virtual Switch Packets","azure.vm.extension.installation":"VM Extension Installation","al.db.zm.mt.nopass":"Mettings Without Passwords","azure.metric.volumeconsumedsizepercentage.desc":"Percentage Volume Consumed Size","cl.job.title.tip":"The role in your company helps us to understand and advise you better. You can fill this field later via the Edit User form (Admin > User & Alert Management > Users & Alerts).","kube.pod.down":"Pod is Down","practice.gcp.vpc.unrestricted.ftp.access.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks for firewall rules that allow unrestricted access to FTP ports (TCP ports 20 and 21).<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Unrestricted FTP access from the internet poses significant security risks because FTP transmits credentials and data in plaintext. This can lead to credential theft, unauthorized data access, and potential data breaches. FTP also lacks modern authentication and encryption capabilities.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Restrict FTP access to specific trusted IP ranges or migrate to more secure file transfer protocols, like SFTP or FTPS. Consider implementing a VPN for secure access to file transfer services.<\/p>","amazon.autodiscover.help.text":"<div class=\"wt_url\"><p>Rediscovery will check your AWS account for any new changes made. By using the Rediscovery interval, you can configure how frequently you want Site24x7 to query your AWS service.<\/p><p> Our AWS infrastructure monitoring currently supports, three modes of rediscovery intervals.<\/p><ul><li> <b>Default polling<\/b>: Regions with Amazon services will be polled every 5 minutes, and for other supported regions polling interval will be 1 hour.<\/li><li> <b>Fewer polling<\/b>: Regions with Amazon services will be polled every 5 minutes, and for other supported regions polling interval will be 6 hour.<\/li><li> <b>Never<\/b>: No rediscovery will be made for any Amazon service at any region. The user will have to use the \"poll now\" option to initiate rediscovery.<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","al.lc.alert.frequency.option.4320":"Every 3 days","nutanix.threshold.read.data.disk":"Read Data Transferred from Disk","sftp.bytesin":"Bytes In","contact.group.empty.error":"Associate user to a User Alert Group to receive alert notifications","poller.ha.active":"Monitoring from Standby On-Premise Poller","gpu.monitor.metric.pcie_w.desc":"PCIe Link Width","thirdparty.zdesk.department.empty.error":"Department cannot be empty","resptime.cluster.by.location":"Cluster-based Availability Report by Location","sdn.cisco.sdwan.validator.serial.number":"Serial Number","practice.gcp.sql.backup.info.desc":"<h><b>Description : <\/b><\/h><p><ul><li>Automated backups ensure the protection of your valuable data by creating regular, scheduled backups of your Cloud SQL databases.<\/li><li>In case of accidental data loss, database corruption, or other unforeseen issues, you can easily restore your data to a previous state.<\/li><\/ul><\/p>","custom.report.view.by.tooltip":"For the selected Time Period, choose daily, weekly, or monthly intervals to view data in a more granular timeframe.","cl.ncm.template.backup.startup.configuration":"Add Backup Startup Configuration","aws.redshift.query.duration":"Query Duration","user.management.write.delete.caution.msg":"A user with restricted permissions can add a new user with full access. <a href=\"https://support.site24x7.com/portal/en/kb/articles/faq-custom-role\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more.<\/a>","azure.metric.StorageSyncSyncSessionAppliedFilesCount.disp":"Files Synced","amazon.permission.appsync":"\"appsync:List*\" and \"appsync:Get*\"","practice.oci.bucket.oci.bucket.logging.disabled":"OCI Storage Bucket - Logging Disabled","addon.advanced.needed":"Advanced Additional Checks Needed :","rdspi.db.sql.parse.count.hard":"Parse Count Hard","cl.core.topn.limit.200":"Top 200","ncm.option.config.all":"All Configuration Changes","edit.apminsight.application":"Edit APM Insight Application","template.display.name.required":"Display name is required","al.lprof.s3.prefix.info":"A prefix functions like a folder. The prefix can contain multiple folders separated by slashes. Ex: Logs/S247/SysLog. Mention the name of the folder from which the logs should be collected.This is an optional field.","aws.settings.displayname.info":"If yes, the display name will be the same as that of the name tag of the specific resource.","threshold.availability.azuremanagedclusters":"Performance Thresholds for Azure Kubernetes Service","jsp.tools.regex-parser.keywords":"\"online regex parser, regex debugger, tester, regex, debugger, regex validator\"","alibabacloud_ecs.groupgpumemoryfreespace":"Group GPU Memory Free Space","msp.search.query.error.too.many.criteria":"Invalid query: more than 3 criteria are not allowed.","aws.agentcore.policy.decisions":"Policy Decisions","practice.azure.aks.disk.cmk.encryption":"Azure Kubernetes Service - Disk CMK encryption","shrpt.oss.aliasloaded":"Loaded Aliases","huaweicloud_rds_sqlserver.rds050_disk_write_throughput":"Disk Write Throughput","avg.oci.vcn.nsg.usage":"Average Network Security Group Usage","aws.agentcore.browser.arn":"Browser ARN","sdn.fmg.fortigate.min.sessio