art Access Tracking","of365.chart.total.users":"Users","rdspi.db.sql.questions":"Questions","huaweicloud_sfs_turbo.tab.iops":"IOPS & Connections","threshold.apps.failed":"Failed Requests Exceeds","digitalocean_load_balancer.redirect_http_to_https":"Redirect Http To Https","commvault.commandcenter.num.of.commservers":"No. of CommServers","cl.server.aupg.skip.kubernetes.agent":"Upgrade skipped: Kubernetes agent.","cl.nw.storage.logicalinterface.down.reason":"The Logical Interface is Down","global.vmware":"VMware","cl.nw.monitor.template.feature.eigrp":"EIGRP","alibabacloud_polardb.opensearch_fs_io_total_write_operations":"OpenSearch FS IO Total Write Operations","huaweicloud_nosql_mongo.monitor.edit":"Edit Huawei Cloud GeminiDB Mongo Monitor","direct.connect.bytes.title":"Connection Bytes Activity","global.threshold.poll.value":"Poll Value","subscriptions.widget.upgrade.info.customer":"You've reached the allowed license limit for Customers. Please purchase additional add-ons to add more customers. Note that you\u2019ll receive eight complimentary basic monitors with every add-on that you purchase. Also, this transaction (pro-rata billing) will be completed on a single click using your current payment method with us.","alerts.actions.history":"Executed Actions History","global.pdf":"PDF","alert.brokenlinkcount.exceeded":"Broken Link count  {{n0}}","help.valkey.help.doc.link":"<a href=\"{{help}}/aws/elasticache-valkey-integration.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Learn more<\/a>","oci.waf.origin.bandwidth":"Bandwidth - Module: origin","bgp.list.hijacks":"Hijacks","msg.cert.rc4.impact":"The RC4 vulnerability can enable attackers to capture network traffic, decrypt messages from those networks, and access related cookies.","network.disform.plugin.enabled":"Please wait till the Network Module of this On-Premise Poller is up.","al.db.gl.issue.reopen":"ReOpened Issues","cl.ipam.ip.transient":"IP in transient","ncm.compliance.add.sub.block":"Add Sub-block Identifier","plugin.help.mysql":"Monitor, track and visualize performance metrics from your MYSQL databases, along with your other applications.","mssql.min.ltt":"Min Transaction Time","global.switcher.cloudspend":"CloudSpend","threshold.availability.privateca":"Performance Thresholds for GCP Certificate Authority Service","azure.metric.nginxconnaccepted.desc":"Accepted connections","vcloud.vapp.storage.gb":"Storage (GB)","akamai_cloud_vpc.monitor.add":"Add Akamai Cloud VPC Monitor","client.marketing.glb.extra":"If you have disabled discovery and want Site24x7 to monitor your Gateway Load Balancers, then click on the Edit Integrated AWS Account button shown below, scroll down to the Discovery Options section, select the check box next to the Elastic Load Balancer listing and click on Save.","ec2.ebs.read.bytes":"EBS Read Bytes","aws.agentcore.memory.item.counts":"Events Created and Records Extracted","oci.apigw.status.category.bytes.received.chart":"Bytes Received by Status Category","continuous.import.csv":"CSV","xen.storage.physical.utilization":"Physical Utilization(GB)","max.hyperv.virnet.packetsreceive.persec":"Max Virtual Network Adapter Packets Received Per Sec","global.xenserver.vm":"XenServer VM","mysqldb.database.metric.datasize":"Data Size","gcp.title.l4proxy.egress.bytes":"L4 Proxy NLB Egress Bytes","mail.followup.activity.content.2":"<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><p>Hi,<\/p><p>Hope you&#39;re doing great. {{n2}} <br>How has the experience been so far?<\/p><p>I quickly want to circle back and understand if you have any issues using any of the features. Reach out to me for any as or concerns.<\/p><p>If you want to learn more about our product, participate in our live product demo for free by <a href=\"https://{{n1}}/request-demo.html\">registering here<\/a>. We also have an interesting line-up of webinars on various topics for you, <a href=\"https://{{n1}}/webinars.html\">Book your spot for free<\/a>.<\/p><p>{{n0}}<\/p>","oci.obc.capacity.type":"OCI Outbound Connector Capacity Monitor","mail.followup.activity.content.1":"<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><p>Hi,<\/p><p>How&#39;re you doing? I&#39;m {{n0}} from Site24x7 support, and I&#39;ll be your point of contact during your evaluation period.<\/p><p>Reach out to me if you have any questions or concerns.<\/p><p>In the meanwhile, here are some quick links to help you get started.<br><br>{{n4}}<\/p><p>Join our live product demo for free by <a href=\"https://{{n2}}/request-demo.html\">registering here<\/a>. We also have an interesting line-up of webinars on various topics for you, <a href=\"https://{{n2}}/webinars.html\">Book your spot for free<\/a>.<\/p>{{n5}}<p>{{n1}}<\/p>","azure.multiuser.authorization":"Multi-User Authorization","mail.followup.activity.content.4":"<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><p>Hi,<\/p><p>Your 30-day trial account will expire today.<\/p><p>If you do not upgrade now, {{n4}}.<\/p><p>Please log in to your account and upgrade now.<\/p><p><b>How to upgrade?<\/b><br> {{n3}} <br><br> If you have any concerns over pricing or if you would want an extension of your trial period, please let me know, I&#39;ll be glad to help.<\/p><p>For a detailed product demo <a href=\"https://{{n2}}/request-demo.html\">register here<\/a>.<\/p><p>{{n1}}<\/p>","mail.followup.activity.content.3":"<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><p>Hi,<\/p><p>How&#39;re you doing? <br> <br> {{n0}} <br> I think it is the right time to upgrade.<\/p><p><b>How to upgrade?<\/b><br> {{n1}} <br><\/p><p>You can also choose to upgrade using credit card, PayPal, or a purchase order.<\/p><p>If you have any pricing concerns, please let me know.<\/p><p>Participate in our live product demo for free by <a href=\"https://{{n2}}/request-demo.html\">registering here<\/a>.<\/p><p>{{n3}}<\/p>","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.search_load_one":"Search Load One","al.log.search.show":"View Logs","mail.followup.activity.content.6":"<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><p>Hi,<\/p><p>I see your trial period has expired and noticed you haven&#39;t chosen to upgrade.<\/p><p>Is there a specific reason for not upgrading your account? Do you think we could do things better and have you back on board?<\/p><p>Your concern is our priority, do let me know.<\/p><p>{{n0}}<\/p>","mid.server.install.steps":"Steps To Install Nexus Gateway","mail.followup.activity.content.5":"<p>Hello,<\/p><p>We hope you had a good experience with {{n0}}. This is to notify you that your account will expire today.<\/p><p>Username: {{n1}}<\/p>This means you shall be switched to our \"<b>FREE PLAN<\/b>\" which would {{n2}}<p>Upgrading now would probably be a great idea.<\/p><p>Please let us know if you want an extension on your free trial.<\/p>{{n3}}<p>{{n4}}","al.db.auth0.attack.pro":"Attack Protection Events","ad.security.accmanager.down":"Security Account Manager Service is down","azure.metric.clusterautoscalerclustersafetoautoscale.desc":"Cluster Health","aws.fsx.volume.creation.failed":"The Volume Status is either Failed or Misconfigured","mssql.elc.report":"Error Log Files Count Report","rum.ca.sample.payload":"Sample Payload","bulk.action.child.threshold.parent.missing":"Some selected rows are missing parent monitor mapping. Re-run the filter and try again.","cl.nf.credform.info.ssh.username":"The Secure Shell user name.","avg.of365.lync.audio.sessions":"Avg Audio Sessions","amazon.s3.put.request":"Put Requests","aws.waf.condition.id":"Condition ID","global.reboot.destination.monitors":"Select Hosts for Reboot Action Execution","vmware.vdi.mdp.label.totalmachines":"Total Machines of Manual Desktop Pools","slo.description.help.text":"Provide description for your SLO.","cl.nw.ucs.fabric_extender.switch.portsoper.statelinkdown":"Fabric Extender Switch Portsoper Statelinkdown","cl.nw.ucs.rack_server.cpu.cores.enabled":"Rack Server CPU Cores Enabled","mobile.conf.outgages.tab.name":"OUTAGES AND HEALTH STATUS","sqlagdb.log.send.queue":"Log Send Queue","ncm.compliance.configuration.condition.label":"Condition","alibabacloud_rds.mysqlcomins