utdown notifications.<br><br>Note: To prevent false alerts due to any ISP issues at our multi-homed data centers, Site24x7 has heartbeat receiving capability spread across two different data centers. Get the agent installed now!","biztalkserver.primaryreceivelocation":"Primary Receive Location","capacity.max.downtime":"Maximum Downtime","wincls.cluster.name":"Cluster Name","aws.ddb.transaction.openmax.sum.avg":"Average Transaction Open(Max) Sum","hyperv.vmnet.alert.bytesdropped.exceeds":"Bytes Dropped in \"{{n0}}\" Legacy Network Adapter  {{n1}}.","azure.metric.xregionreplicationrelationshiptransferring.desc":"Volume Replication Transferring","huaweicloud_dcaas.tab.Traffic":"Traffic","msp.bulk.add.update":"Append or Overwrite","azure.delete.monitors":"Delete Azure Monitors","oci.apigw.backend.200.backend.http.responses":"Backend 200 Backend HTTP Responses","of365.servicehealth.auth":"Microsoft Service Health Report","kube.daemonset.rule.name":"Filter DaemonSets for Addition based on Name","latency.packetloss.chart.header":"Packet Loss Between On-Premise Pollers (%)","bgp.threshold.leak.count.help":"Alert when the number of detected BGP route leaks exceeds this value","api.restapi.version3.desc":"Site24x7 REST APIs uses the OAuth 2.0 protocol to authorize and authenticate calls. The OAuth protocol provides a more secure access to protect resources, thereby reducing the hassle of asking for a username and password every time a user logs in.","alibabacloud_ehpc.noderunjobsbyqueue":"Node Running Jobs by Queue","aws.asg.avg.working.storage.percent.used":"Average Wroking Storage Percent","gcp.quota.monitoring.limit":"GCP Monitoring Quota Limit","azure.metric.gatewayratelimitthrottledcount.desc":"Throttled requests count","apminsight.helpcard.description.two":"Identify slow applications and monitor individual traces invoked by a single web request.","postgresql.metric.autovacuumworkerutilization.desc":"Autovacuum worker utilization","huaweicloud_gaussdb.gaussdb_mysql118_in