nnections","global.multi.platform.dc":"Multi Platform Datacollection","aws.valkey.search.used.memory.bytes":"Search Used Memory Bytes","alibabacloud_apsaradb_tair.shardingtotalcommandsprocessed":"Sharding Total Commands Processed","practice.underutilized.amazon.redshift.clusters.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks the performance counters for Amazon Redshift and identifies clusters that appear to be underutilized.<\/p><p><b>Description : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks the performance counters of running Amazon Redshift clusters and flags them as idle if they meet the following criteria:<ul><li>The average number of database connection is less than 10 for the last 7 days.<\/li><li>The cluster-wide CPU utilization is less than 5% for the last 7 days.<\/li><li>The average number of read and write operations across the cluster is less than \"x\" for the last 7 days.<\/li><\/ul><\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>For Amazon Redshift you pay an hourly rate based on the type and number of nodes in your cluster. If your cluster is receiving minimal connections or is consuming meager amounts of CPU you can consider downsizing or termination.<br>(Note: Take a final snapshot before you shutdown the cluster).<\/p>","global.upgrade.website.monitoring":"{{n0}} Websites<br>(at 10 min. interval.)","gcp.metric.internalegressbytescount.desc":"Egress bytes per internal TCP/UDP load balancer","alibabacloud_oss.cdn_recv":"CDN Recv","global.concurrent.operations.per.project":"Global Concurrent Operations per Project","monitorgroup.directmonitors.no.matching":"No matching monitors found","aws.cognito.user.pool.device.tracking":"Remember user devices","cl.nw.ucs.chassis_utilization.managing.inst":"Chassis Utilization Managing Inst","website.defacement.how.it.works":"Once the monitor is setup, the monitoring engine checks each web page consecutively twice to identify the content modification threshold and automatically configures it. It baselines a version and uses it for the future 