,"server.msexchange.hub.edge.report":"Report for Edge SMTP Connections","practice.oci.security.list.unrestricted.inbound.info.desc":"<p><b>Baseline : <\/b><\/p><p>Checks whether Security Lists allow unrestricted inbound traffic from all sources.<\/p><p><b>Description :<\/b><\/p><p>An unrestricted inbound rule permits all traffic from any source, significantly expanding the attack surface of resources in the Subnet.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation :<\/b><\/p><p>Restrict inbound Security List rules to required ports and trusted source IP ranges.<\/p>","oci.private.key.reupload":"Re-upload PEM File","aws.dlm.ebs.snapshot.summary.report.title":"DLM - EBS Snapshot - Summary Report","oci.edge.policy.recommendations.period.in.days":"Recommendations Period (Days)","rdspi.os.loadaverageminute.fifteen":"Load Average (15 Minutes)","aci.tenant.status":"Tenant Status","akamai_cloud_database.replication_type":"Replication Type","add.aci.mon":"Add Cisco ACI Monitor","plugin.filebeat":"Filebeat","mid.server.group.name":"Nexus Gateway Group Name","aws.cloudwatch.logs.subscription.filter.tab":"Subscription Filter","dmfw.unit.countpersec":"Count/sec","alibabacloud_polardb.clusterotherlocksession":"Cluster Other Lock Session","alibabacloud_ehpc.jobrequiredmembyuser":"Job Required Memory by User","alibabacloud_oss.CompactionBytesProcessed":"Compaction Bytes Processed","shrpt.app.visio.requestprocessingtime":"Request Processing Time","aws.ddb.cursors.max.chart.title":"Database Cursors Max","oci.app.throttled.responses":"Throttled Responses","xen.sr.name":"Storage Repository Name","velocloud.packet.loss.rx.max.avg":"Average Max Packet Loss Rx","aws.cache.arn":"Cache Arn","alibabacloud_analyticsdb_mysql.executor_avg_read_bytes_mb":"Executor Average Read Bytes (MB)","az.title.servicebus.usererrors":"User Errors","ca.threshold.profile.help.text":"Threshold profiles help the alarms engine to decide if a specific resource has to be declared critical or down?Configure Downtime Rules to reduce false alerts.","time.of.absolute.expiry":"Time of Absolute Expiry","al.db.gcp.deleted.pods":"Deleted Pods","cl.server.ter.mute.al.info":"Switch the toggle to Yes to suppress alerts if the agent detects that the cloud instance has been either marked for termination or terminated. Note: Supported from Windows agent version 22.2.00 and Linux agent version 22.3.00.","azure.entra.user.company.name":"Company Name","digitalocean.authtype.header.desc.3":"<div>1. Sign in to <a href=\"http://cloud.digitalocean.com/login\">DigitalOcean console<\/a> <\/div><div>2. Go to <b>API Settings<\/b> > <b>Left panel<\/b> > <b>API<\/b> > <b>Tokens<\/b> > <b>Generate New Token<\/b><\/div><div>3. Create <b>Personal Access Token<\/b> (PAT)<\/div><div>4. Ensure all prerequisites are met: <br>(a) Provide <b>Read<\/b> permission (sufficient for monitoring). <br>(b) DigitalOcean account with Resource Viewer permissions. <br>(c) API access enabled. <br>(d)Access to DigitalOcean Control Panel or Developer API<\/div><div>5. Click <b>Generate Token<\/b> <i>IMPORTANT: Copy and store the token securely. It cannot be viewed again. <\/i><\/div>","emr.missing.blocks":"Missing Blocks","digitalocean.authtype.header.desc.2":"<div>1. In DigitalOcean, navigate to <b>API<\/b> > <b>OAuth Applications<\/b> > <b>Register Application<\/b>.<\/div><div>2. Save and securely store the Client ID and Client Secret.<\/div><div>3. In Site24x7, navigate to <b>Admin<\/b> > <b>Configuration Profiles<\/b> > <b>OAuth Providers<\/b> > <b>Add Provider<\/b>.<\/div><div>4. Use Authorization Code Flow and set endpoints: i. <a href=\"https://cloud.digitalocean.com/v1/oauth/authorize\">Authorization<\/a>  ii.  <a href=\"https://cloud.digitalocean.com/v1/oauth/token\">Token<\/a><\/div><div>5. Enter Client ID, Secret, and Redirect URI and then authorize to generate the access token and validate configuration.<\/div>","cl.nw.ucs.rack.server.vEthConnStatus":"V Eth Conn Status","oci.instance.pool.capacity.type":"Instance Pool","websphere.newmonitor.mode.text":"Deployment Mode of Websphere","rds.network.transmit.throughput":"Network Transmit Throughput","thirdparty.telegram.integration.level":"Choose the desired integration level to either push specific alerts from a monitor or all alerts from your Site24x7 account to the relevant Telegram channel.<br><br>Select <b>Monitors<\/b> and choose the desired monitor to send out alerts and RCA links from the selected monitor alone to your Telegram channel.<br><br>Select <b>All Monitors<\/b> to send out all Site24x7 alerts and RCA links to your desired Telegram channel.<br><br>Select <b>Tags<\/b> and choose the desired tag to send Site24x7 alerts and RCA links to your desired Telegram channel.","dashboard.widget.noc.empty.header":"Add NOC View","oci.apigw.stock_response.http.requests":"Stock Response Backend HTTP Requests","al.help.inline.plugin.intro":"To analyze log events along with performance metrics, you have to enable AppLogs so that Site24x7 can collect your logs. You can directly enable AppLogs from the Edit Plugins page.","days.thu":"Thursday","rum.events.custom.event":"Custom","avg.oci.vnic.egress.drops.throttle":"Average Egress Drops - Throttle","plugin.app.sap_abap.metric.dia.srv.users.logged.in":"Server Logged-in Users","cl.nw.ucs.port.tag.title":"UCS Port","amazon.elasticbeanstalk.environment.tier.name":"Environment Tier Name","tools.process.thread.count":"Thread Count","kube.node.al.cpu.per":"Allocatable CPU Percentage","global.subtitle.slo.report":"SLO Reports","apm.apm-insight.list.tour.1.addiconssubitem.apminsight.home.applications.right":"<div><h5>Add application<\/h5><div>Choose your application platform and get started with the corresponding APM Insight agent. Initiate some transactions to view date in client<\/div><\/div>","mysqlndb.metric.overallddundologspacestotal.desc":"Sum Of Undo Logspace Size Allocated","mssql.chart.locks.title":"Lock Statistics","of365.avg.unlicenced.users":"Avg unlicenced users","oci.fs.metadata.iops":"Metadata IOPS","