age is less than 20% for at least 4 days in the last 7 days.<\/li><li>The average number of daily database connections is less than 100 for at least 4 days in the last 7days.<\/li><\/ul><\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>For Amazon RDS you pay for compute capacity by the hour your DB instance runs. If your DB instance is receiving fewer connections or is consuming meager amounts of CPU you can consider taking a snapshot and deleting the instance to reduce costs.<\/p>","nsx.alert.indiv.network.receiveddropped.exceeds":"Dropped while received for Network \"{{n0}}\"  {{n1}}","apminsight.memleak.object.tracking.duration.info":"Specify the duration to track the code path(s) that accessed the selected Memory Object","hyperv.total.pages":"Total Pages","al.lc.alert.users":"Select Users to Receive Log Collection Alerts","alibabacloud_fc.functionerrors":"Function Errors","jwt.empty.expiry.time":"Web Token refresh interval cannot be empty","threshold.availability.vertexai":"Vertex AI Capacity Threshold Profile","containers.activefile.memory.report":"Active File Memory Report","oci.drg.redundancy.status":"Redundancy Status","ba.funnel.threshold.min":"Please enter a number of 0 or higher","ordinal.st":"st","practice.gcp.function.enable.serverless.vpc.access.desc":"Checks Serverless VPC Access not configured functions are displayed below.","global.field.valid":"Enter a valid","proxmox.node.swap.usage":"Swap Usage","alibabacloud_apsaradb_lindorm.tsdb_disk_used":"TSDB Disk Used","guardduty.capacity.type":"GuardDuty Capacity","apminsight.helpcard.java.step":"<button ng-click={{n0}} class=\"btn-green-md\"><span class=\"icon icon-download txtwhite mrgtop3\"> <\/span> Download <\/button> and extract the agent zip file in the application server.","alibabacloud_mongodb.shardingcpusys":"Sharding CPU Sys","aws.waf.ruleratelimit":"Rate Limit","sdn.ubiquitiUnifi.ap.channel.util":"Channel Utilization","server.disk.usedspace":"Used Space","aws.sftp.stop":"Stop SFTP server","standard.dsv2