cks and exploitation attempts. RDP is a common target for threat actors seeking to gain unauthorized access to Windows systems.<\/p><p><b>Recommendation : <\/b><\/p><p>Restrict RDP access to specific trusted IP ranges or use more secure access methods like IAP or bastion hosts. Consider implementing additional security controls like multi-factor authentication for RDP access.<\/p>","device.buffer.miss.history":"Buffer Miss History","ad.app.max.nspi.search":"Max NSPI Searches","saas.application.livechat.desc":"Customer engagement and support software. Track the application's availability to guarantee seamless real-time communication with users.","avg.rds.writethroughput.text":"Average Bytes Written to disk","device.reports.average.txvolume":"Avg Tx Volume","global.monitoring.location.ips":"Site24x7's global website monitoring locations","gcporg.monitor.edit":"Edit GCP Organization Monitor","probe.thread.started":"Total Threads Started","rum.help.totalct.cdn.resources":"Total number of resources that are being loaded from the cdn domains.","dashboard.alarm.widgets":"Alarm Widgets","azure.configerror.resourcecount.other":"{{count}} Resources","server.monitor.winbackup.step3":"Once installation is complete, the agent will auto discover the Windows server and the Microsoft Windows server backup. The Windows server backup Monitor will be added in your Site24x7 account.","cl.nf.enable.password":"Enable Password","practice.azure.loadbalancer.probes.info.desc":"<h><b>Description : <\/b><\/h><p>To detect the backend point's health status, add health probes.<\/p>","azure.metric.IngressBandwidthUtilization.desc":"Ingress Link Bandwidth percentage utilization","huaweicloud_vpcep.vpcep_rx_pps":"Inbound Packet Rate","iis.reports.ses.sestimeout":"Report for Session Timeout","of365.lync.video.sessions.report":"Video Sessions Report","azure.disable.copy.paste":"Disable Copy Paste","iis.alert.apppoolclrt.contension.exceeds":"Threads Contentions of \"{{n0}}\"  {{n1}}.","rum.customperio